window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":5101,"title":"Chapter 5101: Infuriated","paragraphs":["Li Ronghuan was the first person to leave the Li family. He was a rebellious and incompetent person in the eyes of the world at that time. He liked to draw, so everyone thought that he was destined to achieve nothing. He was also the first son Old Master Li gave up on.","Now that he was 48 years old, he looked out of place even though he was wearing a navy blue suit.","He was talking to Second Old Madam Li. His calm tone angered Second Old Madam Li.","Madam! He called her ’Madam’ again! Was he reminding her of something?","\"Old Master, have a good chat with Ronghuan. I won’t stand here and be an eyesore.\" Second Old Madam Li wouldn’t tolerate being looked down on by the children left behind by the first wife.","In the past, she had endured enough. Now that she was the madam of the Li family, did she still need to look at the bastard left behind by the first wife?","Li Ronghuan pursed his lips and smiled faintly. \"I haven’t seen you for 18 years, but your temper has gotten worse. When you were young, you were so gentle. Why did you become so hot-tempered when you got old? It seems that handling family matters must’ve been hard for you. It made you become a hot-tempered person.\"","Second Old Madam Li had already had a headache from Li Ronghuan’s words. Now that she heard his sarcastic words, Second Old Madam Li almost fainted from anger.","After all, she had experienced it before. Second Old Madam Li, who was so angry that she wanted to erupt into flames, did not show any dissatisfaction on her face. She only sighed helplessly. \"Ronghuan, you haven’t been home for 18 years. You should accompany the old master for a while. We’re family. Why are you angry?","\"If you don’t want to see me, I won’t appear in front of you. Don’t make the old master feel uncomfortable.\" After she finished speaking, she raised her hand to wipe the corners of her eyes and turned to return to her room.","As they needed to take care of the old master, they turned the guest room at the end of the first floor into the master bedroom.","Old Master Li’s expression was gloomy. Seeing that his second wife, who had accompanied him for decades, being angered by his second son and returning to her room, he slapped the armrest of the wheelchair. He shouted, \"Ronghuan, how could you talk to your mother like this? Apologize to your mother!\"","Second Old Madam Li turned around and returned to her room. There was a cold smile in her eyes, and her footsteps slowed down a little.","He wanted to fight with her?","In the past, he never won against her. Now, he wouldn’t be able to win against her either!","Li Ronghuan smiled casually. He didn’t take Old Master Li’s words seriously at all. \"Dad, my mother has been lying in the ground for decades. If you want me to apologize to my mother, I have to return to the Li family’s ancestral land.\"","Second Old Madam Li was so angry that she didn’t stay any longer and quickened her pace to return to her room.","No, no. She was worried about letting Li Ronghuan investigate Chuhai. She had to discuss it with her daughter. She had to make Old Master Li change his mind!","Before she could return to her room, she heard Li Ronghuan say with a smile, \"Alright, I won’t say anything else. I just didn’t expect the madam to become even more petty. She went back to her room immediately after I just said a few words. She wasn’t like this in the past. No matter what I said back then, she’d just admit that it was her fault and it had nothing to do with us.","\"Alas, time passed too quickly. I didn’t come back for 18 years, and she has changed with time.\"","The room door was closed gently. It seemed to be telling Old Master Li that Second Old Madam Li was not angry and just wanted to return to her room.","After Second Old Madam Li returned to her room, Li Ronghuan didn’t say anything else. Old Master Li didn’t force him to apologize either. He glanced at Li Ronghuan with his muddy eyes and said in a low voice, \"You, follow me to the study!\""]},{"number":5102,"title":"Chapter 5102: He’s Different","paragraphs":["Old Master Li was in a hurry to go to the study to avoid Li Jinnian upstairs, but he didn’t know that Li Jinnian had heard everything.","\"I heard that Jinnian is back. Where is he?\" Li Ronghuan pretended that he didn’t hear anything. He turned around and looked upstairs. \"Is he still sleeping upstairs? That brat. Doesn’t he know that his uncle is back?\"","On the second floor, Li Jinnian, who had been listening for a while, slowly retreated to his room. Right on the heels of that, he opened the door and closed it again. Then, he slowly walked toward the first floor.","Footsteps could be heard coming up the stairs. Old Master Li’s angry shout came from downstairs. \"Why do you care about an outsider? Uncle? In his eyes, our Li family is filled with outsiders!\"","Li Ronghuan turned a deaf ear to him. Instead, he quickened his pace. Before he reached the second floor, he stopped in his tracks and raised his head to look at the young man standing at the top of the stairs.","\"Jinnian, long time no see.\" Li Ronghuan, who had a look of surprise on his face, smiled. At 48 years old, he didn’t look old. He had the casual aura of an artist. Li Ronghuan was also the most similar to Old Madam Li. When he smiled, his eyes were even more curved. When he smiled, it made people feel that he had instantly become younger.","Li Jinnian looked at the middle-aged man who was smiling at him. He saw a sense of familiarity on the other party’s face. He realized that... he looked somewhat similar to Li Ronghuan.","He didn’t look like his father. He looked like his uncle!","Some past events surged like a tide. Li Jinnian couldn’t help but clench his fists tightly.","\"Old Master, I’m not being paranoid, but look at Jinnian. His nose and mouth... Why does he look so much like Ronghuan?\"","\"He really doesn’t look like the old master’s eldest son at all. The more I look at him, the more he looks like the old master’s second son. I’ve never seen a child that looks so much like his uncle.\"","\"That’s right. The first time I met him, I almost thought that it was Ronghuan’s child.\"","\"Aren’t there paternity tests that we can do now? Do you want to check? How can he look so much like his uncle?\"","With the spread of the rumors, his parents eventually had an argument about it. Later, a paternity test was done, and it was confirmed that he was not Li Ronghuan’s child.","Later on, there were fewer rumors, and his mother became more and more silent. In the end, she was terminally ill and passed away, leaving him alone to face the entire Li family.","It seemed that Li Ronghuan didn’t go home much at that time. Later, he left home completely. In Li Jinnian’s memory, the last time he met Li Ronghuan was 11 years ago. However, just now, he heard Li Ronghuan say that he hadn’t returned home for 18 years.","In that case, when he saw Li Ronghuan 11 years ago... was he the only one who saw him?","He didn’t say anything for a long time. There was still a hint of unfamiliarity in his eyes. The smile in Li Ronghuan’s eyes deepened. He smiled until there were a few wrinkles in his curved eyes. \"Good lad, don’t tell me you don’t even recognize your second uncle? I’m your second uncle, Li Ronghuan. Do you remember? Could it be that you’ve been so busy in the military unit that your memory has deteriorated?\"","He was very enthusiastic. As he spoke, there was a deep concern in his eyes. This made Li Jinnian, who had never received the care of the Li family, feel unfamiliar.","He slowly released his clenched fists and nodded. \"Second Uncle.\"","\"As it turns out, you still know that I’m your second uncle. It’s good that you didn’t forget. It’s good that you didn’t forget.\" The smile on Li Ronghuan’s face was much more real when he faced Li Jinnian. Old Master Li had never seen it.","Li Ronghuan’s gaze landed on the camouflage travel bag in Li Jinnian’s hand. The smile on his face disappeared. \"I just came back and you’re going back to the military unit?\""]},{"number":5103,"title":"Chapter 5103: He’s Different","paragraphs":["It had been 11 years since they last met. Li Jinnian looked at Li Ronghuan with an unfamiliar gaze. He was already unfamiliar with Li Ronghuan to begin with. Facing a stranger’s smile and concern, Li Jinnian instinctively treated him coldly.","Moreover, there was a huge problem with Li Ronghuan. As a soldier, Li Jinnian would keep a distance from him.","He nodded slightly and replied with only one word, \"Yes.\"","Downstairs, Old Master Li was so angry that he pushed the wheelchair to the staircase. He looked up and saw Li Jinnian standing on the second floor. He was looking at Li Ronghuan with a cold facial expression. Then, he saw Li Jinnian dismissing his uncle with a one-word response. Anger surged from his heart.","His withered hands kept hitting the armrest of the wheelchair as he reprimanded loudly, \"Is this the attitude a junior should have toward their elders? The Li family doesn’t owe you anything. Who are you showing your stern face to?\"","Li Jinnian was Old Master Li’s eldest grandson, but he had never received Old Master Li’s love. Not when he was young, let alone when he grew up.","Now that Old Master Li had picked a flaw in Li Jinnian, he reprimanded him even more impolitely.","\"Ronghuan, let him go. Our humble Li family can’t accommodate a big shot like him!\" With that, Old Master Li turned his wheelchair and moved to the side of the stairs. He raised his finger and looked at the door with deep hatred in his eyes. \"Get lost! Get lost now! Don’t ever return to the Li family’s residence again. The Li family doesn’t have an unfilial descendant like you! Get lost!\"","Li Jinnian, who was standing on the second floor, looked down at the exasperated old man below. He just wanted him to get out of the Li family as soon as possible. After not seeing the old master for more than two years, he had aged a lot. He was old, but his heart was still unconvinced. Even his eyes were unconvinced that he was old. They were still filled with the viciousness from when he was younger.","Li Jinnian didn’t want to return to the Li family’s residence either. Unless it was absolutely necessary, he didn’t want to step into this old residence that made him feel dirty.","When he retracted his gaze, Li Jinnian’s gaze seemed to pass over Li Ronghuan’s face unintentionally. He looked down and saw that his second uncle, who had his back facing Old Master Li, was clenching his fists. As for his facial expression... He was expressionless.","They climbed down the stairs from the second floor. Just as the two of them were about to brush past each other, Li Ronghuan suddenly reached out and grabbed the strap of Li Jinnian’s travel bag. He smiled and said, \"Let’s go. I’ll send you. Are you going to the airport or the train station? A bus station is fine too.\"","\"Li Ronghuan! You, you, you...\" Old Master Li, who was downstairs, was so angry that his hands were trembling. \"Why would you send him off? This bastard...\"","Li Ronghuan, who was secretly competing with Li Jinnian to take over the duffel bag, turned around and said to Old Master Li, who was trembling with anger, \"Dad, the doctor said that your blood pressure is high and you need to rest. Why do you always get angry over small matters?","\"Jinnian is my nephew and your eldest grandson. By scolding him, you’re scolding yourself too. Let the madam take care of you. I haven’t seen Jinnian in so long. I want to have a chat with him.\"","In the master bedroom, Second Old Madam Li was on the phone with her daughter. When she heard the angry shouts outside, she continued with a cold expression, \"Li Ronghuan has been scheming since he was young. Back then, you and Chuhai suffered a lot at his hands. This time, he suddenly came back, and your father even handed the investigation of Chuhai’s death to him. I’m really worried.","\"Chenglan, you have to come home when you’re free. Persuade your father and see if he can get you to investigate secretly or let Yuan investigate.\"","Li Yuan, who was sitting beside Madam Li, waved his hand. Madam Li glanced at her son and replied in a low voice, \"Mom, don’t be anxious. I’ll find time to go home as soon as possible. There are still guests at home. I won’t chat with you for the time being. I’ll call you later.\""]},{"number":5104,"title":"Chapter 5104: It’s Dirty Here","paragraphs":["Hearing that her daughter had a guest, Second Old Madam Li immediately hung up without saying anything else. The Li family was secretly investigating Li Chuhai’s death. She didn’t want others to know unintentionally.","Madam Li hung up, and her expression darkened. \"Yuan, what did you want to say to me?\"","\"Mom, don’t agree to Grandma’s request. Uncle is not a simple person. I met many troubles when I went to settle Uncle’s company. It was Uncle who helped me solve them.","\"Although he’s a painter, he knows many people. I had many problems on my side that I couldn’t resolve. In the end, it was all solved by a phone call from Uncle.","\"Grandma is asking you to make a move, but I don’t want you to fall out with Uncle because of Grandma.\"","After Madam Li heard this, her expression gradually improved. She thought that something big had happened.","\"Your uncle’s connections are your grandfather’s connections. It has nothing to do with your uncle.\" After Madam Li finished speaking, she immediately stood up. \"Come back to the Li family’s residence with me. Your uncle happens to be here. Let’s go and see him.\"","\"Why are you meeting him? I just met him.\" Li Yuan didn’t want to go. Although his surname was Li, his grandfather and grandmother didn’t really treat him as a member of the Li family. Every time he went to the Li family, he would feel very awkward.","Madam Li didn’t force her son. Li Yuan was already 27 years old this year. It was useless to force him. She rushed back to the Li family’s residence to see Li Ronghuan, but Li Ronghuan was sending Li Jinnian back to the Fu family’s residence. Old Master Li was panting in anger.","After knowing that Li Jinnian was returning to the Fu family’s residence, Li Ronghuan, who was starting the car, paused for a moment before returning to normal. \"You grew up with the Fu family and have a deeper relationship with them. As for the Li family...\"","His gaze passed past Li Jinnian, who was sitting in the front passenger seat. Then, it passed through the car window and landed on the Li family’s old residence that was built during the Republic of China. His eyes turned cold.","\"Only those people with dirty hands are willing to stay in the Li family. You should go back to wherever you grew up. Don’t let this dirty place dirty you.\" Even his voice was filled with coldness.","The car started moving. Li Ronghuan didn’t speed up immediately. He stopped the car under the leaves of a hundred-year-old tree in front of the Li family’s old residence. Li Ronghuan pulled the handbrake and took out a box of cigarettes from the car door. He took out one cigarette and asked Li Jinnian, \"Do you want to smoke?\"","Facing Li Ronghuan’s strange actions, Li Jinnian, who was calm, shook his head.","The sound of a lighter could be heard from the small car room. A pure blue flame was strung up, and a faint smell of smoke wafted over. In the end, the entire car room smelled of smoke.","After taking a few puffs, Li Ronghuan held the cigarette between his fingers and glanced at his nephew from the corner of his eyes. After staring at him for a few seconds, he saw that the other party didn’t even frown. He couldn’t help but laugh. \"Jinnian, you’re really good at keeping a low profile. You were able to keep a low profile when you were young, but you’re even better now that you’ve grown up.","\"Back then, you were so young...\" He gestured in the car. \"You were seven years old, right? You were like a radish. You carried the noodles that the mistress had deliberately mixed with rat poison for the old man to eat. I saw you staring at the mistress mixing in the poison with my own eyes. I also saw you secretly rummaging through the trash can and looking for the packaging. At that time, I wondered if you would expose the truth with the packaging. Who knew...\"","Recalling the past, the coldness in Li Ronghuan’s eyes deepened. It was already the end of spring, and the last bit of coldness in the season had passed, but there was still a chill in the car that made people’s hearts tremble."]},{"number":5105,"title":"Chapter 5105: Vicious Person","paragraphs":["Li Jinnian, who was sitting in the front passenger seat, didn’t even frown. It was as if he was listening to a story that had nothing to do with him.","However, there was a hint of darkness in the depths of his cold black eyes.","Li Ronghuan took a deep breath of smoke and slowly blew out smoke rings. He extinguished the cigarette butt and then looked at the entrance of the Li family’s old residence. He smiled slightly. \"In order to make all of us leave the Li family, she even dared to make use of a seven-year-old child like you. It’s been decades. It’s time to settle the scores with them.\"","The car was cold and gloomy.","Li Jinnian was unmoved. He remembered everything that happened when he was young. He remembered being coaxed by Old Madam Li into carrying out a bowl of noodles meant for Old Master Li that she had mixed rat poison into. It was his birthday.","Just as Old Master Li was about to eat it, Li Chenglan suddenly rushed up and threw the bowl of noodles on the ground. She pointed at his nose and shouted angrily, \"Dad, he drugged this bowl of noodles! Jiayi saw it. This is the wrapper Jiayi picked up!\"","Smack!","A slap immediately landed on his face. Old Master Li, who was still smiling a moment ago, became ferocious in the next second. \"You want to poison me? How can you be so sinister at such a young age? You even want to poison your grandpa!\"","What did he say at that time?","He didn’t say anything. He did want to poison his grandpa who caused his mother’s death. He knew that there was rat poison in the bowl, but he still brought it over. That was what he thought.","Slowly, he, the eldest grandson of the Li family, became the person Old Master Li hated the most. Right on the heels of that, rumors spread that he looked so much like Li Ronghuan. Was he born of adultery?","Even his biological father started to detest him. It didn’t take long for Li Jinnian to lose his status in the Li family. Later, he left the Li family and returned to the Fu family. From then on, he escaped from his misery.","Where did Li Ronghuan go?","He didn’t know.","After leaving the Li family, Li Jinnian didn’t pay attention to anything or anyone in the Li family.","That year, Li Ronghuan couldn’t even protect himself. He was bullied by his stepmother until he couldn’t even raise his head. Who knew where a person who couldn’t even protect himself went?","Now that Li Ronghuan was back and told him everything, Li Jinnian wasn’t tempted. He was only vigilant.","Li Jinnian’s expression was calm. He didn’t seem to have any emotions because of the past. He raised his hand and looked at the time. It was still early. He continued sitting calmly and let Li Ronghuan continue.","He needed to understand Li Ronghuan better, so he would let him talk more. When Li Ronghuan was done, it was time to get out of the car.","Li Jinnian didn’t say anything, but Li Ronghuan didn’t mind. His nephew had been good at planning since he was young. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have come out of the Li family alive. He even joined the military unit. He became a lieutenant colonel at such a young age.","It was equivalent to adding the most protective shield to himself. No matter how much Old Master Li hated him, he wouldn’t dare to do anything.","As for the mistress, she had been scheming at home. Who would give her the time of day outside?","No one.","Li Ronghuan lit a second cigarette for himself. Artists more or less had a smoking addiction. Li Ronghuan didn’t have a smoking addiction, but he wanted to take a puff now.","He didn’t need Li Jinnian to speak. He just had to listen. As a soldier, it wasn’t a good thing to have a loose mouth. Silence made him more mature.","Li Ronghuan was very happy."]},{"number":5106,"title":"Chapter 5106: Unified Trench","paragraphs":["The smell of smoke in the closed car got stronger. Li Jinnian finally made his first move after getting into the car. He lowered the car window and let the fresh air drift into the car.","His actions made Li Ronghuan laugh. \"You don’t smoke, right? Do you want me to put it out?\"","\"No need,\" Li Jinnian said calmly. Li Ronghuan laid on the steering wheel and laughed for a while,\" Fang said that you’re cold and a little strange. Yes, you’re a little strange, but I like it.\"","Fang...","Li Jinnian’s eyes suddenly turned sharp. His gaze was like a sharp arrow that shot at Li Ronghuan, who was still lying on the steering wheel. Li Ronghuan was waiting calmly with a teasing expression. \"Oh, you finally understand me. AFang is mine. Are you surprised? Hahaha...\"","He laughed loudly. Li Jinnian’s gaze returned to normal. The servant who had been keeping an eye on the Li family was actually a subordinate of his second uncle.","\"Back then, it wasn’t my sister-in-law who was indebted to him. I was the one who was indebted to him. Jinnian, Jinnian, there’s something wrong with you. You were too vigilant and made Fang spend a Herculean effort to gain your trust. That year, I came back to see you because I wanted to tell you that Fang was trustworthy. But before I could tell you, you were already speaking to Fang.\"","In other words, when he saw Li Ronghuan 11 years ago, he was actually here for him. Li Jinnian finally frowned.","Li Ronghuan was terrifying!","\"It was Fang who told me that you were coming back to the Li family this time. I know why you came back too.\" After laughing, Li Ronghuan looked at the face that looked like him. \"You’re similar to me because you’re like your grandmother. She deliberately spread rumors because you and I look like the person she’s most afraid of.","\"The place we’re at now is where the mistress pulled her illegitimate children to kneel in the heavy rain. In the past, this was the Li family’s residence. It was surrounded by high walls, and the corner of the wall was filled with magnolia trees. It was also your grandma’s favorite place to walk after dinner. Later, it became the last place your grandma wanted to go. After she had a miscarriage, she passed away.\"","This memory was Li Ronghuan’s deepest, most painful, and most hated memory. He would always remember that scene. He would also always remember that his mother had a miscarriage because of it. Less than half a year after she died, he went overseas to study.","\"When she entered the Li family and became the second madam of the Li family, all the magnolia trees were cut down. In the end, there were no traces of your grandmother left in the Li family. There was no trace of her at all.","\"I wanted to find a photo for you to see and let you know who you look like. I searched the entire Li family but didn’t find a single photo of your grandmother. All the photos were destroyed. There’s not a single one left.\"","No matter how calm he was, when he mentioned the rumors that caused his biological mother to die of depression, the cold Li Jinnian couldn’t help but tighten his grip. His expression became especially forbearing.","\"Jinnian, continue to be a clean person and develop in the military unit. Become an indomitable man. Leave the matters outside to me. In the end, you’ll see the result you want to see the most.","\"The Li family is too dirty. I’m dirty too, but you’re still clean. You haven’t done anything to the Li family, and this isn’t a place for you in the future. If there’s anything you want to know, Fang will tell you the truth.","\"Let’s go. I’ll send you to the Fu family. The clean Fu family!\"","Li Ronghuan started the car and smiled. The gloominess from before was gone. He was even in a good mood as he whistled.","He was almost 50 years old, but he looked surprisingly young."]},{"number":5107,"title":"Chapter 5107: Plan","paragraphs":["Li Jinnian, who was born in the Li family and had no one to rely on since he was young, didn’t immediately let down his guard in the face of Li Ronghuan’s goodwill. However, Li Ronghuan’s words were still like a stone thrown into a lake in his heart, causing ripples.","Li Jinnian looked at his watch for the third time and said calmly, \"Second Uncle, I’m in a hurry. If you have something on, I can go home myself.\"","\"Young brat, do you think I’m talkative?\" Li Ronghuan put down the handbrake and started the car. \"Remember what I said. I’m here to deal with the Li family, so you go be a soldier and serve the country well. Don’t interfere in all these messy matters.","\"By the way, have you seen Li Chuhai’s son, Li Jun? He really looks like that mistress. The first time we met, I almost slapped him in the face.","\"I think I need to tie something to my hand if I have to keep seeing him. If I accidentally slap him, that old man will hate me to death.\"","Li Jinnian’s gaze had already slid past a window on the second floor of the Li family’s house. Li Jun stayed in the room where the door was never opened. Servants would only deliver meals to him.","The car drove away from the Li family’s old residence. Someone slowly drew the curtains on the second floor and pulled open a small corner. The person then left the room and walked toward the first floor.","On the first floor, Old Master Li, who was being served by Second Old Madam Li, was drinking water. When he heard footsteps coming from upstairs, he smiled. Even Second Old Madam Li smiled.","\"Jun.\" The two elders spoke at the same time. Their voices were so kind as if they were afraid of shocking the young man who was going downstairs.","The man who went downstairs was around 26 or 27 years old. His skin was exceptionally fair, and it was an unhealthy complexion from not seeing the sun for so many years. His facial features were feminine. Although he was handsome, there was a hint of maliciousness between his eyebrows that made people look at him one more time. They knew that it was best not to provoke this person easily.","His facial features were a little similar to those of Matriarch Li when she was young. Li Chuhai’s eldest son came from Second Old Madam Li’s bloodline, so his features were naturally similar.","Li Jun, who was going downstairs, exuded a low pressure. He frowned and pursed his lips. Facing the greetings of the two elders, he only acknowledged them calmly and walked to the single couch to sit down.","\"Was Second Uncle very good to him in the past?\" Li Jun opened his mouth. As he had lived overseas since he was born, his accent was a little sharp and recognizable.","Seeing that her biological grandson was angry, Second Old Madam Li hurriedly said, \"They haven’t seen each other for 18 years. They’re not familiar with each other. How could they have a good relationship? Jun, now that you’re home, have a good rest. Go out more when you’re free. Leave the rest to your second uncle. The most important thing is your health.\"","Li Jun glanced at his grandmother, who was nervous about him. He suddenly smiled. \"Grandma, I’m in good health. I just don’t like to bask in the sun.","\"Leave everything at home to Second Uncle? Then why did I have to return to the country? I’m not a child. I have to handle some things myself. For example, killing the enemy who killed my father.\"","He was smiling, but every word was tainted with a shady aura. Second Old Madam Li was so anxious that her expression changed. \"Old Master, quickly persuade Jun. He just came back to the country. He can’t act according to his personality. This... This isn’t Molaban. He can’t do anything rash.\"","The last sentence was directed at Li Jun.","However, Old Master Li was not anxious at all. His glass-like eyes sized up Li Jun with a sharp gaze. He seemed to be confirming something or trying to discover something. Li Jun allowed himself to be sized up. There was a hint of arrogance in his eyes."]},{"number":5108,"title":"Chapter 5108: Who Is The Oriole","paragraphs":["The two of them did not speak. Second Old Madam Li was so anxious that she kept squeezing her hands. At this moment, she did not dare to speak rashly.","At least three minutes later, Old Master Li, who had not spoken, suddenly laughed. \"Good! Good! Good! As expected of a descendant of the Li family. You’re ruthless!\"","He was quite satisfied with Li Jun’s reaction.","\"Your father was the son I’m most satisfied with because your father’s personality was very similar to mine when I was young. However, I never expected that the person who’s most like me isn’t your father but you!\"","Second Old Madam Li, who was secretly anxious just now, calmed down. She sat down in a dignified manner and took care of Old Master Li even more. \"Jun, ask your grandpa for guidance in the future. Don’t make him angry, understand?\"","The person who resembled the old master the most was Jun... Good, good, good! With this sentence, she could be at ease.","So what if that woman was the first wife?","Hahaha, she would still be the one laughing in the end! A hundred years later, her name would still be on the old master’s tombstone. She would still accompany the old master!","So what if that woman was the first wife?","The two sons she left behind were alive and well, but the old master didn’t like either of them. It was the same for Li Ronghuan, who was in charge of things now. The one he really liked was her grandson, Jun!","In the end, she would still have the last laugh!","Facing Old Master Li’s praise, Li Jun only raised his eyebrows slightly. He wasn’t surprised. It was as if there was no need to be surprised.","The more Old Master Li looked at him, the happier he became. The more he looked at him, the more he felt that Li Jun was like him when he was young. He liked to put up his guard first and wait. When his prey let down their guard, he would attack directly and kill them in one move.","A man had to be ruthless when he did things. Indecision wouldn’t do anything.","More importantly, he had to side with the Li family.","Second Old Madam Li was overjoyed. When she saw her daughter coming over, she pulled her daughter over and chatted with her for a while. Madam Li was also overjoyed. It was beneficial to her as an aunt that her nephew was liked by the old master. \"That’s good, that’s good. Jun and Yuan are around the same age. In the future, the cousins should interact more. Jun has just returned to the country, so I’m afraid he doesn’t know much about the local market. With Yuan leading him, it’ll be good to learn more.\"","\"That’s right, that’s right. You’re thoughtful. Jun has been back in the country for more than two months and hasn’t gone out. After Li Jinnian came back, he would lock himself in his room all day. I’m really worried that he’ll get sick from living like this. It’s most suitable for Yuan to bring him around. The cousins can take care of each other so that they won’t be deceived by Li Ronghuan.\"","The mother and daughter chatted considerately in the room. Meanwhile, Li Jun was brought into the study by Old Master Li. He wouldn’t come out for a while.","The servant, Fang, left the living room and sent a message to Li Ronghuan, telling him everything Old Master Li had said to Li Jun.","Li Ronghuan, who had already arrived at the entrance of Dan Gui Garden, looked at the message and threw his phone at Li Jinnian. He wasn’t afraid that Li Jinnian wouldn’t pick it up or look at it. \"That old man said that Li Jun is the most like him when he was young. Ha, a dog that bites doesn’t bark. It’s best if you don’t return to the Li family in the future and stay with the Fu family.","\"Have you considered changing your surname? Your surname should be Fu. You’re from a wealthy family in Jiangnan. Old Master Fu is a minister of the country. He has dedicated his entire life to the country. You should just take on the Fu surname.\"","Li Jinnian finished reading the message. He handed the phone back and looked at Li Ronghuan quietly. His thin lips, which had been pursed habitually, moved slightly before he said in a clear voice, \"Second Uncle, why did you return to the country?\""]},{"number":5109,"title":"Chapter 5109: Purpose","paragraphs":["Li Jinnian asked very skillfully. He asked ’Why did you want to return to the country’, not ’Why did you return to the country’. It was just a difference of two words, but the meaning was very different.","The former had a specific purpose, while the latter was casual and non-specific.","Since he had already escaped from the Li family, why did he return to the country?","Since he hated the Li family so much and didn’t like them, why did he return to the country?","Why was he back?","This was the deeper meaning behind Li Jinnian’s question. After saying that, he waited for Li Ronghuan’s reply.","He didn’t believe in the Li family, including his second uncle, who had expressed his goodwill to him after returning to the country. His surname was Li, but he didn’t believe even his own uncle.","Even his biological father couldn’t be trusted. So what if Li Ronghuan was his biological uncle?","Why did he return to the country?","This question was not difficult to answer. However, because the person who asked was the only nephew Li Ronghuan acknowledged as part of his family, he needed to think carefully before answering.","After saying so much just now, he thought that his nephew would know why he wanted to return to the country. Now, it seemed that Li Jinnian did not believe what he said just now.","Even when he was a child, he had to be wary of his family harming him. Would he believe the Li family now?","No!","Even he, a fellow member of the Li family, didn’t believe in the Li family. When he was young, he suffered so much and finally escaped from the Li family. How could he believe in the Li family?","\"Why I wanted to return to the country? Of course, it’s because I want to do something big.\" Li Ronghuan habitually took out his cigarette. This time, Li Jinnian stopped him. \"I’m sorry, Second Uncle. I don’t like the smell of smoke.\"","At least Li Jinnian was willing to express his preferences in front of Li Ronghuan now.","This sentence made Li Ronghuan happy. He smiled and kept the cigarette box. \"I won’t smoke anymore. I won’t smoke in front of you in the future.","\"Hurry up and get out of the car. Don’t let the old master wait too long.\" He urged Li Jinnian to get out of the car. He swallowed the words he had already thought of in his heart. He didn’t plan to say them anymore.","There was no need to taint his clean nephew with anything dirty. The more Li Jinnnian knew, the more disadvantageous it would be for him. It was better not to know.","Why did he want to return to the country?","Of course, he had to return to the country!","There were still enemies in the country. How could he not return?","Back then, it took him several years to coax Li Chuhai back to the country. Li Chuhai had been dead for more than two years, and the two elderly at home didn’t suspect him. They even asked him to investigate who killed Li Chuhai. Investigate, his ass!","Even if they found anything, he would just tip off that person. At that time, he would be grateful and thank his benefactor!","Li Jinnian didn’t ask again. The other party was avoiding answering his question on purpose. If he asked again, it would only arouse his suspicion.","So, he didn’t ask again.","It would be difficult for him to know about the Li family in the future... The servants staying in the Li family’s residence were all Li Ronghuan’s men. He needed to consider if he should continue contacting Fang.","Li Ronghuan. Was he trustworthy or not?","\"Take care.\" Li Jinnian didn’t probe further. He pushed open the car door and stepped on the ground with his right leg. Li Ronghuan’s voice was like a thunderclap. It wasn’t his voice but his words that gave the effect.","\"I was the one who persuaded Li Chuhai to return to the country. Jinnian, you can trust no one in the Li family, but I’m still trustworthy. You can choose to believe me.\"","Li Jinnian was so shocked that he turned his head abruptly and retracted his long leg. At the same time, his cold eyes shot at Li Ronghuan like bullets. \"Second Uncle, do you know what you just said?\""]},{"number":5110,"title":"Chapter 5110: Insider","paragraphs":["Did Li Chuhai suddenly return to the country because Li Ronghuan instigated him to? Li Jinnian closed the open car door and sat in the car coldly. His gaze was fixed on Li Ronghuan, who brought with him shocking news. \"Do you know what you said just now?\"","He asked again. His voice was colder and deeper, with a sharp soldier’s might.","Li Chuhai was not an ordinary criminal. He was a famous Chinese man in the underworld. He was a criminal whose hands had been stained with countless innocent lives. Even if he died a hundred times, it would be difficult to wash away his sins.","Now, Li Ronghuan actually said that he was the one who persuaded Li Chuhai to return to the country. In that case, was Li Ronghuan also stained with the lives of innocent people? Was he also covered in blood and sin?","His right hand, which was close to the car door, was slowly placed on the belt buckle. Li Jinnian was already prepared to attack. As long as Li Ronghuan’s answer revealed something, the belt would become his weapon to catch a criminal.","Li Ronghuan, who was being questioned, had a calm expression on his face. He didn’t think that he had said anything shocking just now. He placed his left hand on the steering wheel casually and leaned forward in Li Jinnian’s direction. Smiling, he said, \"I do. Hurry up and get out of the car. I can’t park here for a long time. The special forces are already here.\"","In the end, he even pushed Li Jinnian. \"Get out of the car. Do you want me to be caught? I didn’t bring my driver’s license.\"","This time, it was impossible for Li Jinnian to get out of the car. \"Drive to the side.\"","\"I’m not. You were so rude to me just now, and now you want to cling to me? You naive brat. You’re not getting out of the car? Then I can only use violence.\" He unbuckled his seatbelt and opened the car door, preparing to pull Li Jinnian out.","Li Jinnian waited until the car door was open before getting out of the car. He pulled out the belt around his lean waist as he got out of the car.","The two people who left the car stood beside the door. One was smiling while the other was looking coldly. A tense atmosphere spread from the two of them.","Li Ronghuan looked at the seatbelt and pointed at it with a smile. \"Are you going to pee? Hurry up, then. I won’t send you off. Goodbye, my nephew.\"","Li Jinnian stopped him. \"Second Uncle, I need your explanation.\"","\"Oh, an explanation. It’s simple. He needed to wash his dirty money, and I’ve been laundering money for him. Once he and Cobra died, I became free.\" Seeing Li Jinnian tighten his grip on the belt, the smile on Li Ronghuan’s face deepened. \"I only did it overseas. I’m clean in the country. You can’t do anything to me. Oh, no, you can’t do anything to me overseas either. Only you know that I’ve laundered money.","\"I’ve already told you my biggest secret. My eldest nephew, do you still not believe me?\" Li Ronghuan pretended to have a headache and rubbed his eyebrows. \"Then I can’t do anything about it. You know that Fang is my man. You know that I helped Li Chuhai launder money. And my return to the country... If you don’t believe me, just watch.","\"The Li family has long been hollow. It’s time for them to fall.\"","With his hands in his pockets, Li Ronghuan whistled. The whistle sounded like his person, distant yet close, high yet low. No one could see his true self.","\"Goodbye, my nephew. Contact me if anything happens. The SWAT officers are coming, and I don’t have my driver’s license with me.\"","He walked past Li Jinnian and reported a set of numbers. The moment he passed by, he reached out and patted Li Jinnian’s shoulder. He whistled happily and got into the car."]},{"number":5111,"title":"Chapter 5111: Stop Right There","paragraphs":["Li Jinnian stood at the same spot and looked at the car that was leaving in the dust. He frowned slightly. Only the traffic police would check someone’s driver’s license.","Li Jinnian looked up at the SWAT officers walking toward him. He frowned even more. Why was she on duty here? Shouldn’t she be near the train station?","Zhou Niannian, who was dressed in an armed police uniform and black sunglasses, walked over with two male colleagues. The three of them had identification documents hanging on their chests. It was obvious that they were on a mission.","She didn’t recognize Li Jinnian immediately. She only recognized him when he was about five or six meters away. She raised her hand, and the male colleagues behind her stopped in their tracks. Zhou Niannian said in a low voice, \"There’s no problem. Withdraw.\"","It turned out he was Old Master Fu’s grandson. There was definitely nothing wrong with that navy officer.","Zhou Niannian asked her colleagues to withdraw, so she naturally withdrew too. However, when she saw that the young officer standing in front wasn’t moving and was looking at her directly, she could see his frown through her sunglasses. Zhou Niannian secretly pursed her lips. Why did it feel like he didn’t want to see her?","She didn’t come here on purpose.","Zhou Niannian, who was planning to withdraw, walked straight over. He didn’t want to see her? Hmph! She would stand in front of him. She’d even tell him that the car he was in had been parked for more than three minutes. She had to go over and remind him that parking was strictly prohibited here!","Li Jinnian saw her approaching and moved his straight body along with his long legs. He walked away from the spot.","He didn’t walk toward Zhou Niannian. Instead, he walked into Dan Gui Garden.","Just as he took out his identification document, the woman’s crisp voice came from behind. \"Li Jinnian, stop right there!\"","The sentry recognized Li Jinnian without looking at his ID. When he heard that the only female SWAT officer who had been in charge of guarding Dan Gui Garden area since yesterday and would stay until the end of a certain conference ordered Lieutenant Colonel Li, the grandson of Old Master Fu, to stop, he secretly grabbed his gun.","They probably knew each other. If not, she wouldn’t have dared to order Lieutenant Colonel Li to stop.","Zhou Niannian, who ordered someone to stop on impulse, felt awkward too. Her tone just now didn’t seem too good. Also, although she was a SWAT officer and had a military rank... Lieutenant Colonel Li’s military rank was still higher than hers.","Luckily, they were in a different branch of the military, so he couldn’t suppress her!","Zhou Niannian, who was secretly glad that they were not in the same military unit, walked closer. She cleared his throat and did not forget to salute. Then, she said seriously, \"Comrade, this place strictly prohibits social vehicles from parking for more than three minutes. You exceeded the time limit just now. Remember to be careful next time.\"","One could not park at the entrance of Dan Gui Garden for more than three minutes. However... Li Jinnian looked at Zhou Niannian, who was wearing combat equipment. \"This area is under ban? Until when?\"","\"You just came back, right? It’ll take a week until the conference ends,\" Zhou Niannian explained. Seeing that he was slowly relaxing, she added, \"I came over just now to remind you. I didn’t mean anything else.\"","Li Jinnian frowned again. Zhou Niannian’s heart tightened. Did she say something wrong?","Li Jinnian frowned and looked at Zhou Niannian, who was wearing black sunglasses. He asked, \"Do you think I was avoiding you just now?\"","\"No, you misunderstood.\" Zhou Niannian smiled. Damn it, it was tiring to talk to this cold fellow. She should leave quickly."]},{"number":5112,"title":"Chapter 5112: Hiding From You","paragraphs":["Due to the nature of her work, Zhou Niannian had many male colleagues around her. In the past, every time she returned to the SWAT unit, she would meet female colleagues who had different divisions of labor and they could have a meal together. Ever since she came back from overseas and cooperated with the SWAT officers on a certain mission, everyone around her was a guy.","Zhou Niannian had never felt awkward facing a group of male colleagues. Her male colleagues didn’t treat Zhou Niannian, who could beat up three to four men, as a female colleague either. Everyone trained together and carried out missions together. It was a pleasant cooperation. There was no awkwardness between them.","However, at this moment, Zhou Niannian looked at Li Jinnian, who had a calm facial expression. When she heard what he said, she felt especially awkward. For a moment, she regretted recognizing the other party. Why did she walk over to make herself uncomfortable?","Zhou Niannian, who wished for Li Jinnian to leave, used her sunglasses to hide the discomfort on her face. However, the more she wanted Li Jinnian to leave, the more Li Jinnian refused to leave.","Although the sunglasses covered most of her face, they didn’t cover the area below her eyes. Li Jinnian, who had learned how to judge the other party’s reaction from small changes in their face, pursed his lips slightly.","She seemed to... dislike him. Was it because he didn’t admit that he was avoiding her just now?","After thinking for a moment, Li Jinnian said honestly, \"From your expression, you do think that I was avoiding you.\"","Zhou Niannian’s expression froze even more. F*ck... Was there a need to say it out loud?","Li Jinnian said calmly, \"You’re very sharp. I was indeed avoiding you just now.\"","The pair of bright eyes behind the sunglasses widened. They stared at the man who was obviously messing around with her. She really wanted to kick him!","That wasn’t right! He was such a serious and cold man. It was impossible for him to be messing with her, right? There was only one possibility. He was hiding something from her!","She narrowed her eyes and asked coldly, \"Why were you avoiding me? What made you have a guilty conscience?\"","She was very serious. Even her small mouth was pressed tightly. He could even feel that her aura had changed. He could confirm that as long as he replied that there was a problem, she would aim the gun in her hand at him without hesitation.","In her eyes, he was a dangerous person that needed to be dealt with by violence.","She definitely didn’t know that she looked like... a bird whose feathers were standing on end and ready to attack at any moment.","She was completely different from Ye Jian. Ye Jian was calm and composed. As for her... Her personality was very clear. At first glance, one could tell that she was a very lively person.","Birds seemed to be quite lively. They chirped early in the morning and didn’t even rest until night. They were full of energy.","Li Jinnian, who was thinking about it silently, replied to Zhou Niannian, \"No reason. It was a subconscious reaction.\" He didn’t know why his first reaction when he saw her was to... hide!","\"I have yet to think about why my first reaction upon seeing you was to hide,\" he added honestly, a little unnaturally.","However, when he saw Zhou Niannian acting even more unnaturally, he felt very natural.","Look, he wasn’t the only one who felt awkward. She felt the same way.","Zhou Niannian wanted to slap herself. Her heart was beating faster. He seemed to be flirting with her. That was right, he seemed to be flirting with her!","Her face felt a little hot."]},{"number":5113,"title":"Chapter 5113: Are You Flirting?","paragraphs":["She wanted to confirm if he was being flirted on by the other party, but Zhou Niannian realized that no matter how carefully she looked at him, the young officer in front of her still had a cold facial expression. Even his gaze was cold... It was impossible for him to flirt with her!","She was thinking too much!","Zhou Niannian, who thought that she was thinking too much, immediately brushed away those thoughts when he asked again, \"Do you still need to be on duty in the afternoon? Are there any shifts? How many shifts are there?\"","Besides the questions he asked, his words and actions were still cold. Zhou Niannian wasn’t sure how to feel about all of this. She glared at him. \"Do you think I’ll tell you?\"","She shook her head and left arrogantly.","After taking a few steps, Zhou Niannian felt a little nervous again. It seemed rude to leave like this. Should she turn around and say goodbye?","Then, Zhou Niannian turned around. Right on the heels of that, she closed her eyes and took a deep breath. Without looking back, she turned around again and strode toward the police car.","She decided that when she saw Li Jinnian in the future, she would take the initiative to walk away from him!","He ran away even faster than her. Did he think that she would chase after him?!","Li Jinnian saw Zhou Niannian shake his head and vaguely felt that she was rolling her eyes at him. He frowned slightly before turning to leave.","It was probably because the questions he asked were too presumptuous. She didn’t want to answer him and didn’t give him a chance to explain before leaving. He wanted to chase after her and explain, but he saw that she was on a mission. It wasn’t appropriate for him to disturb her because of personal matters. Hence, Li Jinnian, who had always been disciplined, turned around and left.","Actually, he didn’t mean anything else. He just wanted to invite her to the Fu family’s house if she had any breaks. Old Master Fu liked her very much. He would definitely be very happy to see her.","Li Jinnian, who was walking away with his head held high, didn’t notice that Zhou Niannian had turned around and looked at him again. When he returned to the Fu family’s residence, he saw the note left by Old Master Fu on the table. He would be going to the university for lessons today and would only be able to go home in the afternoon.","In the afternoon...","It was already noon. Li Jinnian had lunch at home before driving to the university to fetch the old master.","He hadn’t returned home for three years. This vacation was longer, and he had a total of 21 days of leave. He had enough time to accompany the old master.","Zhou Niannian, who had returned to her post, also reflected on herself. She felt that there was no need to give Li Jinnian a hard time just now. With his cold personality, he probably didn’t even know why she gave him a hard time even after she left!","The most important thing was that she didn’t know why she was throwing a tantrum at him. He didn’t say anything wrong. She asked, and he answered honestly.","Was there anything wrong with being honest?","It was true that he was honest. The mistake was that she was thinking too much.","Did he think that she was crazy?","Oh my god, if he really thought that way, she would be embarrassed!","Fortunately, he was a navy soldier. He didn’t return to the capital city often, so he didn’t come to this area often. She had seen him today, but the next time she saw him might be a few more years. Haha, who would remember what happened today after a few years?","Even if they met again, she could take a detour!","Zhou Niannian, who had been trying to convince herself for a while, sat in the car and ate her meal while silently cheering herself on.","She had one and a half hours of rest in the afternoon. After that, she would stand guard until five in the afternoon before changing shifts. At night, she would patrol the area until 9:00 pm and then come back at 7:00 am the next day to change shifts.","There was a shortage of manpower, so they could only take turns standing guard."]},{"number":5114,"title":"Chapter 5114: How Horrifying","paragraphs":["After eating her meal, Zhou Niannian asked her other two male colleagues to rest. She picked up the empty lunch box and got out of the car. She walked toward the trash can at the crossing.","Zhou Niannian, who had stuffed her empty lunch box into the trash can, seemed to have sensed something and looked up.","Sitting in the car, Li Jinnian nodded at her as a greeting.","Zhou Niannian almost coughed. Why did they meet again so soon?","Was it too late to pretend that she didn’t notice anything?","It was definitely too late!","Zhou Niannian, whose neck was stiff, nodded slightly too. Then, she watched as the black sedan started moving steadily and drove past her eyes. It turned left and disappeared from her sight.","Zhou Niannian took a deep breath and slowly exhaled. She hadn’t seen him for a few years, but he suddenly appeared twice in a day. How terrifying!","They probably wouldn’t have the chance to meet again!","Zhou Niannian carried out her duties in the afternoon until 5:00 pm. She took off her helmet and hugged it in the crook of her arm. Then, she took off her sunglasses and tucked them into her clothes. She smiled at her colleagues who were changing shifts. \"See you tonight.\"","\"See you tonight, Captain Zhou.\" The two male colleagues smiled. Zhou Niannian was their captain. They could get off work, but their captain had to go to a few execution points to check.","As the captain, Zhou Niannian would always be busier than the rest.","At this moment, Zhou Niannian had already forgotten about Li Jinnian. After her colleagues left, she was about to drive to another execution point when an old voice came from behind.","At 5:00 pm, the sun was setting in the west of the capital city. Under the setting sun, an old man in a Chinese tunic suit, who looked like a scholar, was supported by a young man. He walked toward her with a kind smile.","\"It’s really you, Niannian. I almost thought that I recognized the wrong person.\" Old Master Fu, who had a kind smile on his face, was very happy to see Zhou Niannian, whom he had not seen for a long time. He happened to see Zhou Niannian take off her sunglasses in the car. Even after so long, he could recognize her at a glance.","It had to be said that the old man with a high IQ had a good memory.","After recognizing her, he immediately asked the driver to stop the car and said to Li Jinnian, \"You should have an impression of that girl, Niannian. She’s already at our house. We have to go down and greet her.\"","Old Master Fu didn’t even seem to be bothered with Li Jinnian. He pushed open the car door and got out, effectively cutting out Li Jinnian’s words about meeting her this morning. When he got out of the car, Li Jinnian wanted to say more. But the old man walked faster than him and even greeted Zhou Niannian from a distance. Li Jinnian swallowed his words and quickly held the old man. \"Walk slower.\"","Li Jinnian was afraid that Old Master Fu’s body wouldn’t be able to take it.","At this moment, Old Master Fu didn’t care about his grandson and only had eyes for the young policewoman he liked at first glance. He said, \"Niannian, when did you transfer to the SWAT team? Are you very busy? You’re so busy that you don’t have time to visit me.\"","Zhou Niannian, who saw Li Jinnian for the third time in a day, was so shocked that she was speechless. What... What was going on?! They had not seen each other for a few years, but they had seen each other three times today!","Zhou Niannian quickly adjusted his expression and smiled brightly. \"Sorry for making you worry. I went away to study for a year. After I came back, my position was changed and I trained in the team. I...\"","Just as she was about to say that she would definitely come and see him, Zhou Niannian swallowed her words. Instead, she said, \"I was afraid of disturbing you, so I didn’t dare to come and see you.\""]},{"number":5115,"title":"Chapter 5115: Only You Left","paragraphs":["She almost promised to visit the old man. If she did that, wouldn’t she have to see Li Jinnian from time to time?","Fortunately, she stopped herself in time.","Seeing that Old Master Fu’s body was still as strong as a few years ago, Zhou Niannian smiled. There was a clear and sparkling light in them. She asked with sincerity and concern, \"Old Master, are you alright?\"","She gave Li Jinnian a look, indicating that she still had something on and asked him to help the old man home.","\"I’m good, very good. I was just wondering why you didn’t come to see me. You wouldn’t be disturbing me if you came to see me. In fact, I’m more worried about wasting your time.\" Old Master Fu wanted to chat with Zhou Niannian, but he remembered that his grandson’s vacation was long enough, so his thoughts became more lively. He smiled and said unhurriedly, \"Have you gotten off work? Why don’t you come over to my house now?\"","Whether the two young people were fated or not, they needed to have a chance to get together.","He didn’t know if Zhou Niannian had a boyfriend. If she did, there was nothing he could do. If she didn’t, he would have to create favorable conditions and environment first.","The highly intelligent Old Master Fu had already created a trap for the two young people.","Zhou Niannian was still hoping that Li Jinnian would say something. In the end, she realized that he hadn’t even looked at her.","Without sunglasses to cover her face, Zhou Niannian could only try her best to make her expression look normal. \"Old Master, I’m really sorry about today. I’m in charge of the enforcement of this area. Now, I have to go to the next...\"","Before she could finish his sentence, a SWAT officer strode over and shouted, \"Report!\" He interrupted Zhou Niannian. Zhou Niannian hurriedly apologized and immediately turned around. Her facial expression was exceptionally serious. \"Speak.\"","It wasn’t a big problem. He just needed to drive the car. Zhou Niannian handed over the car keys, and the SWAT officer took them and strode away.","The old man smiled and sighed. \"Thank you for your hard work. During the conference, the most tiring party is the SWAT officers. Niannian, you’re very good. You’re as good as my granddaughter.\" After a pause, the kind smile in his eyes deepened. \"My granddaughter should be around your age, but she’s in the army. She graduated from military school last year.\"","\"It’s not hard. It’s our duty.\" Zhou Niannian was a little embarrassed when an official of the country praised her. After knowing that the old man’s granddaughter was an army soldier, Zhou Niannian glanced at the cold navy soldier beside him from the corner of her eye and pursed her lips as she smiled. \"Do you also have someone in the air force at home?\"","After she finished speaking, she heard the old man laughing loudly. Zhou Niannian immediately knew that she had made a mistake!","There really was someone in the air force!","\"We have someone in the air force, the army, and the navy. We just lack a SWAT officer.\" Old Master Fu seemed to have mentioned it casually, and Zhou Niannian laughed too. But deep inside, she found it strange.","Why did it sound like... there was a deeper meaning?","She looked at Li Jinnian from the corner of her eye. He still didn’t have any reaction.","She was probably thinking too much!","She narrowed her eyes and replied to Old Master Fu with a smile, \"Your family already has everyone. There won’t be enough space for another SWAT officer.\"","\"Hahaha, as long as you’re willing, you’ll definitely be able to squeeze in.\" The old man’s words had a double meaning. Zhou Niannian found it strange. It turned out that... Old Master Fu wanted to matchmake her with Li Jinnian!","She understood, but the ice statue beside her didn’t."]},{"number":5116,"title":"Chapter 5116: Hard Work","paragraphs":["This was awkward. She should pretend that she didn’t understand. \"When the time comes, you’ll complain that I talk too much and make your head hurt. You just came back from outside, right?\"","\"Jinnian and my granddaughter are both outside. As an old man, I’m too free at home. I troubled the National Arts University to let me teach some students so that I can live a fulfilling life.\"","No wonder there was white dust on his sleeve. It was chalk dust.","He was already in his 80s, but he still went to National Arts University to teach. He really dedicated his entire life to the country. Zhou Niannian held Old Master Fu’s left hand and said respectfully, \"You came back from National Arts University, right? You must be tired after standing all day. You should go home and rest early. Rest well before teaching those students who need you to teach them.\"","\"I’m not tired. I should talk to young people more. I feel much younger. Come, let’s talk as we walk. I’ll get Jinnian to send you off later. You won’t be unwilling to send an old man like me home, right?\"","How could she not be willing? She even felt honored!","She accompanied Old Master Fu to the black sedan she saw in the afternoon. Li Jinnian, who was silent in front, drove. At the back, she accompanied Old Master Fu from the entrance of Dan Gui Garden to the Fu family’s residence’s main entrance. If she didn’t need to patrol a few more points, she would’ve followed him into the Fu family’s home.","When Old Master Fu knew that she still had business to attend to, he quickly asked Li Jinnian to drive Zhou Niannian down. He reminded him secretly, \"Don’t be like a statue and not say anything. Niannian will think that you have a problem with her.","\"I have to ask your future cousin-in-law to teach you a few moves. I feel suffocated when I see you not doing anything at all. Later, when you get to the car, ask more about Niannian’s personal situation, especially if she has a boyfriend. This is a mission that I’m giving you. You have to complete it, do you hear me?\"","Li Jinnian was already 30 years old but he didn’t even have a partner. Was he really going to be a bachelor for the rest of his life?","Old Master Fu couldn’t bear to see his lonely grandson being a bachelor for the rest of his life.","Unfortunately, the old man’s advice was in vain. Li Jinnian drove the car without saying anything. His expression was so cold that Zhou Niannian kept quiet and didn’t dare to speak. Occasionally, she would glance at the young officer driving the car from the corner of her eye. Then, she would quickly look away and pretend to look at the scenery outside.","Normally, a cheap trick like that wouldn’t be discovered easily. However, the person she was glancing at was Li Jinnian. Every time she glanced at him, he would notice it. Zhou Niannian had glanced at him five times, and Li Jinnian had noticed it five times.","He was very calm and didn’t ask her why she kept glancing at him secretly.","After coming out of Dan Gui Garden, the SWAT officers were on duty. Li Jinnian, who had been silent all the way, suddenly asked calmly, \"Where are you going to patrol now?\"","Zhou Niannian, who was thinking about how to go to the next patrol point, suddenly heard him speak. Before she could react, she exclaimed in confusion. Li Jinnian frowned slightly. \"Where’s the next patrol point?\"","The moment he frowned, Zhou Niannian panicked and blurted out, \"Liulin Crossing.\"","Li Jinnian stepped on the accelerator, and the black sedan drove past the duty point. Zhou Niannian, who remembered that she had to get out of the car, hurriedly said, \"You’ve missed it. You’ve gone past the duty point!\"","\"I’ll send you there.\" Hearing that, Zhou Niannian was shocked and didn’t say anything else.","Zhou Niannian felt a headache coming on. She got tricked again when she was distracted. She said in a low voice, \"There’s no need to send me there. I can go over myself.\"","Li Jinnian, who was driving, looked at the girl who was in a hurry to get out of the car through the rearview mirror. He frowned even more. \"You don’t have a car.\"","Did he misunderstand?"]},{"number":5117,"title":"Chapter 5117: Interaction","paragraphs":["Li Jinnian directly said that Zhou Niannian didn’t have a car. She quickly glanced at the shockingly meticulous fellow. Zhou Niannian cleared her throat and said calmly, \"I can get another car.\"","\"It’s a waste of time.\" Li Jinnian frowned and looked at Zhou Niannian in confusion. He didn’t understand why she rejected him. Having him send her over was her best option.","Zhou Niannian was defeated by his straightforwardness. After enduring for a while, she glared at the cold man. He won!","She held her breath and settled back down. She turned her head and looked out of the window. No one knew what she was thinking. It looked like... she was in a bad mood.","Li Jinnian was also confused. \"You peeked at me five times just now—\"","Before he could finish speaking, Zhou Niannian exploded. \"When did I peek at you?!\" Did she peek at him five times? It shouldn’t be more than three times!","Her anger made Li Jinnian purse his lips tightly. There was a hint of contemplation in his cold eyes, causing the car to fall silent. After a while, Li Jinnian softened his voice. \"Were you thinking about how to ask me to send you over just now?\"","Zhou Niannian, who had nowhere to vent her anger, was instantly discouraged. She didn’t know that she would suddenly flare up, nor did she know why she didn’t want to sit in his car.","Actually, she didn’t know why she rejected him.","After thinking for a while, Zhou Niannian tried her best to smile kindly. \"Lieutenant Colonel Li, how did you spend your time in the past? Did you interact with your female colleagues?\"","Why did it feel like this lieutenant colonel didn’t understand what women were thinking and didn’t know how to speak to women?","Li Jinnian knew that she was angry. He thought for a moment and chose a very cautious method to reply, \"There are no female colleagues in the team. There are only male soldiers around. Also, I’m sorry to have made you angry just now. I didn’t mean to. Please forgive me if I offended you.\"","His attitude was upright and sincere. Zhou Niannian stared at him for a while. His gaze was so focused that it seemed to be able to see through her soul. She didn’t detect any problems.","He was indeed apologizing to her seriously. He didn’t know what he did to provoke her. From this, she knew that he had never interacted with a girl before. His life was so monotonous that obeying orders was everything to him.","\"You don’t have any female colleagues in your team. What about your life?\"","Li Jinnian didn’t need to think about it. He immediately replied, \"No, not a single one.\"","Zhou Niannian didn’t believe it. \"No way. Were there no female students in junior high, senior high, or university?\"","\"Yes, but I’m not in contact with them,\" Li Jinnian replied honestly. \"I’m often in the military unit. It’s rare for me to even contact my family.\"","These words almost made Zhou Niannian’s motherly love overflow. His life was so monotonous that it sounded pitiful.","Forget it. Why was she angry with a soldier who didn’t know how to interact with women?","He didn’t even know why he was angry!","Leaning against the back of the seat, she raised her hand and pointed in front. She resigned himself to fate. \"Then I’ll have to bother you to send me there. Thanks.\"","\"You’re welcome.\" Li Jinnian drove. After a few meters, he said seriously, \"I’m not good at interacting with others. My monotonous life has made me inexperienced in certain areas. If I do anything wrong next time or speak wrongly, you can point me out. I’ll be a good student.\"","Next time? Zhou Niannian raised his eyebrows. She felt that there shouldn’t be a next time."]},{"number":5118,"title":"Chapter 5118: Requesting Help","paragraphs":["Zhou Niannian didn’t want there to be a next time. She smiled. \"No, no. It’s just that I’m not used to interacting with strangers. I wasn’t really angry just now. Don’t take it to heart.\" Zhou Niannian laughed and tried to bluff her way out.","Although Li Jinnian didn’t know why she was angry, it would be wrong to think that he didn’t know anything.","His sharp intuition told him that Zhou Niannian was still angry. It was just that she wasn’t as angry as before.","He really wanted to ask her what made her angry. Seeing that she was refusing to communicate, Li Jinnian pursed his lips and chose to remain silent.","The more he spoke, the more mistakes he would make. It was better for him not to speak for the time being.","As for the advice, Li Jinnian held the steering wheel with one hand and rubbed his temples with the other. The advice gave him a headache.","However, Li Jinnian had always listened to his grandfather. In addition, Old Master Fu’s serious advice made him take it even more seriously. After sending her to the duty point at Liulin Crossing, he parked the car and asked Zhou Niannian, who was preparing to get out of the car, with a serious expression, \"Do you have a boyfriend?\"","Zhou Niannian, who was already impatient, became even more hurried. She unlocked the door, pushed open the car door, got out, closed the car door, and left quickly... All these actions were done in one go without any pause.","Looking at her back view as she left quickly, Li Jinnian, who was pursing his thin lips, fell silent. He was very sure that he had angered Zhou Niannian by asking her if she had a boyfriend.","What should he do?","He could only ask for help.","Who would he ask for help from?","Li Jinnian took out his phone and asked for help from the famous ’relationship expert’, Big Shark. He was also the instructor of the team.","Big Shark was writing a report. When the landline phone rang, he didn’t look at the number. He picked up the call and said, \"Hello.\" Then, he heard the Demon King, who was on a long vacation after a few years, ask a question seriously.","After hanging up, Big Shark wasn’t writing the report anymore. He ran all the way to the seaside training ground. Ten minutes after hanging up, all the members of the Storm Commando Brigade knew about it and agreed that their captain had finally found someone.","Even Commander Dong of the navy knew about this explosive news.","\"Quick, investigate the identity and background of the person he likes first. Why didn’t this kid say anything about wooing a woman? Why didn’t he tell the team in advance?\"","Li Jinnian listened to Big Shark’s suggestion and parked the car at the side. His gaze was fixed on Zhou Niannian. He waited for her to finish patrolling before sending her to the next patrol point.","She didn’t have dinner. If there was a restaurant along the way, he could bring her there for dinner, even if it was fast food.","Li Jinnian was waiting for Zhou Niannian to finish her work. The SWAT officers who were standing guard had already noticed the car that sent their captain over had been parked at the side. After reporting, one of the officers smiled and said, \"No wonder the captain didn’t drive over personally today. As it turns out, someone sent her over. Captain, can you introduce that ’someone’ to us? Let us see who managed to invite our captain to sit in his car.\"","Zhou Niannian also knew that Li Jinnian’s car had been parked at the side of the road. When she heard her teammates teasing her, she pulled a long face and said in a low voice, \"It’s strictly forbidden to discuss personal matters during duty! Run three kilometers after returning to the team!\"","\"Yes!\" The SWAT officer straightened his expression and accepted the punishment without any resistance."]},{"number":5119,"title":"Chapter 5119: Misunderstanding","paragraphs":["Although their captain was a female, it was said that Zhou Niannian had trained in an extremely abnormal training camp overseas for an entire year. Her ruthlessness was even stronger than that of a man. The drastic changes she made upon joining immediately convinced these male SWAT officers of her ability.","After patrolling the first patrol point, Zhou Niannian looked at the car that was still parked by the roadside. She didn’t plan to ride with him anymore. She took the keys to the car on duty at Liulin Crossing and drove over.","She was frightened when she sat in his car.","At this moment, the sky was getting dark. The evening street lamps by the roadside lit up. The faint yellow street lamps shone so brightly.","Li Jinnian pushed the door open and got out of the car. When she heard the noise, Zhou Niannian held the car keys tightly and suddenly ran away.","Li Jinnian, who got out of the car but didn’t manage to catch up, stood at the crossing and watched as Zhou Niannian, whom he had waited for about 15 minutes, drove past him. She even waved at him to say goodbye.","The four SWAT officers on duty at the crossing saw everything and expressed their sympathy to this brother who was obviously a soldier.","It looked like he wasn’t their captain’s boyfriend. He was a suitor.","It was a little difficult to woo their captain!","There was an officer who wanted to pursue the captain. After chasing her for two months, the captain rolled up her sleeves and beat him up. After that, he lost to the captain. The captain said on the spot that she wouldn’t get together with a man who couldn’t even defeat her.","The officer, who was greatly embarrassed, never appeared in front of her again.","They wondered if this man in front of them could defeat their captain.","They would wait and see!","None of the armed police officers who were paying attention to Li Jinnian went over to talk to him. When they saw their captain driving past Li Jinnian and waving at him, the four SWAT officers immediately felt that Li Jinnian’s back view was pitiful and lonely.","Li Jinnian, who was watching the car leave, held his phone. He needed to consult Big Shark again and have him help him analyze how to deal with this situation.","Big Shark already had an infinite amount of sympathy for his captain. However, as an officer and a comrade, he definitely couldn’t attack his comrade at this moment. He had to work hard and encourage him!","Zhou Niannian, who was driving away, couldn’t help but heave a sigh of relief when she saw that Li Jinnian wasn’t chasing after her. She saw Li Jinnian standing under the streetlamp, sending her off. The dim light enveloped his figure, and there were people coming and going around him. He was the only one standing quietly, as if he was out of place. At that moment, Zhou Niannian inexplicably felt that the tall figure was exceptionally lonely.","Her heart softened too.","Forget it. She would talk to him the next time they met. Maybe the next time would be a few years later.","Zhou Niannian didn’t expect that she would be able to see Li Jinnian almost every day after this. At the same time, she would be able to see Old Master Fu too. Her visits to Dan Gui Garden in a week totaled more times than before she went abroad.","In just two days, Zhou Niannian found out about Li Jinnian’s childhood through Old Master Fu. He lost his mother when he was young and was ostracized by his family. His biological father wasn’t close to him, his stepmother was cold, and his grandpa didn’t dote on him. When she learned all this, Zhou Niannian was stunned. She felt that Li Jinnian was pitiful.","As it turned out, when she thought he looked lonely on the day she drove away to escape, it wasn’t because of the street lights... He was really quite pitiful."]},{"number":5120,"title":"Chapter 5120: Visit","paragraphs":["She was born into a good family. Her parents were loving, and her brother doted on her. Although she knew that some families were not harmonious and the children were unhappy, she really didn’t know that there was such a cold family like Li Jinnian’s.","\"He has been suffering since he was young. Now, as long as I think of the hardships he suffered when he was young, I can’t sleep for the entire night. Niannian, look at how cold he is now. It’s actually just a facade. He desires care and warmth more than anyone else.","\"I’m old. I don’t know how many more years I can accompany him. I just want to see someone by his side before I leave so that he can have a warm home for the rest of his life.","\"I still remember that when he was in primary school, he wrote an essay saying that he was most willing to have a warm family. Alas, with his cold personality now, I’m afraid... he won’t be able to have a warm family.\"","Old Master Fu had never said these words in front of Ye Jian and Li Jinnian. They were all words that stabbed into hearts. The old man wouldn’t say them. If he did, it would only make the cousins sad.","Zhou Niannian’s eyes turned red when she heard that.","Li Jinnian didn’t know any of this. Li Ronghuan would call at 4:00 pm every day, and Li Jinnian would leave the Fu family’s residence at 4:05 pm every day. If Li Jinnian left again on the third day, the old master would tie him up and not let him go out again. He wanted to hurry up and settle Li Jinnian’s personal matters during his short vacation.","Before the third day passed, Li Jinnian, who was with Li Ronghuan, received an order to return to the team immediately. He informed Li Ronghuan, who was talking to someone. Li Ronghuan, who couldn’t get up to send him off, only reminded him to be careful. Li Jinnian then rushed back to Dan Gui Garden.","Li Jinnian had 21 days of leave. In the end, he only used up nine days of leave. At 8:30 pm, he went to Dan Gui Garden. He parked the car and took two steps up the stone steps that led to the main entrance. The closed door opened with a click. Zhou Niannian, who had come out, looked at Li Jinnian, who had returned home. Li Jinnian looked at Zhou Niannian, who had come out. The two of them were stunned for a moment when their gazes met. Then, Li Jinnian nodded slightly and walked up the stone steps. He stood sideways and let Zhou Niannian pass.","Old Master Fu, who insisted on sending Zhou Niannian off, smiled when he saw Li Jinnian returning so coincidentally. \"What a coincidence that you’re back. We were having fun at home. Jinnian, send Niannian home quickly.\"","Jinnian, Niannian, their names were a match!","Li Jinnian, who needed to return to the team immediately, looked at Zhou Niannian. The woman under the light was wearing a SWAT uniform. She stood tall and valiant. When he looked over, she immediately looked away but didn’t reject Old Master Fu’s suggestion.","Li Jinnian could only apologize. \"I just received an emergency order from the military unit. I need to return to the unit immediately. I can only send you out of Dan Gui Garden. If there’s a chance next time, I’ll definitely send you home.\"","He left Dan Gui Garden at 8:45 pm that day and took a plane back to the team in the early morning.","This was the first time Zhou Niannian watched Li Jinnian leave.","Li Jinnian had a special identity and received an emergency order to take a plane. Even if the other soldiers received the order to return to the military unit, they could only take a train back to the military unit.","There were Western ships entering China’s waters. When the fishermen pulled the net to catch fish, they pulled out a strange item that looked like a torpedo. When they saw the English letters on it, the fishermen knew that something was wrong and returned to the port overnight. They immediately handed it over to the coast guard."]},{"number":5121,"title":"Chapter 5121: A Different Him","paragraphs":["The fishermen who went out to sea didn’t know about these things in the past, so they weren’t so vigilant. It was all because the sea staff often visited the fishermen, slowly making them vigilant. Hence, every time they went into the sea and caught strange things, they would quickly turn them in and not secretly transport them home.","If it were in the past, they would have moved the strange items back to the village and their homes. Sometimes, they wouldn’t take it to heart. They would find them a hindrance and throw them back into the sea.","The maritime police immediately recognized that the strange thing handed in by the fishermen was an ’underwater detector’. That day, the maritime police and the navy of the entire south moved out to search for how many ’underwater detectors’ there were in China’s waters.","These things were not to steal the resources of the country’s territorial sea. They were prepared in advance for future combat.","Not only were there detectors in the south, but there were also detectors in the Bohai, Yellow, and East China Seas. Li Jinnian didn’t return to the team because of the underwater detectors. He returned to the team for a military secret mission. He needed to catch up with a ship that wasn’t from this country. It was a ship that was sailing under the banner of ’Marine Pollution Control’ but actually has other agendas.","Only the members in charge of the operation knew what the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade would do after catching up.","Zhou Nian stood in the night for a long time after watching Li Jinnian leave before leaving. The man who came from such a family environment looked cold-hearted and indifferent, so cold that people dared not approach him. However, she unexpectedly saw another side of him—calm, courageous, self-controlled, and composed. He was so strong that it seemed that no difficulty was ever a difficulty for him.","No matter how cold this man looked, no one would dare to approach him. However, once they knew the other side of him, they would rush over like moths to a flame just to get his attention.","After walking for a long time, Zhou Niannian suddenly turned around and looked in the direction where Li Jinnian had left. Cars came and went on the wide street. The red taillights and the resplendent headlights intertwined to create a prosperous scene. The hurriedly leaving figure was one of the guardians of this prosperous scene. He used his straight back to carry the responsibility given to him by the military uniform. He was a real man!","Li Jinnian, who was leaving in a car, didn’t know that the woman whom he had hurriedly separated from was standing on the street and staring in the direction he had left. She was praying in her heart that he would return safely.","Li Jinnian, who had returned in a hurry, arrived at a military base of the navy at four in the morning the next day. He didn’t rest and changed into casual clothes before leaving the port on a freighter with seven members.","It would take about 15 to 20 days for them to return to the team.","The military unit that Ye Jian was in had also been very restless these few days. During the day, the fighter jets would take off from the airport and only return at night. At the same time, the pilots would increase their night flight training. The airborne soldiers would take the transport plane and jump into the sky.","Ye Jian and the other 15 female airborne soldiers weren’t included in the training list. They were still completing their intensive day training. They wouldn’t enter this training until they passed the intensive day training.","The ones who underwent night airborne training were the squad leaders and the deputy squad leaders. Before they joined the special forces, they were already squad leaders of the airborne forces. Their overall strength was quite impressive, and they had completed many night airborne missions.","After the training ended, the female soldiers looked at the male soldiers who were ready to gather. Their eyes were filled with envy. They wanted to undergo night airborne training too, but they didn’t know when it would happen."]},{"number":5122,"title":"Chapter 5122: Doubt","paragraphs":["The male soldiers increased their night training frequency, and the female soldiers envied them.","\"Squad Leader, can we apply for the night airborne training as soon as possible? I want to join the male soldiers as soon as possible.\"","\"That’s right, Squad Leader. We’ve been here for almost two months, but we haven’t even had a night training. The atmosphere has been so tense these few days. I feel that we should speed up the training process too. Our comrades were originally soldiers who came out of nowhere. They’re not like Ye Jian, who had a career change. Their foundation is quite solid. They can have night training.\"","\"All of you think that our foundation is quite solid, but you still have to consider Ye Jian. She’s still completing her day training. She hasn’t even passed day training. If we let her join the night airborne training immediately, she might lose her life.\"","At the mention of Ye Jian, the more than ten female soldiers fell silent. The squad leader looked at the female soldiers and saw that their expressions were not good. She sighed and said, \"Ye Jian is working hard. We need to give her some time.","\"She has zero foundation, but don’t you realize that she’s actually improving quite quickly? She has passed every item in today’s eight-hour parachute training. Checking the parachute, folding the canopy, arranging the parachute ropes and control belts, putting the canopy into the canopy cover... Her speed today was faster than that of several of you paratroopers. Do you think this speed of improvement is slow or fast?\"","Although the squad leader didn’t treat Ye Jian well, as the squad leader, she couldn’t deny the improvement of a soldier. It was true that Ye Jian had a career change midway, but the squad leader had seen her improvement. Although she was still a distance away from meeting the expected standard, this speed of improvement was very satisfactory.","At her current rate of improvement, she would be able to catch up with the entire class in half a year. Of course, she still couldn’t be compared to the real paratroopers.","The squad leader’s words made most of the female soldiers nod. It was undeniable that Ye Jian, who came from the army, had improved a lot in the past two months of training. However, she still couldn’t catch up with the entire class. She couldn’t even catch up with the physical training. They didn’t know if her former military unit had arranged training for her.","Could it be that because she was a female soldier, the soldiers from the military unit took special care of her so much that they turned a blind eye to her training in the company?","\"Ye Jian has improved, but she’s still dragging our class down. I still have opinions about her and don’t agree with her staying in our class.\"","A female soldier spoke coldly. The 15 female soldiers were divided into two groups. One group consisted of seven people while the other consisted of eight people. Ye Jian was in a group of eight. The female soldier who had an opinion was in the same group as Ye Jian.","Another female soldier in the same group said unhappily, \"She passed the parachute training today, but what about the physical training? She was called away by Captain Lei before she finished her training. She didn’t come back until we finished our physical training. It’s been like this for more than half a month. I suspect that Ye Jian and Captain Lei have a special relationship.\"","\"Shut up!\" The squad leader, who had a good temper, had a dark expression on her face right now. \"What nonsense are you talking about? Do you need me to wash your mouth with soap?\"","Realizing that there might be more than one female soldier thinking this way, the squad leader immediately whistled. All the female soldiers quickly gathered and accepted the squad leader’s criticism. \"You can have a problem with Ye Jian, but I don’t want to hear you talking nonsense about anything else! Captain Lei is our captain. You even dare to talk about Captain Lei. Who gave you the guts?","\"Lu Hui, step forward!\""]},{"number":5123,"title":"Chapter 5123: Punishment","paragraphs":["Lu Hui, who came from the Aerial 17th Division, was the female soldier who had the greatest opinion of Ye Jian in the entire female soldier class. There was no other reason. She always thought that the reason why her comrade from the Aerial 17th Division was eliminated was because Ye Jian, who was from the army, snatched her comrade’s slot.","She had always thought so. Even though the squad leader had explained it later, it didn’t dispel her opinion.","It couldn’t be helped. Ye Jian was from the army. It was very difficult for an army soldier to join the special reconnaissance team of the air force. Lu Hui wasn’t the only one who thought that there was a problem. All the female soldiers, including the squad leader, thought so too.","If not, why would the squad leader say that she allowed the female soldiers to have opinions about Ye Jian?","They could have their opinions, but they could not talk about personal matters. They could also not say whatever they wanted without any evidence.","Rumors often started off as casual remarks. In the end, it could reach a point where there was no way to end it. This would implicate themselves and them.","Especially in the military unit. Once things got out of hand, a large number of people would be punished.","Lu Hui, the female soldier who said that she suspected that Ye Jian and Captain Lei had a special relationship, didn’t look too good when she walked out.","\"Lu Hui, tell me now. Does everyone in your team think so? Or did all of you discuss this behind my and the deputy squad leader’s backs?\"","Lu Hui didn’t say anything. The squad leader was already angry. \"I’ll count to three. If you don’t say anything, the entire class will run ten kilometers with weights!\"","Lu Hui didn’t answer, and her comrades didn’t speak either. Guo Cui, who had received Ye Jian’s help before, wanted to step forward, but she was stopped by her comrades on her left and right.","\"If someone has to be punished, we’ll take the punishment together. Don’t cause trouble.\"","\"Everyone has already spoken up. Don’t do anything rash.\"","Guo Cui moved her lips but chose to remain silent.","They were right. Her comrades in the team had already said that they would be punished together if someone were to get punished. She remembered that Ye Jian had helped her before, but... she didn’t believe that Ye Jian joined with her capabilities.","None of the female soldiers stood up. The squad leader’s expressions were extremely dark. \"Very well! All of you are very loyal, right? My punishment to you is 20 kilometers of weighted cross-country run! Now, return to the dormitory immediately! Gather downstairs in five minutes!\"","There was a difference between a weighted 20-kilometer cross-country run and a non-weighted 20-kilometer run.","Weighted runs required individual combat weapons to be carried. The airborne soldiers’ equipment included heavy parachutes. The parachutes that the female soldiers were training now weighed five kilograms. In addition, the individual combat equipment of the paratroopers, such as automatic rifles and magazines, water bottles, satchels, and ammunition bags... In total, they weighed 15 kilograms.","If it weren’t for the word ’weighted’, the heavy parachute bag would have been spared.","A 20 kilometers cross-country run with 15 kilograms of weight. The 13 female soldiers, including the deputy squad leader, had pale faces.","The squad leader was punished too. This was her negligence. It was because of her laissez-faire that the female soldiers dared to talk about personal matters in private. They were so bold that they even implicated Captain Lei.","If she didn’t punish them, it would definitely lead to a huge mistake!","If they thought that Ye Jian wasn’t capable, sure!","They thought that Ye Jian would implicate the class, fine!","They didn’t agree to having Ye Jian stick around, alright!","These opinions were only directed at Ye Jian. They could not spread and affect other people."]},{"number":5124,"title":"Chapter 5124: Criticism","paragraphs":["Five minutes later, all the female soldiers ran back to the dormitory at their fastest speed to pack.","\"Ye Jian didn’t come back. She’s clearly the worst. She’s even running away so that she doesn’t have to do the 20-kilometer cross-country! Why didn’t the squad leader find her?\"","The female soldiers ran back to the dormitory to pack their luggage. As they tidied up, they muttered in a low voice, \"She missed out on punishments a few times. Is she doing it on purpose?\"","\"Alright, stop talking. Let her escape. When the time comes, everyone will know that she can’t do it. It won’t be long before she gets kicked out of the team.\"","\"We’ve been saying that she would leave the team every day. It’s been almost two months but she hasn’t left. The squad leader doesn’t dare to report the problem to Captain Lei either. Should we go and voice out?\"","\"Forget it, it’s useless! It’ll only work if she leaves the team voluntarily! Unfortunately, she’s too shameless. She knows that we all have something against her, but she has never thought of leaving.\"","When Guo Cui, who was tidying her satchel, heard this, her expression changed again and again. She tied the rope around her backpack and looked coldly at the female soldier who was still talking non-stop. \"Are you done? Does it feel good to always criticize others behind their backs?","\"No matter how bad Ye Jian’s personal ability is, at least she has never criticized you behind your backs! Can’t you stop for a while?","\"You keep saying that Ye Jian can’t do it. Do you think you’re all that? Are all of you amazing?\"","She opened her mouth suddenly and spoke up for Ye Jian. The female soldiers in the dormitory were embarrassed. Guo Cui performed well in class and usually took care of them. Now that she stood up for Ye Jian, they couldn’t retaliate.","But Lu Hui, who was also very capable, dared to do so. Hearing that, she smiled coldly. \"What’s the matter? Just because she helped you once, you think kindly of her? Don’t you remember the times she implicated us?","\"Don’t forget that when the two of you had to pack the parachutes, you got implicated and lost every day! I remember that you had a bad impression of her at that time. You even asked the squad leader to change your assistant.\"","The two of them needed to cooperate to pack the parachutes. After packing one person’s parachute, they would pack the other person’s. Ye Jian, who had just arrived, partnered with Guo Cui for the first half a month, so she said many unpleasant words.","Guo Cui snorted. \"That’s because she just came. She didn’t know anything. Has she lost recently? It’s been less than two months of training. Why haven’t you seen her hard work?!\"","\"Do you still want to continue quarreling? Do you still want to run for another 20 kilometers?\" The deputy squad leader, who applied to leave the camp and returned to the dormitory late, heard that the female soldiers were quarreling because of Ye Jian again and reprimanded them with a cold expression. \"You’re quarreling every day. Do you think the military unit is a market where you can quarrel and kick up a fuss whenever you want? Look at you now. Do you look like soldiers? If you continue quarreling, we’ll double the cross-country!\"","20 kilometers of weighted cross-country had to be completed after leaving the military camp. Any soldier who left the military camp had to apply in advance. Even if it was training, the entire class had to apply in advance.","Five minutes later, the 14 female soldiers gathered. Ye Jian, who didn’t know anything, still didn’t appear in the line. After reporting the number, the squad leader didn’t send anyone to look for Ye Jian. She led the 13 female soldiers to complete the 20-kilometer cross-country.","Within five minutes, the deputy squad leader applied to leave the camp for training. In front of Ye Jian, Captain Lei agreed to the 20-kilometer armed cross-country run that the female soldier class suddenly decided on."]},{"number":5125,"title":"Chapter 5125: She’s Scary","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who was undergoing off-plane training, took three steps away from the simulation plane platform. Captain Lei raised his head and looked at Ye Jian, who was already leaving the plane. He didn’t plan to tell Ye Jian that the female soldier class had left for training.","20 kilometers of weighted cross-country was not a problem for Ye Jian. As a special forces soldier from the army, weighted cross-country was a common thing.","Currently, what Ye Jian needed to improve the most was parachute training. There was still a week before the female soldier class needed to undergo night airborne training. Ye Jian, who had become a mid-ranger, needed to complete it in advance so that she could follow the female soldiers’ night airborne training a week later.","Whether Ye Jian could complete the night airborne training with the female soldiers a week later or not, Captain Lei was quite confident in her. He took over Ye Jian’s training record from the male soldier, Small Head. He flipped through it from the first page and looked through it carefully. From this, he could tell how hard Ye Jian had worked and how much she had improved.","Small Head was convinced by Ye Jian now. \"Her speed of improvement is like a fast-forwarding machine. She’s improving by leaps and bounds every day. She’s only been training for less than two months, but she looks like a veteran now. I tremble in fear when I see her from the side. If I hadn’t seen her train for more than half a month, I would’ve suspected that she was actually an airborne soldier.","\"Amazing, she’s really amazing! She’s number one among the 15 female soldiers.\"","The rustling sound of pages being turned could be heard. Captain Lei, who started reading the second page, smiled and said, \"Aren’t you afraid at all?\"","From the records, her progress was indeed as fast as what Small Head said. He could see her changing day by day and improving day by day. She was good at enduring hardships and had talent.","Especially when her muscle memory was formed. She was faster than other people. That was why her improvement was exceptionally fast.","Small Head wasn’t the only one who felt frightened when he saw this. Captain Lei felt the same way when he saw her daily records.","He raised his head and looked at Ye Jian’s training. He then glanced at Captain Lei, who was looking at the record book. Smiling, he asked, \"Afraid? What should I be afraid of?\"","\"She’s improving so quickly. Aren’t you afraid that she’ll surpass you one day?\" Captain Lei wasn’t joking. He asked seriously, \"Aren’t you afraid of being surpassed by a female soldier with no foundation?\"","The squad leader, who had never thought of this before, was stunned. He stared at the figure of the female soldier training above and quickly recalled the half a month he had been leading the team for training. Was he afraid...? He was a little scared now!","\"It’s not scary to be surpassed by her. What’s scary is that none of us realized that she would surpass us one day,\" Captain Lei said in a low voice. There was a serious and cold expression on his face. \"She’s already working so hard to complete two training sessions in one day. It looks like we have to increase our training too.\"","Every day, after Ye Jian completed the female soldier training, she would be brought to the male soldiers’ training base by Captain Lei to complete another training. Through the training on both sides, they would close the distance between Ye Jian and the female soldiers.","In less than two months, Ye Jian, who had zero foundation, completed all the parachute landing training and reached the qualification level. Now, she just had to strengthen her training, and it was harder than before. However, they had never heard Ye Jian say that it was hard. She was able to persevere every day and complete the missions assigned to her every day.","Were they afraid?","They were afraid!","Even Captain Lei was afraid!"]},{"number":5126,"title":"Chapter 5126: Power","paragraphs":["He looked at the female soldier on the simulated plane platform. He saw that she had shrunk her head, bent her back, hugged her chest, retracted her abdomen, and bent her knees. She jumped off the platform and landed steadily. Captain Lei pursed his lips slightly. There was a firm look in his bright eyes.","Commander Kong wanted Ye Jian to train the 14 female soldiers. From the looks of it, the male soldiers had already been trained before the female soldiers were trained by Ye Jian.","No wonder Commander Kong wanted to transfer Ye Jian, who was from the army, to the military unit. He finally understood Commander Kong’s painstaking efforts.","When the male soldiers below saw Ye Jian landing, they gave her a thumbs-up and laughed loudly. \"Beautifully done, very good!\"","\"Thank you!\" Ye Jian replied loudly with strong confidence.","Captain Lei didn’t look at the record book anymore. He didn’t need to look at it anymore. From the jump she completed, he could tell that she had improved. Her movements were so standard that she didn’t look like a female soldier who had just entered the air force less than two months ago!","\"50 jumps from the five-meter simulation frame! Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!\"","\"Yes!\"","Ye Jian, who jumped down, didn’t rest for a minute. She immediately ran to the five-meter-tall simulation rack and started the next enhanced training.","These were all parachute landing movements training. During the day, in the female soldier class, she needed to jump down from a 1.5-meter platform and a 5-meter simulation platform to practice her departure and landing posture. During the day, she needed to do it at least 200 times.","When the female soldiers were resting, Ye Jian still needed to run to where the male soldiers were to train at least 50 times! Ye Jian’s legs were swollen every day after such high-intensity training.","Every soldier needed to experience it before they could surpass and defeat themselves again and again.","Ye Jian, who had already boarded a plane and parachuted before, devoted 120% of her combat spirit to airborne training. She wanted to grow stronger through sweat!","\"Enter the aerial manipulation training. Ye Jian, get ready!\"","\"Yes!\"","After completing today’s one-hour training, Ye Jian didn’t even wipe the sweat off her face. She threw herself into the next group of training—aerial operation training.","During the aerial manipulation training, her body was hanging in the air. The instructor gave an order to simulate all kinds of situations in the air. Ye Jian dealt with them accordingly.","The instructors were all male soldiers from Captain Lei’s team. They were elites of the air force. This was Ye Jian’s first training with them. She didn’t dare to raise her head the entire time.","\"The parachute is big on the left and small on the right. Deal with it!","\"A parachute rope has been found. Handle it!","\"The focus is more on the left. Deal with it!\"","All kinds of orders were given, and Ye Jian kept completing them. The reaction of her brain and the speed of her hand had to be complementary. If she was a little slower, she would be scolded!","Fortunately, Ye Jian wasn’t scolded anymore. After being scolded for three consecutive days, that was enough!","\"Land impact adaptation training!\"","\"Yes!\"","The landing impact adaptation training consisted of three cement platforms of different heights. They would start from the lowest to the highest and jump down without any discomfort.","Ye Jian no longer felt any discomfort, but she still continued. She had to train harder every day to prepare for the next plane jump.","From 5:00 pm to 7:00 pm, Ye Jian completed two hours of intensive training. She only had five minutes to eat. Right on the heels of that, she had to return to the female soldier class to complete her night ground training.","The special reconnaissance soldiers in the air force were so strong because they used sweat and blood to exchange for it."]},{"number":5127,"title":"Chapter 5127: Sweat","paragraphs":["After the landing impact training, Ye Jian was so tired that she wanted to crawl.","She spent almost every year in high-intensity training. Even when she was in school, she would consciously increase the mileage of her training. However, compared to her current training, Ye Jian felt that the previous training wasn’t too tiring!","After training for more than half a month, Ye Jian, who had always been able to endure hardships, felt tired.","However, airborne soldiers were high-risk soldiers. If they didn’t strengthen their training during normal times, they would die on the real battlefield. Infantry could attack the enemy’s territory in groups, but airborne soldiers had to parachute into the enemy’s territory in small teams. They were bound to be surrounded. After a few days of airborne training, Ye Jian had already understood the danger.","\"How is it? Can you still walk?\" Small Head, the male soldier in charge of training, smiled and asked Ye Jian, who was panting heavily. \"If you can’t walk, just sit for a while. It’s just that you might not be able to have dinner.\"","Ye Jian moved her sore legs and smiled. \"Even if I have to crawl, I’ll crawl over to eat. If not, I won’t have the energy to train at night.\"","\"You’re a real man! Come, let’s eat together!\" The squad leader, who hadn’t eaten, didn’t help Ye Jian walk. She wasn’t a new recruit who needed to be cared about. She wasn’t so delicate.","Ye Jian naturally didn’t need the male soldier who was in charge of guiding her training to support her. She ended the female soldier’s training in the day while the male soldiers ended their training in the day before training her. Everyone was the same. There was no reason for them to persevere while she needed help.","There was no gender on the battlefield. There was only one identity—a soldier!","As night fell, Ye Jian, who had finished her training, followed the male soldiers to the cafeteria. There were three male soldiers in charge of Ye Jian’s training. They were all elites.","\"You still need to practice more during the landing training. Your legs aren’t stable enough during the buffer landing. Once the chassis is unstable, it’s very easy to get injured during the landing. You have to pay attention to this. I suggest that you tie sandbags around your legs for the five-kilometer run tomorrow morning to increase your stability.\"","\"When I jumped down, I kept feeling that something was pulling me forward. It should be because I didn’t grasp my center of gravity properly when I landed.\"","\"Yes, you must hold on to your center of gravity and not deviate from it. And your weight...\" The male soldier who pointed out the problem with Ye Jian’s landing paused for a moment. He sized up Ye Jian. Then, he laughed and said, \"You’re too skinny. You’re too light.\"","Ye Jian, who was 1.68 meters tall, was on the skinny side. This was the first time the male soldiers brought her for training. Their first reaction was to think that she might be blown away by the wind.","Fortunately, through training, this didn’t happen.","As the three male soldiers walked, they told Ye Jian what other details she needed to pay attention to during today’s training. They pointed it out seriously, and Ye Jian listened to them attentively.","Three elites came to guide Ye Jian. Such high standards of guidance naturally led to high standards and requirements.","They had high standards for themselves and high expectations for Ye Jian.","Captain Lei, who had been standing not far away, looked at the female soldier who was walking over with the male soldiers. When they got closer, Captain Lei smiled and clapped.","Ye Jian, who was still sweating profusely, heard the sound and went over. She immediately recognized the person who was clapping in the night. Small Head whispered to Ye Jian, \"Our captain was watching from the side when you just entered the off-air training. He has been watching for more than an hour.\""]},{"number":5128,"title":"Chapter 5128: Who Are You Trying To Scare","paragraphs":["The training had ended, so there was no need to be so restrained as he spoke.","\"He’s been standing there for so long? Don’t tell me he hasn’t eaten?\" Ye Jian quickly looked at Captain Lei in front. She couldn’t help but speed up a little. \"Then let’s walk a little faster. I’m afraid he has something to tell me if he’s been waiting for more than an hour.\"","\"Afraid of being reprimanded by our captain?\" The squad leader suppressed his laughter and teased, \"Our captain’s scolding is definitely a classic in the country. He’ll scold you until you feel that you were reincarnated in the wrong life.\"","The two male soldiers at the back laughed until Ye Jian’s scalp turned numb. \"It’s not that scary, right? Why don’t you cover me and I’ll escape first?\"","\"Do you think that’s possible?\"","\"It’s impossible,\" Ye Jian replied seriously.","\"Please get ready!\" Small Head replied even more seriously.","\"Don’t listen to his nonsense. The captain won’t scold you. He’ll only scold us.\" The two male soldiers at the back couldn’t bear to watch anymore. What kind of man was Small Head to scare a female soldier?","Ye Jian, who was in a relaxed mood, pursed her lips and smiled. \"I’ll tell the captain the truth about what Small Head said just now. If someone’s really scolded, I think Small Head will be the first to get it.\"","\"I was wrong, Ye Jian!\"","\"You didn’t do anything wrong. It was all for my own good.\"","\"I was really wrong!\" Small Head begged for mercy. Was something wrong with his brain just now? He actually wanted to scare Ye Jian!","Captain Lei looked at the four figures walking over. They had a harmonious atmosphere between them. The smile on his face got deeper. Ye Jian had never been affected by the female soldiers’ rejection. She kept improving her mentality. If this continued, he suspected that she would surpass the female soldiers in less than half a year!","\"Captain!\"","\"Captain!\"","Four figures sounded at the same time. Captain Lei nodded slightly. His gaze landed on Ye Jian. There was approval in his eyes. \"I was watching your training just now. Not bad, Ye Jian. I can’t see any traces of the army on you. You’re now a member of the air force.\"","Seeing that her eyes were still bright, Captain Lei couldn’t help but praise her, \"Ye Jian, you’re really outstanding. I’m shocked!\"","This was the only way to express Captain Lei’s feelings.","Ye Jian’s face was red from training. No part of her body was dry anymore. She smiled and shook her head, looking as if she had been fished out of the water. \"I’m still far from meeting Commander Kong’s requirements. I have to continue working hard.\"","She was still not satisfied with her speed of improvement.","Captain Lei laughed. \"Ye Jian, Ye Jian, you’re amazing. You’re still not satisfied with yourself?\"","Afraid that Ye Jian would give him too much pressure, Captain Lei retracted his smile and advised her gently, \"It’s good to be strict with yourself, but you don’t have to be tense all the time. You need to relax occasionally.","\"There are still four months. I believe that you will definitely surpass them. At that time, the female soldiers will know how wrong they are.\"","Captain Lei already knew what Commander Kong had talked to Ye Jian about in private. In order to let the female soldiers adapt to high-intensity training in the future, Commander Kong actually let Ye Jian hide her strength first and then suppress the female soldiers... This was a slightly ’naughty’ commander!","As for the female soldiers... Alas, Ye Jian disguised herself too perfectly. They still didn’t notice it until now. Every day, they still thought that Ye Jian was dragging them down. Every day, they had their opinions of Ye Jian. All of them wanted to kick her out as soon as possible. Half a year later... Captain Lei revealed a meaningful smile on his tanned face. He was looking forward to what would happen half a year later. The three male soldiers also reported Ye Jian’s training today to Captain Lei."]},{"number":5129,"title":"Chapter 5129: Grievance","paragraphs":["Captain Lei, who hadn’t had dinner, asked Small Head and the other two male soldiers to talk as they walked. When Ye Jian saw this, she was worried that her time was a little tight and she wouldn’t be able to catch up with the female soldier class. Hence, she suggested leaving first.","Captain Lei waved his hand and smiled. \"There’s no hurry. Let’s eat first. We’ll arrange tonight’s training after dinner.\"","Ye Jian glanced at Captain Lei and raised her eyebrows with a smile. \"If I don’t go over, I’ll be criticized again. Captain Lei, I’ve never been criticized so much before entering the air force.\"","This sentence made Captain Lei, Small Head, and the other male soldiers laugh. They more or less knew that the female soldiers were ostracizing her. Among them, Captain Lei was the most aware of it.","Because of Commander Kong’s instructions, she had indeed suffered grievances here.","\"Then scold them back. When you leave the military unit in the future, you won’t be able to scold them even if you want to. They have a weighted cross-country run tonight. They made a last-minute decision and will probably only come back in the middle of the night. You don’t have to do it.\" Captain Lei smiled as he asked Ye Jian, who was frowning slightly, \"Do you feel wronged? Do you have the urge to scold them back?\"","Did he think that she was an impulsive recruit?","They decided to cross-country for 20 kilometers at the last minute. This time, she didn’t go... When they came back, she would have to listen to their insults again.","Ye Jian laughed. \"I truly don’t have the urge to scold them back. I’ve already been criticized so much. If I still talk back, they’ll really find something to use against me.","No matter how much the female soldiers disliked Ye Jian, Ye Jian never retaliated. She accepted their criticism and punishment humbly. This gave the female soldiers the impression that she was ’honest’.","She was an honest person with a beautiful face.","Small head and the others who were in charge of Ye Jian’s training also knew that she was hiding her competence in front of the female soldiers. Upon hearing this, Small Head was the first to comfort Ye Jian, \"Only those who have endured hardships can become the best. After half a year, it’ll be your turn to beat them up, to hold your head high and be full of energy. Who else but you can do that?","\"Well said. You’ve said everything I wanted to say.\" The male soldier in charge of Ye Jian’s landing training rolled his eyes at his comrades. Then, he smiled and comforted Ye Jian, \"They’re blind. In the future, when you take revenge, they won’t dare to say anything.\"","Another male soldier with the surname Guan agreed with his comrades. \"That’s right, that’s right. We can’t look at the immediate future. We need to look at the long-term. Think about it. You need to stay in the military unit for two years. You’ll only be aggrieved for half a year. They’ll be aggrieved for a year and a half!\"","Ye Jian couldn’t stop smiling. \"Thank you for your consolation, instructors. For now, although they have some opinions about me, they don’t have any bad intentions. They’re purely standing in the position of an airborne soldier. They think that I’m unsuitable to stay and should return to the army military unit.","\"When I’m training, they’ll correct me in time and not pretend that they didn’t notice anything. Actually, I’m quite grateful for their corrections. Hence, although I feel a little aggrieved, it’s still tolerable.\"","Half a year. Ye Jian also hoped that half a year would pass quickly. Most importantly, she had to surpass the female soldiers within half a year. If not, Commander Kong’s intention of transferring her over would be in vain.","Captain Lei let his comrades comfort Ye Jian. He paid attention to the changes in Ye Jian’s facial expression. He heaved a sigh of relief when he saw that she didn’t take the female soldiers’ ostracization to heart."]},{"number":5130,"title":"Chapter 5130: Top Soldiers","paragraphs":["Commander Kong called her every few days to ask about her situation. He also asked him to understand Ye Jian’s personal movements at all times, especially her personal emotions. Once he discovered any problems, he would deal with them appropriately. He didn’t care if Captain Lei had to stay up overnight to deal with the issues. He also warned him that if anything happened to Ye Jian in his team, he would be held accountable as the captain.","As a result, Captain Lei was under a lot of psychological pressure.","Fortunately, Ye Jian was very hardworking. In terms of life, training, and interpersonal relationships... She didn’t make him worry in any aspect. She also performed outstandingly in all aspects, making him feel especially at ease. Every time he reported to or received a call from the commander, he felt relaxed.","She was such an outstanding soldier. Every time Captain Lei saw Ye Jian, he found it a pity that she wasn’t really a member of the air force.","Every time they chatted, Captain Lei couldn’t help but persuade Ye Jian to stay. She should take advantage of every opportunity, like now.","\"If you don’t want to feel aggrieved, it’s simple. Transfer here and become one of us. Then, show them your true ability. They’ll definitely admire you. From then on, they won’t dare to say anything bad about you.\"","Small Head and the other two male soldiers were definitely on Captain Lei’s side. Hearing that, all of them started persuading her.","\"That’s right, that’s right. You’ve been in the army for so long anyway. Isn’t it good to change branches? I think as long as you say the word, Commander Kong will definitely settle it for you!\"","\"The air force is so good. We can even fight in the sky. The army can only fight on the ground. It’s a little boring.\"","\"If you stay, you’ll definitely be in charge of the 14 female soldiers. At that time, they won’t dare to defy your orders!\"","Everyone was persuading Ye Jian to stay. Based on her current speed of improvement, she was definitely a top soldier!","Talents were popular wherever they went.","The night breeze blew over, blowing away the sweat on Ye Jian’s body. It also brought a hint of coldness. Ye Jian listened to Captain Lei and the rest. But besides smiling slightly, she didn’t say anything else.","If she didn’t agree, that meant it was impossible. Captain Lei, who failed to lure her again, could only sigh again.","The temperature difference between morning and night in the Southwest Plateau was huge. Today, the highest temperature in the day was 21 degrees Celsius. Now, it was only 16 or 17 degrees Celsius. In the early morning, the temperature dropped to the lowest eight degrees Celsius.","Ye Jian, who was drenched in sweat, was quite resistant to the cold. Even though she was drenched in sweat and her training uniform was wet inside and out, she didn’t feel too cold in the cold night.","She didn’t say anything, so Captain Lei and the other male soldiers didn’t think too much about it. They walked from the sports ground to the cafeteria. Small Head and the rest had already reported Ye Jian’s two-hour intensive training in the evening.","When they arrived at the cafeteria, Small Head and the other two male soldiers got the food they reserved. There was soup, meat, and a small amount of vegetables. It was considered a good meal.","After five minutes of dinner, Ye Jian prepared to rest for half an hour before continuing her training. The female soldiers were completing their 20-kilometer cross-country run. She couldn’t be idle because of this. She had to hurry up and train.","However, Captain Lei had other plans.","Ye Jian’s heartbeat didn’t calm down until she got on the transport plane. Captain Lei had other arrangements for her. She was to complete the night landing with the male soldiers!","The night landing would only start a week later, but she was doing it in advance!","The feeling of being airborne at night was completely different from being airborne during the day. The danger factor increased exponentially. The field of vision on the ground was smaller, so it was difficult to observe the situation on the ground during the descent. It was easy to encounter problems when landing. Hanging on trees, falling off a cliff, falling into the water, getting injured... These were all very likely to happen. In addition to determining and mastering the timing of the ground landing, it also required a strong psychological quality and parachute landing skills.","Captain Lei felt that Ye Jian had both. She could enter the night airborne training in advance."]},{"number":5131,"title":"Chapter 5131: Are You Retarded?","paragraphs":["Ye Jian’s night landing was a last-minute arrangement. Even the three male soldiers, who were in charge of training her, didn’t know about it. When Captain Lei told Ye Jian in the cafeteria to prepare for tonight’s night landing, Small Head thought that Ye Jian only needed to prepare.","Before leaving the cafeteria, Small Head even teased Ye Jian with a smile, \"You can prepare well. A week later, you’ll complete the night landing and let the female soldiers see how you surpass them perfectly as an army soldier.\"","His teasing almost made Ye Jian think that she had misunderstood what Captain Lei meant. Captain Lei slapped the back of Squad Leader Xiao’s head. \"Nonsense! Hurry up and bring Ye Jian to prepare!\"","\"Yes!\" Small Head rubbed the back of his head. \"Captain, can you pat me gently? It hurts.\"","\"Oh, so you do feel pain. I thought your brain was made of wood. Hurry up and get lost. We’ll gather at 7:30 pm. You still have ten minutes.\"","Ye Jian confirmed that she wasn’t ’preparing’. She would really descend at night!","It was not until Ye Jian carried her parachute and her name appeared on the list of people who would complete the night landing that Small Head realized that Ye Jian would really do the night landing with them.","This was a little scary!","When he saw Ye Jian boarding the transport plane quickly, her back view was so calm that she looked like a veteran who had experienced thousands of night landings. He said to Captain Lei worriedly, \"Captain, aren’t you a little too bold?\"","\"No matter how powerful Ye Jian is, she hasn’t even trained for two months. If we arrange for her to land at night, what if something happens? How are we going to answer to the army? Let’s not talk about the army first. It’ll be hard to even answer to our commander. He’ll skin us alive.\"","Captain Lei was the last to board the plane. He saw Ye Jian’s every move. Hearing that, he smiled and asked Small Head, \"When do you think is the most suitable time for the night landing, then?\"","Small Head said seriously, \"We have to look at the training situation for the next week. She should at least train for two months. It’s safer.\"","\"Your main point is that it isn’t time yet, so we can’t arrange for Ye Jian to do night landing training?\" Captain Lei asked again, \"Besides the time, is there any other factor?\"","The main point was that the time wasn’t right. Small Head shook his head. \"Everything else is fine. I just feel that time is a little too rushed. You suddenly decided to arrange for her to do a night landing. I wonder if she’s mentally prepared.\"","\"Did you see Ye Jian panic just now?\"","\"No, her back view is like a veteran who has jumped hundreds of times in the night. She’s calm and composed.\" Small Head chuckled. \"Her mentality is definitely strong. My hands and feet were trembling when I fell for the first time.\"","So...","Captain Lei patted Small Head’s shoulder and said earnestly, \"That’s why she’s better than you. In less than two months, her comprehensive ability has improved faster than your half a year of training. Accept your fate, kid. In two years, she’ll surpass you.\"","Small Head was stunned. He only reacted after a few soldiers boarded the transport plane. \"Captain, you can’t make fun of me like this. It was good enough that I could complete the night parachute landing after six months.\"","Captain Lei looked at Small Head as if he were talking to the mentally handicapped. \"So what? Ye Jian can complete it in less than two months. She took less than three months to complete the three major comprehensive training sets and caught up with your half a year of training. Your skills are nothing in front of her.\"","It wasn’t a blow to Small Head. It was the truth."]},{"number":5132,"title":"Chapter 5132: The Night Sky","paragraphs":["Although this was the truth, Small Head was still dealt a blow.","He looked at Captain Lei pitifully and begged him to let him off. \"Captain, I’m just worried about Ye Jian’s safety. Aren’t you a little too ruthless? Why are you bringing up the past? Didn’t you always tell us to move on? The past is the past.\"","In the past, Small Head had a bad impression of Ye Jian. Now, he was like her sidekick!","If they didn’t poach Ye Jian and bring her back to the military unit...","Captain Lei snorted and sneered. \"You’re worried that Ye Jian will encounter danger if she parachutes at night. That’s fine. You’re concerned about your comrade. However, you can’t doubt if she has the right to join in night training. As her instructor, you should know better than anyone whether she can succeed or not.","\"Look at Guan Cheng and Ding Xiaoping. Before we gathered, they wanted to ask me if I could let Ye Jian complete a night landing with the male soldiers in advance. The two of them thought that Ye Jian was qualified to parachute down at night with her current standards. Why are you still full of doubt?","\"Do you suspect that Ye Jian’s ability is not good enough, or do you suspect that your teaching skills are not good enough and that you didn’t teach Ye Jian well?\"","These words were really irrefutable. The defeated squad leader surrendered and straightened his chest. He replied confidently, \"Reporting to the captain, I don’t have any doubts. I believe that Ye Jian will definitely be able to complete the night parachute landing!\"","They were a certain distance away from the transport plane. The rumbling sound didn’t affect their communication. Captain Lei saw that Small Head had a good understanding, so he raised his hand to let him off.","All the airborne soldiers boarded the plane. Captain Lei, who was the last to board, strode onto the transport plane and sat down in the empty seat beside Ye Jian.","The seats were all reserved in advance. Before Ye Jian boarded the plane, she knew that Captain Lei would sit with her.","The plane door was closed, and the cabin was completely sealed. With the guidance of the command tower and the flag of the soldiers on the ground waving, the large transport plane carrying 140 people raised its nose and rushed into the smoky green night.","This night landing was arranged at the back of the city. The transport plane would fly over the brightly lit city before entering the night landing area. The young air force soldiers sitting in the transport plane didn’t have many expressions on their faces. After passing three checkpoints, they were all very calm. They hugged their parachutes as they sat. They would wait for the signal lights to light up before jumping out of the plane and looking at the hazy sky that they were protecting with their lives.","Captain Lei sat down and looked at the young soldiers around him. Then, he smiled and asked Ye Jian, \"How are you feeling? Are you excited?\"","He didn’t ask Ye Jian if she was afraid because he couldn’t see any fear on her face.","Ye Jian smiled until the corners of her mouth were raised. \"I was quite excited when I was checking my parachute just now. After coming to the resting area, my mood became calm.\"","Ye Jian seemed to have thought of something and smiled deeply again. \"The instructors knew that this was my first night landing and specially checked my parachute again. They also told me that night landing is more exciting than day landing. The scenery will be more magnificent. When descending, I’ll look down at the ground more. No matter how afraid I am, I’ll gradually calm down because of this land.","\"I’m looking forward to what kind of night scenery I’ll see when I descend. It’ll definitely be more beautiful than the night scenery I see when I fly at night.\"","This was Ye Jian’s first night landing. She wasn’t afraid. She was looking forward to it."]},{"number":5133,"title":"Chapter 5133: Looking Up","paragraphs":["The air force was famous for their all-round combat. Night combat ability was an important indicator for assessing airborne combat ability. Night parachute training was an important training subject. Ye Jian was eager to complete it.","There was no fear. There was only anticipation and no panic. There was only calmness. This was the female soldier that Commander Kong spent a certain amount of effort to poach from the army to train with the female soldiers. When he saw her smile, Captain Lei couldn’t help but trust her.","Captain Lei smiled. \"Sitting on the plane and looking at the scenery is completely different from the scenery you see when you jump from the transportation plane. The former is a still painting, while the latter will let you understand why you want to protect this land and let you know what it means to be surrounded by thousands of lights.\"","Captain Lei didn’t need to say anything else. Ye Jian wasn’t a new recruit. She had a strong psychological quality and had long passed the stage where she needed to be comforted and given courage. He just needed to wait for her to complete the night parachute drop.","The transport plane flew past. The female soldiers who were doing a weighted cross-country run for 20 kilometers raised their heads and looked at the sky. It was a transport plane that flew out of the military unit airport. It had arranged for male soldiers to land at night.","The female soldiers didn’t retract their envious gazes until the transport plane flew out of their vision.","When would it be their turn?","\"Follow, follow! Maintain the formation!\"","\"Guo Cui, why are you looking back? Hurry up and catch up! Can’t you see that you’ve fallen behind?\"","The squad leader standing at the side of the road kept an eye on the formation and urged the female soldiers to follow closely so that they wouldn’t fall behind. 20 kilometers of weighted cross-country at night was much more dangerous than during the day. As the squad leader, she had to keep an eye on them at all times.","Guo Cui, who had fallen behind, heard the squad leader’s urging and waved her hands. Carrying the heavy parachute bag and backpack, she followed the team. She turned around to see if the only figure that didn’t join them was catching up. If she caught up, she would complete the 20-kilometer weighted cross-country run with her.","Unfortunately, they had left the base for more than an hour but Ye Jian still hadn’t caught up with them. It looked like she was really absent tonight.","\"Even if you turn around and look at the back, Ye Jian won’t appear. Save your energy,\" Lu Hui said in a low voice. She pulled Guo Cui so that she could catch up with the formation faster. \"Don’t think that I target Ye Jian every day just because I don’t like her. If I were in the Aerial 18th Division, I would definitely not target her.","\"Of course. In the past, I did target her for personal reasons, but that’s not the case later on. I’m not blind. I’ve seen her hard work.","\"But it’s different here. This is a special forces unit in the air force. We’re special reconnaissance soldiers, the most dangerous type of soldiers in the entire air force. No matter how hard she tries, it’ll be useless if she doesn’t have the skills. If she really goes to the battlefield in the future, she’ll die!","\"Ye Jian started later than us. You’ve seen her personal ability. What’s the use of working hard? She hasn’t improved much. Her ability is limited. Are we really going to let her die?","\"We’re still undergoing the basic training of the special reconnaissance soldiers. In another month or so, she won’t even be able to keep up with the company’s basic training. Do you expect her to keep up with the intensive training?","\"There’s a sacrifice rate for forceful training. With her current ability, isn’t there a high chance that she’ll be part of the stats? It’s very high! A female soldier from the Aerial 18th Division died because of this in the past.","\"Don’t always think that we’re targeting Ye Jian for personal reasons and want to chase her out of the class. As long as she has any hope, we’ll help her. Haven’t we helped her enough recently?\""]},{"number":5134,"title":"Chapter 5134: Suspect","paragraphs":["Lu Hui spoke faster. She pulled Guo Cui and walked quickly while talking a lot. Guo Cui heard a lot of it, but she had doubts about everything that was said.","Lu Hui wasn’t targeting Ye Jian personally but Ye Jian’s ability?","What was the difference?","Why did she feel that there was no difference?","Lu Hui targeted Ye Jian because Ye Jian’s personal ability was not good enough. If she continued to stay, she might be sacrificed. This sentence hit the nail on the head.","In her old unit, once it was discovered that a soldier was not suitable to become a qualified paratrooper, they would usually be transferred to the logistics group. The logistics group also had day and night drops, but they were relatively less, which was very suitable for soldiers like Ye Jian who had average ability and were very honest.","Lu Hui wasn’t the only one who thought this way. She even wondered if she should mention it to Ye Jian.","But Guo Cui... For some reason, she felt that it wasn’t the case for Ye Jian. She felt that something was amiss.","Lu Hui, who was being doubted, frowned angrily. She glanced at Guo Cui, who had been silent all this while. She pursed her lips. \"I know that I’m quite a loud mouth. But if I can save a life, I’ll continue to be annoying.\"","As she spoke, she pulled a long face and revealed a sharp look she often showed when she was criticizing Ye Jian. \"It’s up to you whether you believe me or not. Anyway, I’ve made myself clear. In the future, as long as Ye Jian doesn’t improve, I’ll continue voicing my opinion until she leaves!\"","Guo Cui’s relationship with the female soldiers was alright. Although she had an opinion about Lu Hui, who liked to target Ye Jian the most, their relationship wasn’t bad. As long as it didn’t have anything to do with Ye Jian, their relationship was alright.","Guo Cui wasn’t a hard-hearted person. She said, \"Can’t you just say that you don’t want to see anything happen to Ye Jian? You’re the most annoying person in the class. You always like to say that Ye Jian can’t do it. Even when you’re correcting Ye Jian, your expression is as if she owes you a million dollars. It’s infuriating.\"","\"My expression is bad? I’m just being serious!\" Lu Hui was so angry that she pinched Guo Cui’s arm. \"Girl, is that how you think of me? I’ve helped you for nothing!\"","Guo Cui smiled and released her arm. \"Stop flattering yourself. You’re sarcastic and mean. Ye Jian is honest and didn’t do anything to you. If you continue to bully an honest person, the honest person will lose their temper one day.\"","Lu Hui snorted softly and said coldly, \"I hope that she’ll lose her temper. She should at least let me see some courage in her. In the end, there’s nothing. I can’t see any courage, and I can’t see any room for improvement.","\"She only focuses on training all day long. She doesn’t even make a sound. The more I look at her, the angrier I get. She’s a soldier, after all. Doesn’t she know how to resist? If she really resists, I’ll think highly of her!\"","It sounded like twisted logic, but it made sense too. Soldiers had to have courage and anger. But Ye Jian was so honest that she allowed others to push her around. Sometimes, it made people angry.","This was also the main reason why Guo Cui didn’t stand on Ye Jian’s side even though Ye Jian had helped her once.","It was just that... Ye Jian was too honest. She was unbelievably honest.","Guo Cui pursed her lips and thought for a moment. She asked Lu Hui, \"Don’t you think that Ye Jian’s honesty is a little strange?\"","\"She’s so honest that it’s a little strange? Is there anything strange about being honest?\" Lu Hui rolled her eyes at Guo Cui as if she had heard a joke that wasn’t funny. \"What’s strange about it? I feel that everything is normal.\"","What was strange? Ever since Ye Jian calmly saved Guo Cui, Guo Cui felt that it was very strange!"]},{"number":5135,"title":"Chapter 5135: Analysis","paragraphs":["Lu Hui didn’t think there was anything strange about Ye Jian at all. She was slow in everything she did. Even when she spoke, she was slow. She looked anxious.","Was it difficult to be more agile and bold?","Guo Cui, who was a chatterbox, sorted out what she thought was strange for a while. Through her observation of Ye Jian, she told Lu Hui everything that she felt was strange. Lu Hui stared, opened her mouth wide, was surprised and then horrified, and she had very vivid expressions on her face.","\"It can’t be!","\"No way!","\"You’re thinking too much!","\"That’s impossible!","\"That shouldn’t be!","\"That doesn’t make sense!","\"Absolutely not!","\"You must be thinking too much!","\"Now that you mention it... it does seem a little strange.\"","Her expression kept changing. From the initial disapproval to the feeling that it was a little strange, the entire process took ten minutes.","They could talk to each other as they completed the 20-kilometers cross-country run. Talking could distract them from being ’tired’. If they really felt tired, they could encourage each other. Hence, as long as they didn’t delay the progress of the main team, it wasn’t against the rules.","Of course, it was only limited to the fact that no civilians were present. The civilians couldn’t see them.","The military unit that Ye Jian was in was located in the highlands of the southwest. There were very few people here. They might not be able to meet a single civilian even if they walked for an entire night.","However, the squad leader of the female soldier’s class chose to take the main road this time. She didn’t choose the rugged path. The last-minute decision was to prioritize safety.","As they walked along the main road, they could still see the roads that led into Tibet. At night, they would occasionally pass by trucks that entered Tibet.","As the night deepened in the southwest of May, the temperature gradually dropped. A gust of wind blew past the snow mountain. Lu Hui, who was sweating profusely, shivered.","She held Guo Cui’s hand and swallowed her saliva with difficulty. \"From what you said, I, I... I feel that it’s a little strange too. You... Did you tell the squad leader?\" Her voice was dry and tense.","\"No, I only told you about it.\" Guo Cui sighed. \"I was afraid that I was thinking too much. From the looks of it, there might really be a problem.\"","Lu Hui suddenly grabbed Guo Cui’s hand and walked forward quickly. \"Let’s go, let’s go. Let’s talk to the squad leader. After listening to your analysis, I broke out in a cold sweat. Do you think Ye Jian really has a powerful background? That’s very likely! If not, why would she come to our air force when she’s an army soldier?","\"Also, every time, she would return to the dormitory at the latest and leave the dormitory the earliest. Every time the day training ends, Captain Lei would send someone to call her away. This has been going on for half a month!\"","As she spoke, Lu Hui slapped her head fiercely. \"My pig brain! Every day, I think that Ye Jian must be slacking off because she used her connections to get in. Why didn’t I think of the bigger problem?\"","Guo Cui, who was being pulled away, shook off her hand after taking a few steps. \"Don’t be in such a hurry. Let’s straighten things out before reporting to the squad leader.\"","Lu Hui got anxious and pulled Guo Cui’s wrist again. \"How can I not be anxious? If she really has a powerful background, wouldn’t I... be done for?!\"","Guo Cui, who was avoiding her, frowned. \"I don’t like what you’re saying. Are you afraid of Ye Jian just because she has a powerful background? If she doesn’t have a powerful background, are you still going to target her?\""]},{"number":5136,"title":"Chapter 5136: Exposed","paragraphs":["Guo Cui didn’t even want to talk to Lu Hui anymore. In her opinion, Lu Hui was a classic example of bullying the weak and fearing the strong. She shook Lu Hui off and walked forward, ignoring Lu Hui who was chasing after her.","Lu Hui was also angered. She chased after Guo Cui for dozens of meters and finally caught up with her. \"Why are you like a volcano? Can’t you listen to me properly?\"","\"What else do you have to say? You’ve already made it clear! You bully the weak and fear the strong. You’re simply bullying Ye Jian. You like targeting her!\" Guo Cui panted. 15 kilograms of weight was not light. Her shoulders were on the verge of collapsing.","Lu Hui was so angry that she laughed. She couldn’t even flare up if she wanted to. \"Don’t get the main point wrong, okay?","\"Besides, when have I ever bullied Ye Jian? Oh, so I’m not allowed to say anything when she didn’t pass the training? She’s in the wrong and I’m not allowed to criticize her? When have you ever seen me bullying her in my life? Do you know what real bullying is?","\"Didn’t I take her seriously? Did I even target her after my training? Did you see that? She didn’t pass the training. Didn’t you see me correct her? Why did you only see me scolding her? Are you dumb or are you too sensitive?\"","Guo Cui was so angry that her lips were trembling. Her eyes were filled with anger as she lowered her voice and shouted, \"Lu Hui, watch your words! I’m not Ye Jian, who will let you talk nonsense!\"","\"Ha, if you were Ye Jian, she wouldn’t be able to retaliate if I said that today! She can’t even take it. I really don’t know if your old military unit was too lenient in the past.\" Lu Hui rolled her eyes. \"When you were a new recruit, were you never bullied? Were you never shouted at or scolded by veterans? Were you never criticized?","\"Let me tell you, in the Aerial 18th Division, such things are normal! A strict teacher produces a brilliant student, do you understand? You keep saying that I’m targeting her. If I really wanted to target her, I would’ve reported it to Captain Lei every day! It’s hard for me to speak to someone like you!\"","Guo Cui was so angry that smoke was about to come out of her head. But when she heard this, most of the anger in her heart dissipated.","Three months before the new recruits entered the army, all the instructors were amiable and refreshing. This allowed the hesitation of the new recruits to be completely eliminated.","After leaving the company three months later, they realized that as it turned out, the hardships they suffered three months ago weren’t considered hard. They only knew what hardships were after leaving the company.","The instructors were no longer easygoing. They were so strict that the recruits wanted to stab them in private. The squad leader was slightly better, but they couldn’t expect her to protect them in every aspect. If they were outstanding, you would stand at the top. If they dragged the class down and angered the instructors, they would go through torment. The fastest was a month, and the slowest was three months. In that time, they would definitely turn over a new leaf.","This was why some parents wanted to send their children to the military unit.","The military unit was a huge furnace. It could melt away all the bad habits in a person. On the day you were reborn, you would have an outstanding mind, a brave spirit, and a hard-working soul. You would dare to fight and sacrifice yourself for the people. At this time, you would be a true soldier. A qualified soldier who could make your comrades, the people, and the country feel at ease.","As for Ye Jian... she was obviously not qualified."]},{"number":5137,"title":"Chapter 5137: Heavenly Soldiers’ Iron Wings","paragraphs":["Who would believe an unqualified soldier?","No one would believe her. Even her closest comrades in the company would be suspicious of her. As long as she didn’t change, she would be ostracized.","Guo Cui, who was gradually calming down, pursed her lips. Lu Hui saw that Guo Cui was silent and knew that her words had worked, so her tone softened naturally. \"Alright, stop looking like I owe you money. The problem now is that we need to find out why Ye Jian came to our military unit.","\"There must be something wrong. Even if she doesn’t have a background, she has a hidden motive! I can’t be bothered with her background. No matter how powerful she is, I didn’t do anything to her. I’m not afraid. After what you said today, I have to observe her carefully in the future.\"","\"Alright, then observe carefully!\" Although she agreed with Lu Hui, Guo Cui still felt uncomfortable. She replied stiffly and walked away.","She planned to have a private chat with Ye Jian again and ask her about this. Previously, the squad leader and deputy squad leader had talked to her, but it didn’t have much effect. She didn’t know if it was because she resisted the idea of transferring to the air force from the army.","Anyway, she really felt that something was wrong with Ye Jian. The calmness she had when she saved her that day and the composure she had when she dealt with the problem... She appeared completely different from usual.","Lu Hui caught up with the squad leader and reported Guo Cui’s suspicions one by one. The squad leader’s reaction wasn’t as big as Lu Hui’s at that time. She calmed down after a while.","Then, the squad leader told the deputy squad leader. After talking for a while, they started to suspect that there was something wrong with Ye Jian.","Ye Jian, who was absent, was looking down at the ground. This was not the first time she was looking down from a high altitude. She had taken many night flights, but most of the time, she would seize the time to conserve her energy for ground combat.","This time, she widened her eyes the entire time and concentrated on preparing to jump down from the plane...","The transport plane flew over the mountains from the dark sky and entered the sky above the city. The ground lights intertwined, and the stars above their heads flickered. At this moment, the plane crew needed to be more vigilant to prevent their vision from being distorted and mistake the ground lights for the resplendent starry sky.","The city outside the cabin was brightly lit. All the soldiers in the cabin were ready. The countdown to the night landing was starting.","The transport plane quickly arrived at the designated airspace for the night landing. The signal light lit up, and the first soldier to jump stood up. He was the squad leader and was leading his comrades for the first night landing.","The cabin door opened slowly. The wind blew in, and fresh air poured in. Ye Jian’s eyes lit up. It was her turn soon. It would be her turn soon!","Captain Lei, who was sitting at the side, couldn’t help but laugh when he saw this. \"You’re so excited. Not bad! Maintain your condition and your night landing will be smoother.\"","Ye Jian was confident in herself. She nodded vigorously and replied loudly, \"Rest assured, Captain! I guarantee that nothing will happen!\"","\"I know that you’ll be fine.\" Captain Lei raised his head and laughed. \"Jump well. A week later, we’ll let the female soldiers know how powerful you are, Ye Jian!\"","Even Captain Lei was so confident in her. Ye Jian smiled until her eyes curved like the crescent moon in the sky.","For the past half a month, she had been focusing on training for night landing and ensuring safety when parachuting. She had to train in the subjects of off-air at night, special manipulation, landing, and so on so that she could catch up with the female soldiers as soon as possible. How could she waste the efforts of the instructors? How could she let her own efforts go to waste?","In the distance, the lights of the city flickered. With the order of the officer, the first batch of soldiers jumped out of the cabin calmly. The parachutes bloomed and instantly disappeared into the night."]},{"number":5138,"title":"Chapter 5138: She’s The Most Beautiful","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was already standing at the cabin door. It would be her turn soon.","From the cabin door, one could see more than half of the sky above the city. The Milky Way was like a chain in one’s vision. Under one’s vision, the traffic was bustling with life. The lights were as resplendent as the stars. It was lively and prosperous.","\"Jump!\"","With a command, Ye Jian jumped down from the sky.","It was said that airborne soldiers only had 19 seconds when they jumped from the sky. If they didn’t successfully open their parachute within 19 seconds, their life would disappear and they wouldn’t see the sun rise the next day.","With a bang, the pure white parachute opened. Ye Jian, who was rushing through the wind, stabilized her falling body. The parachute supported her body and ensured her life.","There was a suffocating feeling in Ye Jian’s chest for some reason. The moment she heard the parachute bloom, her heart almost jumped out of her chest. The wind was clear and the moon was bright. Her heart was like a mirror. Ye Jian’s face also had a smile that was clearer than the wind and brighter than the moon.","’Captain Xia, I succeeded!’","She was one step closer to her goal. Please wait for her. Wait for her a little longer. She would return to the team very soon. She had always been working hard to return to the team. Please believe her. She would definitely return to the team in advance. She wouldn’t let Captain Xia or her comrades wait too long!","Ye Jian, who was smiling, floated in the night sky with the parachute. She understood that the bright galaxy was shining brightly. The night wind no longer blew past her face. It became a gentle hand that gently brushed past her body. There was no fear, only peace.","The voice of the air announcer came from the earpieces. He reminded Ye Jian to pay attention to her direction. \"Pull left and pull right. Remember to maintain the distance between the parachutes.\"","After receiving the order, Ye Jian focused on operating the parachute in her hand. She pulled the operating lever to maintain the stability of the parachute and her body. She rode the wind and headed to the estimated landing area.","Parachutes bloomed one after another under the resplendent starry sky. In the pitch-black night sky, brave and fearless figures rushed into the night and landed safely.","Ye Jian, who was operating the parachute, got closer and closer to the ground. Finally, her suspended feet landed, and her entire body rushed forward due to inertia. Her footsteps were not messy, and even her breathing was exceptionally stable. Ye Jian quickly stabilized her body until she stood properly.","The huge parachute fell to the ground as Ye Jian untied it. Under the hazy starlight, it looked like waves.","Ye Jian quickly untied her parachute and weapons, gathered her parachute, and quickly headed to the predetermined area. Ye Jian looked like a paratrooper. Her movements were skilled and orderly without any panic.","The land was quite empty. Ye Jian was rushing toward the designated area. The other paratroopers were the same. Soon, all the parachuters had landed.","The whistle sounded, and more than a hundred parachuting soldiers gathered. The classes reported the number and confirmed it.","\"Ye Jian, here!\"","Among the hundred male voices, a clear and cold female voice was heard. Captain Lei heard it and went over. He couldn’t find Ye Jian among the black mass of heads, but he knew that the female soldier who jumped out of the cabin door was standing there. She used her best posture to tell her that she had completed this night landing outstandingly!","After returning from the night flight, it was already late at night. The paratroopers who boarded the plane again hugged their parachutes and closed their eyes to rest. Ye Jian, who had completed her first night landing, also hugged her parachute and fell asleep."]},{"number":5139,"title":"Chapter 5139: Who Are You","paragraphs":["This time, Captain Lei didn’t have a heart-to-heart chat with Ye Jian. She was a female soldier who didn’t need to have a heart-to-heart chat so frequently. No, she wasn’t an ordinary female soldier. She was a special forces soldier in the army.","The special forces soldiers were special because their combat ability and comprehensive ability far exceeded ordinary soldiers. It was because they had already undergone thousands of trials and tribulations. They no longer needed special care.","On Captain Lei’s right was Small Head, on his right was Guan Cheng, and across from him was Ding Xiaoping. The three of them were Ye Jian’s training instructors and the top soldiers among the special reconnaissance soldiers.","Captain Lei, who didn’t have a heart-to-heart chat with Ye Jian, was having a heart-to-heart chat with Small Head. The topic he was talking about was Ye Jian.","\"How is it? Are you going to admit defeat? Do you admit that Ye Jian is much stronger than you in the past?\" Captain Lei smiled as he spoke. There was obvious teasing in his tone. \"You don’t have anything to say now, right?\"","Small Head rubbed his face and replied to Captain Lei with an expression that said, ’I refuse to chat.’ Unfortunately, Captain Lei didn’t give him a chance to reject him. He asked again, \"Is it difficult for a man to admit that he’s inferior to others? It’s the truth. Why can’t you admit it?\"","The captain didn’t want to let him off. Small Head felt bitter in his heart, he had a bitter expression on his face, and his voice was filled with bitterness. \"Captain, let me off. If I don’t say it, it’s equivalent to admitting it. Do you have to insist on having me say it? You gotta let me keep my dignity, right?\"","\"Do I have to? Dignity is earned. Don’t you understand?\" If the soldiers weren’t resting, Captain Lei would have laughed.","This brat. It was his fault for looking down on Ye Jian in the past!","Now, he had gotten a slap in the face. It hurt, right? It was embarrassing.","Captain Lei needed to dampen his spirit. Looking down on female soldiers? Ha, he would suffer!","Cough... Actually, he was quite embarrassed too. In the past, he didn’t think much of female soldiers either. He thought that female soldiers were usually timid, and when something really happened, they would become listless.","He thought so in his heart. Fortunately, he didn’t say anything during the mission. Otherwise, it would have been even more embarrassing.","Captain Lei, who was secretly glad that he managed to protect his dignity, smiled and sighed. \"There’s always someone better. It’s a big deal that we have a female soldier like Ye Jian. I wonder what kind of military unit she’ll go to in the future? Will it be good enough to accommodate a big shot like her?\"","Small Head, who had finally escaped from his misery, was afraid that Captain Lei would bring the topic back to him. He hurriedly focused and continued the topic, \"It must be one of the top special forces units in the army. She’ll probably go to the special forces unit that has never been exposed. Something like the Shadow Special Forces in our air force. Ye Jian will definitely go to such a military unit when she returns to the army.\"","There was a mysterious and legendary Shadow Special Forces in the air force. Everyone came and went without a trace.","It was said that this military unit was not a complete military unit. The soldiers usually served in the various air force military units. Once there was a mission, they would immediately gather.","No one knew who they were. No one had seen their true faces, let alone where they came from.","They were like shadows. When they came, there was no sound. When they left, there was no movement. It was unknown if they really existed.","Captain Lei’s gaze flickered slightly. He patted Small Head’s head fiercely. \"What are you thinking about all the time? Shadow Special Forces? A special forces unit that has never been exposed? What nonsense.\""]},{"number":5140,"title":"Chapter 5140: Unknown Intention","paragraphs":["The two brothers, Small Head and Big Head, were the youngest in Captain Lei’s team. Between them, Small Head was smart and had a strong comprehensive ability. Captain Lei, who was five years older than Small Head, usually loved to tease Small Head. He would always pull tricks on him.","Small Head was hit in the head again. \"Captain, can you stop hitting my head every day? If I really become stupid one day, you’ll have to be responsible for me for the rest of my life.\"","Zheng Cheng, who was sitting at the side with his eyes closed, couldn’t help but open them when he heard this. He reminded Captain Lei with a sincere expression, \"Captain, he seems to really want to cling to you for the rest of his life. Don’t hit him on the head next time. Hit him in the legs instead.\"","Small Head gritted his teeth. \"Captain will be very happy to take care of me for the rest of my life.\"","\"Scram. I’ll kick you off the plane.\" Captain Lei smiled and kicked Small Head. \"Good luck, brat. Ye Jian might catch up with you. You need to learn from her.\"","Then, he said to Zheng Cheng, \"You too. You have to learn from Ye Jian. She has an energy that many soldiers don’t have. It’s worth learning from.\"","Sometimes, Captain Lei was a little afraid of Ye Jian’s stamina. She was like Iron Man. If she couldn’t solve a difficult problem, even if she was so tired that she didn’t even have the strength to raise her hand, she would grit her teeth and persevere until the problem was solved.","In her words, as long as it was a problem that could be solved, she wanted to get it done.","He felt ashamed of his inferiority. As the captain, he didn’t have as high of an awareness as her.","Zheng Cheng nodded. He had been in charge of Ye Jian’s training for more than half a month. He agreed with what Captain Lei said. \"I admit defeat. She’s so much more persistent than we think.\"","After a pause, Zheng Cheng narrowed his eyes and asked softly, \"Captain, who is Ye Jian? Does she have a military background? Her foundation is too strong. She seems to have had training in the military unit since she was young. She must have elders in the military unit too.\"","Captain Lei didn’t know Ye Jian’s background or family background. The personal information provided by the army was about her gender, name, school, and the awards she received when she was in school. There was nothing else.","\"We don’t care whether she has a background or not. Take care of yourself and learn from her. Rest for a while. We still have training tomorrow morning.\"","Captain Lei, who didn’t know anything either, hugged his parachute and closed his eyes. He seemed a little tired.","Zheng Cheng and Small Head looked at each other thoughtfully. They then hugged their parachutes and closed their eyes.","That made sense. They just needed to take care of themselves.","Captain Lei, who had closed his eyes, didn’t really rest. Small Head’s unintentional words had a big effect on him.","The Shadow Special Forces... Did Commander Kong have such a plan?","Ye Jian was powerful in all aspects. She could still thrive even after being transferred to another military division. Joining the strongest special forces unit wouldn’t destroy her talent. Perhaps Commander Kong really had such plans.","Would the army... agree?","It would probably be difficult.","The returning transport plane shook slightly. The paratroopers who had completed their night landing hugged their parachutes tightly in their sleep. Their bodies swayed as they felt sleepy.","The night sky was silent as the soldiers returned to their units. The night passed quietly but uneventfully.","Captain Lei found Ye Jian among a group of male soldiers. He saw that she was chatting and laughing with a few paratroopers. Everything was normal. There was a smile in her eyes. He didn’t call Ye Jian aside to ask her how she was doing. There was no need to ask. Her expression and actions told him that everything was normal. There were no problems."]},{"number":5141,"title":"Chapter 5141: Night Talk","paragraphs":["After gathering, he led the team back to the dormitory. The male soldiers returned in teams while Ye Jian returned to the dormitory alone.","Before the female soldiers came, there wasn’t a female soldier’s dormitory in the military unit. There wasn’t even a... female bathroom. The female soldier’s dormitory was renovated from the family building. Fortunately, there was a bathroom on every floor of the family building, solving that problem.","\"Ye Jian, see you in the day.\"","\"See you in the day.\"","\"See you in the day.\"","The family building was in the opposite direction of the male soldiers’ dormitory. A few special reconnaissance soldiers who knew Ye Jian waved at her and said goodbye.","Facing a group of male soldiers, Ye Jian, who had always been magnanimous, waved goodbye. It was three in the morning. There were only two and a half hours until the morning assembly. If she made use of the time, she could have a good rest.","During the War of Resistance, the soldiers were famous for fighting at night. In the new era, the night training in the military unit still took up a large portion of the training. The night training wouldn’t affect the day training. No matter how late the night training was, they would still gather at dawn and start the day training.","Two and a half hours later, Ye Jian would meet them again.","Ye Jian returned to the dormitory alone. There was no one in the dormitory. The female soldiers who were carrying out the weighted cross-country run hadn’t returned. She looked at the time. It was a few minutes past three in the morning. They should be arriving soon.","After lying down for about ten minutes, the 14 female soldiers dragged their tired bodies back to the dormitory. The deputy squad leader turned on the lights before quickly turning them off again. She saw Ye Jian lying on the bed.","\"Lower your voices. Ye Jian is sleeping.\" The deputy squad leader reminded the female soldiers.","Lu Hui, who came in later, whispered, \"We’re exhausted, but she could get into bed early. She could bring herself to sleep when there was no one in the dormitory. I really don’t know if she’s magnanimous or stupid.\"","How could someone like her be accepted? Was that possible?","She didn’t want to improve. Everyone was training, but she went back to the dormitory alone and slept with her head covered. Wasn’t she letting down the military unit that groomed her and the civilians who trusted the soldiers outside?","Lu Hui’s expression darkened.","If the deputy squad leader hadn’t reminded everyone to be quiet, she would have rushed to the head of the bed to wake Ye Jian up and ask her what she was doing.","\"We came back so late. Did you expect her to be waiting for us instead of sleeping?\" Guo Cui retorted. Then, right on the heels of that, she lowered her voice even more. \"Have you forgotten what we said on the way? Speak less and observe more!\"","Lu Hui glanced at a certain spot in the darkness. She opened her mouth but closed it again. She almost forgot about it.","After a while, she tamped down the anger in her chest and said in a muffled voice, \"I don’t know if you’re thinking too much, but when I see her, I feel that it’s just the way she is. There’s nothing strange about it.\"","\"Lu Hui, are you planning to stay up all night?\" The deputy squad leader opened her mouth and lowered her voice as if she was afraid that Ye Jian would hear her. \"You’re the most talkative person in the class. Hurry up and rest early!\"","Lu Hui, who was called out by the deputy squad leader, picked up her toiletries and left the room. Fine, she wouldn’t say anymore. The more she said, the more mistakes she would make!","The 15 female soldiers were divided into two teams. Every team was resting in a dormitory. Ye Jian’s bed was in the innermost part. She slept on the upper berth. On the lower berth was a female soldier called Fang Xin. She wasn’t tall and came from Sichuan Province.","Fang Xin looked at Ye Jian, who was sleeping on the upper berth of her bed. She subconsciously softened her actions so that she wouldn’t make much noise.","Although they doubted Ye Jian’s ability and targeted her, it was only during training. When they returned to the dormitory, they wouldn’t deliberately make things difficult for Ye Jian or bully her. They just didn’t know how to talk to her."]},{"number":5142,"title":"Chapter 5142: Admirable","paragraphs":["With Lu Hui’s words, the other female soldiers didn’t say anything. Saying more would just be adding fuel to the fire.","After all, they had been training together for almost two months and were in the same dormitory. They had a certain understanding of each other’s temper. With Lu Hui’s typical explosive temper, she would definitely fly into a rage if someone were to talk back.","Everyone was tired, and it was the middle of the night. There was no need to make a fuss.","When they were outside, a female soldier persuaded her softly, \"Stop talking so much. We know that you’re doing this for Ye Jian’s sake, but we don’t know if she’s listening to you. Let the squad leader and the deputy squad leader handle it. Don’t force yourself to take on the role of an evil person. It’s not worth it.\"","When they reached the bathroom, Lu Hui placed her toiletries down forcefully. From the mirror embedded in the wall, one could see the anger on Lu Hui’s face. \"I can’t stand it. Hardworking people want to join the team, but they can’t. But those who don’t work hard can easily occupy a spot. I’m angry.\"","One could tell that Lu Hui had a knot in her heart. The female soldier could only continue persuading her, \"Why didn’t you listen to what the squad leader said? It’s not something Ye Jian can decide on her own. She must have something extraordinary about her. At least, she’s not noisy. She’s quiet. Other than dragging us down during training, she’s fine.","\"Look on the bright side. At least we’re not stuck with someone with a bad temper and who likes to shoot their mouths off and blame others. Don’t you think such a person is more infuriating?\"","Lu Hui’s expression finally improved. She snorted. \"That’s all that’s good about Ye Jian.\"","\"That’s right. At least she knows her limits and doesn’t take the initiative to cause trouble. She’s obedient no matter what we say. It’s just that her ability to learn things is average. She’s born with it. She can’t change it. You should be more tolerant and talk less.\"","The clear water flowed down from the tap. Lu Hui listened to the words being spoken, but she was still filled with dissatisfaction. She glanced at the rest from the corner of her eyes. \"Why do I feel that I’m the only bad person? Are you all good people?\"","\"It’s good enough that there’s one of you. It’s not that we don’t want to talk about it. It’s just that we don’t talk as much as you. Alright, hurry up and wash your face and brush your teeth. Rest early.","\"Oh, right, don’t be so angry when we go to bed later. Don’t wake others up.\"","\"I know, I know. I’m the only one who keeps finding trouble with her, and you’re all good people. I’m so angry.\" After brushing her teeth and washing her face, the cold water finally suppressed the anger in Lu Hui’s heart.","Guo Cui and Lu Hui shared a bunk bed. Their beds were next to Ye Jian and Fang Xin’s bunk bed. They were both against the left wall. There were two beds on the right wall too. There were four bunk beds, and one dormitory was just big enough for eight people.","After washing up, Lu Hui came in and heard the deputy squad leader reminding the female soldiers to keep their footsteps light and not make too much noise. In the dark, Lu Hui pursed her lips and tidied herself up before climbing into bed.","As for when Ye Jian came back and where she went previously, the female soldiers didn’t have the energy to question her now. They should wash up and sleep. They still had training tomorrow morning.","The female soldiers were all moving around in the dark. The squad leader pushed the door open. Seeing that the dormitory was dark, she subconsciously asked, \"Are the lights broken?\"","\"No, Ye Jian is sleeping,\" a female soldier replied. \"I don’t know when she came back. Should I wake her up and ask?\""]},{"number":5143,"title":"Chapter 5143: Targeted","paragraphs":["The squad leader came over to ask if Ye Jian was in the dormitory. Knowing that she was here, there was nothing else she needed to do. \"No need. It’s good that I know that she’s back. Rest early and gather on time in the morning.\"","\"Yes, Squad Leader!\"","\"Yes, Squad Leader!\"","\"Good night.\"","\"Good night, Squad Leader.\"","There were rustling sounds in the darkness for a while before everything returned to normal. The female soldiers, who had been tired for almost a day and a night, had washed up and climbed into bed to sleep. After a while, Ye Jian heard several sets of even breathing. She opened her eyes and stared into the darkness. Her gaze was a little dark.","When the female soldiers were still downstairs, the sound of their footsteps had already woken Ye Jian up. Then, the deputy squad leader pushed the door open and entered. Ye Jian had already opened her eyes and was about to greet the female soldiers. But when she heard Lu Hui’s words, she sighed in her heart and shut up.","If she really got up and greeted the female soldiers, she would only feel awkward. Forget it, she would just pretend to be asleep.","The female soldiers felt tired when interacting with her. Actually, she was quite tired too. It wasn’t difficult for her to disguise herself. However, when she thought about what she needed to do after this, she felt very awkward.","That day, when Commander Kong talked to her alone, she immediately felt that she had found herself in murky waters and it was too late to turn back around.","As expected, she was stuck in these murky waters and didn’t know how to interact with the female soldiers.","She was afraid that they would notice something if she got too close to them. After all, they were a group of female soldiers whose comprehensive ability was not inferior to male soldiers. With their intelligence, they would definitely suspect something.","If she kept a distance from them, there would be a bunch of problems as well. Occasionally, when she thought about it, it gave her a headache. She might as well ignore everything and put on an act until the end. She knew that the female soldiers had a problem with her and were against her, but she pretended not to know.","Usually, when they complained about her because of problems with her training or because she didn’t keep up with the progress, she endured it.","She told herself to just bear with it.","However, there seemed to be a problem. From the conversation just now, it was not difficult to tell that they were suspicious of her. This was a little troublesome. If they really kept an eye on her, she was afraid she might not be able to keep this up until the half-year point.","If her overall ability had surpassed theirs, then it would have been fine. But now, although she had successfully completed the night landing, she was still inferior to them in many aspects and needed to continue to strengthen her training in secret.","As for the female soldier’s rejection of her, that was a small matter. As long as it wasn’t overboard or personal, she could bear with it.","It couldn’t be helped. She was indeed dragging the class down, and she did it on purpose.","She felt guilty, but she felt better after being mocked by them from time to time.","She had to discuss it with Captain Lei tomorrow. There were still four months left before it was half a year. She had to endure it.","At 5:30 am, all the soldiers prepared to gather and start their training for the day. Ye Jian could clearly feel the female soldiers’ attention on her. Every time she completed her individual training, the squad leader would deliberately stand at the side and keep an eye on her. It was the same for the rest of the day. They would suddenly appear before her and catch her off guard.","Hence, Ye Jian was even more certain that they were suspicious of her.","\"What made them suspicious?\" Ye Jian asked herself in a low voice during the break. She tried to recall if she had revealed any flaws. She thought for a long time... but to no avail.","After lunch, Ye Jian put down her cutlery and went to the training ground to strengthen her training as usual. The deputy squad leader suddenly came over and held Ye Jian’s arm. She smiled and asked, \"Where do you usually go in the afternoon? I rarely see you going back to the dormitory to rest in the afternoon.\"","Ye Jian’s heart dropped. She knew that she was being targeted."]},{"number":5144,"title":"Chapter 5144: Divert","paragraphs":["Why did she rarely go back to the dormitory to rest in the afternoon? Everyone was making use of every minute and second of their training. They didn’t have much time to rest. During the two and a half hours break at noon, Captain Lei only allowed Ye Jian to rest for half an hour. The rest of the time, she would train.","It couldn’t be helped. Commander Kong had arranged missions for Ye Jian and Captain Lei. The two of them had to hurry up. They didn’t have much time to rest.","Ye Jian looked at the deputy squad leader’s arm that was wrapped around her arm. She maintained her taciturn personality in front of the female soldiers and replied concisely, \"Rest.\"","\"If you don’t go back and rest in the afternoon, where are you going to rest? I don’t think there’s a better place to rest than the dormitory, right?\" The deputy squad leader was in charge of clinging to Ye Jian in the afternoon. In the evening, the squad leader would take over. The two of them would see if they could find any clues.","Last night, after a discussion, she, the squad leader, Guo Cui, and Lu Hui felt that Guo Cui’s suspicions were not unreasonable. The more they spoke, the more they felt that Ye Jian was a little strange.","No matter how honest a person was, they should have some temper. In Lu Hui’s words, being bullied during training was a clear show of ostracizing. Yet, Ye Jian still didn’t say anything about it. There was no other expression on her face. Anyone who was ostracized by everyone would have some sort of reaction, right? But she didn’t! That was abnormal.","If she was abnormal, then there was a problem. If there was a problem, they had to solve it. How could they solve it? Apart from the time they were asleep, they had to keep an eye on Ye Jian 24 hours a day. They didn’t believe that they couldn’t solve the mystery if they did that!","\"Entertainment room.\" Ye Jian slowly and firmly pulled her arm out. Her expression was as honest as usual. \"Goodbye, deputy squad leader.\"","Then, Ye Jian turned around and left.","When she turned around, she still kept an expressionless face, but she was a little worried. She needed to find Captain Lei to settle this quickly and see how she could avoid the surveillance of the female soldiers.","The deputy squad leader was dumbfounded. Did Ye Jian really not understand what she was saying, or was she pretending not to know?","No, she couldn’t let her leave so easily. She had to follow Ye Jian closely!","The deputy squad leader frowned and chased after her. \"Ye Jian, wait for me. There’s only one table for table tennis in the entertainment room. Do you play table tennis every afternoon? I know how to play too. Let’s play together.\"","Hearing the voice behind her, Ye Jian quickened her footsteps. She wasn’t going to play table tennis.","Just as she was about to catch up with Ye Jian, a male soldier appeared out of nowhere and blocked the path of the deputy squad leader. The deputy squad leader hurriedly stopped and recognized the male soldier who was blocking her as the instructor in charge of their off-air training. He also had a nickname. She often heard the male soldiers calling him ’Small Head’.","\"Instructor Luo.\" The deputy squad leader tiptoed and greeted him. She looked over the shoulder of Small Head, who was a head taller than her, and locked his gaze on Ye Jian, who was leaving in front.","Small Head pretended to be puzzled and turned his head to take a look. He turned his head back and smiled. \"Why? Did that female soldier make a mistake just now? You can pursue her later. I have something urgent to look for you.\"","The deputy squad leader couldn’t chase after Ye Jian anymore. But there was no hurry. Even if she missed Ye Jian in the afternoon today, there was still the squad leader in the evening. As long as Ye Jian stayed in the military unit, the truth would be revealed one day.","Ye Jian had already walked far away. The deputy squad leader, who knew that she couldn’t catch up with her, retracted her gaze and followed Small Head with a slightly restrained facial expression.","Not far away, Captain Lei saw that Small Head had successfully lured the deputy squad leader of the female soldier class away. He raised his thick eyebrows slightly and smiled mysteriously as he left."]},{"number":5145,"title":"Chapter 5145: The Strongest Stands At The Top","paragraphs":["Just now, when the deputy squad leader of the female soldier class caught up with Ye Jian, she seemed to be doing it on purpose. She even took the initiative to hold Ye Jian’s arm. It was a little strange. Everyone knew that the female soldiers had reservations about Ye Jian and even ostracized her from time to time. If they suddenly became so enthusiastic... There had to be a problem.","Last night, Ye Jian told him that with the intelligence of female soldiers, it was impossible for them to hide it for too long. Today, when he saw that the deputy squad leader wanted to chase after her, Captain Lei subconsciously remembered what Ye Jian said last night.","These female soldiers were quite difficult to deal with. Ye Jian’s strength wasn’t enough to crush all the female soldiers yet. She had to continue hiding her ability!","If they had doubts, so be it!","Captain Lei was sharp. When he realized that the deputy squad leader was doing it on purpose, he immediately instructed Small Head to lure her away. When he saw Ye Jian, he would confirm his thoughts.","\"When they came back in the early morning, I pretended to fall asleep and heard them saying that they wanted to observe me carefully. At that time, I was afraid that they had already started suspecting me. As expected, the deputy squad leader held my arm in the afternoon. She asked me why I don’t go back to the dormitory to rest in the afternoon. It’s obvious that they’re keeping an eye on me and want to know what I usually do when I disappear.\"","Ye Jian had a headache. She even raised her hand and rubbed her temples. \"Once they get suspicious, they won’t give up so easily. I’m even suspecting that my act of pretending to be honest has made them suspicious.\"","From the start, she never thought of hiding her ability from the female soldiers. No one was stupid. After interacting with her for a long time, they would more or less notice something.","Captain Lei laughed softly. There was a teasing expression on his tanned and square face. \"It looks like you didn’t disguise yourself well enough. That’s why they discovered you so quickly.","\"From this, it can be seen that you’re not qualified as a spy. They found out seven days before the two-month deadline. You still need to learn how to disguise yourself.\"","Being a spy meant that she had completely become another person. This time, Ye Jian couldn’t turn herself into another person. It was even more difficult than being a spy.","Ye Jian, who had gone undercover for more than half a year and successfully eliminated a drug trafficking chain that involved transnational human trafficking, saw that Captain Lei was at ease. She smiled. \"It looks like you have a solution, so I don’t have to worry.\"","\"Haha, there’s no solution.\" Captain Lei laughed heartily. It wasn’t difficult to hide her strength in front of a group of female soldiers. As a special forces soldier, Ye Jian would definitely be able to hide it easily.","However, the problem now was that all of Ye Jian’s rest time was taken up. Once they suspected something, they would definitely want to know where Ye Jian went during her rest time.","If she didn’t need to be away during her rest time, with Ye Jian’s ability, it wouldn’t be a problem for her to disguise herself for a year or two.","It was indeed a little difficult for Ye Jian, but she had no choice. The orders from the higher-ups had to be carried out well.","\"If they suspect you, so be it. Without actual evidence, they can continue suspecting you if they want to. Just maintain your current state. Come in the afternoon and evening to train as usual. There’s no need to feel burdened.\"","Captain Lei didn’t think as deeply as Ye Jian. Ye Jian was still thinking about how to answer to the female soldier in the future. She voiced her worries, and Captain Lei laughed even louder. \"As long as you’re the strongest, all objections will disappear. Are you worried that they won’t be able to accept it? Haha, they should first be able to defeat you, then.\""]},{"number":5146,"title":"Chapter 5146: Unfounded Worry","paragraphs":["Captain Lei didn’t have any worries. He was stubborn. As for Ye Jian, she hadn’t completely integrated into the military unit. Although she was a qualified special forces soldier, her thoughts were still immature. She still needed to improve in many aspects. Her worries were actually one of her immature thoughts.","Captain Lei saw that Ye Jian was deep in thought and retracted his smile. His expression instantly turned exceptionally serious. \"A soldier is born to win. Winning a battle depends on their true ability. In our country, we won’t stop until the winner is decided. Only the winner has the right to speak. If you can’t win, then there’s no need to say anything else.\"","Captain Lei told Ye Jian that there had to be a winner for everything here. Actually, he was telling Ye Jian that the military unit was a place where the strong lived. Why did the female soldiers look down on Ye Jian and ostracize her? It was because they were stronger than Ye Jian.","As long as she stood firm, the disturbance around her would disappear.","Those so-called worries were groundless.","\"Ye Jian, remember everything I said today. In the future, you’ll know that everything I said is right.\" In front of a good talent, Captain Lei was naturally willing to teach her diligently. With her awareness, she would definitely understand his intentions.","Ye Jian, who was listening attentively, nodded slightly. Captain Lei was right. Captain Xia had said the same thing before. When she led the team to train the female soldiers in the army, he had said the same thing.","In that case, she didn’t need to have so many worries.","The deputy squad leader was pulled by Small Head for a chat. She then returned to the dormitory with a serious expression. She didn’t return to her dormitory. Instead, she went to the squad leader’s dormitory.","The squad leader didn’t expect the deputy squad leader to come back so early. When she saw her serious expression, her expression changed. \"What’s wrong? Is there really a problem with Ye Jian?\"","The deputy squad leader shook her head and said in a low voice, \"No, it’s just some problems during our training. Instructor Luo and the rest secretly observed us and discovered the problems. There are many problems.\"","She didn’t have the time to pay attention to Ye Jian anymore now. She quickly listed out the problems that the instructors had discovered.","Ye Jian continued her training in the afternoon, but during the half-hour break, she did not go to the entertainment room as usual. She quietly returned to the dormitory to rest.","The others returned to the dormitory without making any noise. When it was time to gather, Fang Xin saw Ye Jian coming down from the upper bunk, with obvious surprise flashing in her eyes. \"When did you come back?\"","She didn’t hear anything!","\"I haven’t been back for long.\" Ye Jian bent down to put on her shoes. She maintained an appearance that she didn’t want to interact too much with others.","Fang Xin glanced at her and pursed her lips slightly. She replied with a dry hum and didn’t say anything else. She was a quiet person. Since Ye Jian didn’t want to talk, she wouldn’t take the initiative to speak either.","On the other side, Lu Hui, who was wearing her shoes, snorted lightly and glanced at Ye Jian. This time, she didn’t say anything. She quickly dressed up and ran down to gather.","Because Small Head had reported the problems they had secretly observed to the deputy squad leader of the female class, the off-plane training and landing training this afternoon were more intense than usual. Every detail had to be perfect. No mistakes were allowed.","Ye Jian didn’t make mistakes from time to time like before. She started to let these female soldiers see that she had indeed improved a little. Although it wasn’t much, she had finally improved."]},{"number":5147,"title":"Chapter 5147: Reason","paragraphs":["\"Ye Jian, hook your legs tightly!","\"Ye Jian, can’t you recognize the operating lever? Do you know how to stabilize the parachute?","\"Ye Jian...","\"Ye Jian...","Although the squad leader, deputy squad leader, and comrades who were supervising each other could still be heard calling Ye Jian’s name from time to time, it was less than before. After the afternoon training ended, the squad leader even praised Ye Jian for improving. It was really worth celebrating!","While they were resting, Lu Hui pulled Guo Cui to the side and muttered, \"Did you see that? There’s really something wrong with her! Last night, she didn’t even participate in the 20-kilometer cross-country run. Today, she actually improved. It’s very suspicious!\"","\"She has been training for so long. How can she not improve? Don’t keep staring at her. I told you to observe her secretly. If you keep staring at her, you’ll be discovered.\" Guo Cui glanced at Ye Jian, who was resting alone. She lowered her voice and reminded Lu Hui, \"Tomorrow afternoon, we’ll pay attention to when she returns to the dormitory.\"","\"Okay!\" Lu Hui nodded!","She didn’t believe that she couldn’t discover the problem.","As it turned out, though, they really couldn’t find any problems.","In the evening, Ye Jian disappeared again. No one knew where she went. The squad leader asked around and realized that no one knew. They stood there for a long time.","At night, Ye Jian appeared on time for training.","The squad leader, who had already received the notice to arrange for the female soldiers to conduct night landing training four days later, looked at Ye Jian, who had returned to the team on time. She suppressed the doubts in her heart and made the announcement. The female soldiers standing in the night were excited.","This was great. It was finally their turn to descend at night!","The excitement lasted until the night training ended. The squad leader was quite satisfied with the female soldiers’ condition. They weren’t afraid. They were just looking forward to it. It was not bad.","As for Ye Jian... The squad leader glanced at her. A complicated look flashed past her eyes. \"Ye Jian, stay behind. The rest of you are dismissed.\"","It was already 9:00 pm. The female soldiers who had received the order to disperse looked at Ye Jian subtly and left in formation one after another.","Ye Jian stood at the same spot and waited for the squad leader to lecture her.","\"Ye Jian, a few instructors saw your usual training and expressed their dissatisfaction. We’re going to carry out night landing training soon. Captain Lei has arranged for Instructor Luo and Instructor Zheng to arrange more training for you. Cherish it and don’t make the same mistakes as during the day training. Do you hear me?\"","She was reprimanding Ye Jian openly!","\"Yes!\" Ye Jian replied with her head held high. She was very calm and didn’t look burdened at all.","The squad leader was even more worried. Seeing that the instructors hadn’t come over, she walked closer and reminded Ye Jian in a low voice, \"Learn your lesson. Don’t get targeted by the instructors. Otherwise, when the time comes, you’ll be sent packing.","\"Also, the instructors are all male soldiers. Male soldiers scold people more fiercely than me. Bear with it and don’t be stubborn. If something happens, I can’t help you.\"","If an instructor wanted to punish a soldier, as long as the reason was right, they could punish the soldier however they wanted.","Ye Jian, who was silent, nodded. She didn’t want to say anything else. The squad leader looked at her and wondered if Guo Cui was thinking too much.","What was so strange about Ye Jian?","She really couldn’t tell!","Small Head and the other three walked over. The squad leader didn’t say anything else and stood side by side with Ye Jian, waiting for the instructors to come over.","The squad leader’s face turned gloomy. He glanced at Ye Jian coldly and said to the squad leader of the female class, \"Squad Leader, go back to the dormitory. We’ll take Ye Jian away.\"","Even his voice was filled with dissatisfaction. The squad leader’s heart was in a mess when she heard this. She looked at Ye Jian uneasily. Before she left, she whispered, \"You must bear with it.\""]},{"number":5148,"title":"Chapter 5148: Last Chance","paragraphs":["After taking two steps, the squad leader suddenly heard an instructor’s deep voice saying to Ye Jian, \"Do you want to stay or leave? This is your last chance.\"","Last chance...","The squad leader stumbled. Last chance? Was Captain Lei very unhappy with Ye Jian’s training?","Ye Jian, she... The squad leader turned her head and looked at Ye Jian again. Just as she turned her head, a cold and sharp gaze swept over. An instructor asked the squad leader, \"Is there anything else?\"","\"It’s nothing. Instructor Zheng, thank you for your hard work.\" The squad leader, whose heart was pounding, shook her head and quickened her pace.","It was up to Ye Jian to decide. As the squad leader, she was helpless.","This was her last chance. Alas, it seemed that Captain Lei had been paying attention to Ye Jian’s progress. As the training increased, the difficulty would increase. Captain Lei was making the last ’save’ to see if Ye Jian was qualified to stay. If not, there would be no more chances for Ye Jian.","Nowadays, not only did one have to have strong comprehensive abilities, but one also needed to learn how to act. With this act, the squad leader believed that the male instructors were here to find trouble with Ye Jian.","The squad leader left. Before she left, her eyes were filled with pity. If Ye Jian fell into the hands of the male soldiers, she would either die or lose a layer of skin. Alas...","However, as the squad leader, she had no choice. Captain Lei had personally given the order to ’take care’ of Ye Jian, who was from the army but was transferred to the air force. She wanted to put in a good word for Ye Jian... But after seeing Ye Jian’s usual expression, she couldn’t find anything good to say.","She would see if the male soldiers could fix her up.","If Ye Jian could really improve her comprehensive ability, a little suffering was alright. How could a soldier not suffer?","It depended on whether Ye Jian could hold on.","The squad leader, who kept looking back, finally left. In the squad leader’s eyes, Small Head’s back view appeared fierce and tough. In actual fact, Small Head was laughing happily.","Small Head’s young and tanned face was filled with a bright smile. \"How is it? I successfully lured your squad leader away! In the future, we’ll pick on the female soldier class from time to time and emphasize on your mistakes. Hence, in the future, you have to have more problems during your training like before. That way, we’ll have an excuse to train you alone.","\"It’s Captain Lei’s idea. He wants you to train without worry.\"","During the day, Ye Jian would make mistakes from time to time. The instructor would then summarize Ye Jian’s problems. Then, there would be a reason to force Ye Jian to stay behind.","Not bad, not bad. It was a good idea.","In the female soldiers’ dormitory, the squad leader went back and found the deputy squad leader. The two of them stood in the corridor outside and talked. The squad leader said, \"Ye Jian has been targeted by the male instructors. They said that she has made too many mistakes. In the future, they’ll give her two hours of training at night. This will only end when she improves.","\"Two hours in the morning and two hours at night. Ye Jian will have four more hours of training than us every day. She’s going to suffer.\"","\"She will have four more hours of training time than us every day? Instructor Luo and the rest will be leading her?\" The deputy squad leader didn’t know that the male instructors would give Ye Jian training alone. Hearing that, she was very surprised. \"Does Ye Jian know? Can she persevere?\"","The squad leader said, \"She didn’t know before, but she should know now. It’s a good thing to let her suffer. If all the instructors turn a blind eye to Ye Jian’s failure, it’ll really harm Ye Jian.","\"Before I left, Instructor Luo said that this is her last chance. Whether Ye Jian can stay or not will depend on the training of Instructor Luo and the rest.\""]},{"number":5149,"title":"Chapter 5149: Contradictory","paragraphs":["Although they all felt that Ye Jian wasn’t suitable to stay, the squad leader and deputy squad leader didn’t really want Ye Jian to leave.","Now, Captain Lei suddenly made a move and made the decision on whether Ye Jian should leave or stay. The two of them felt an indescribable feeling in their hearts.","They wanted Ye Jian to leave.","At the same time, they didn’t.","It was very contradictory.","The deputy squad leader had the same ambivalence. She was silent for a while before saying, \"Now that the instructors have come forward to train her alone, it means that the instructors haven’t given up on Ye Jian. It’s a good thing.\"","At least they didn’t give up directly. At least they arranged for Instructor Luo and the rest to sacrifice their personal time to give Ye Jian a chance to train alone. At least she had a chance to stay.","\"That’s what I think too. The expressions of Instructor Luo and the rest were so bad that I didn’t dare to look at them anymore. I don’t know if Ye Jian can persevere.\" The squad leader was a little worried. She pursed her lips for a while and sighed. \"Based on Ye Jian’s personality, I think she should be able to do it. With her personality, Ye Jian will probably bear with it no matter how Instructor Luo and the rest scold her. She won’t talk back.\"","That was true. Ye Jian didn’t have any other strengths, but she was definitely ranked first when it came to holding back.","It was good that she could endure it. If she could endure it, she would be able to get through it.","\"It looks like what Guo Cui said before is nothing to worry about. There’s nothing strange about her. Guo Cui was thinking too much.\"","The vice-captain nodded. \"Yes, she must be thinking too much. I looked for Ye Jian in the afternoon. She said that she goes to the entertainment room during the afternoon breaks. There’s nothing wrong with that.\"","\"Then there’s no problem.\" The squad leader exhaled softly. There was a look of reluctance on her face. \"If she really leaves, will she return to her original military unit? Or... will she just retire?\"","The squad leader and deputy squad leader were whispering outside. Lu Hui and the rest were whispering inside. \"The squad leader left Ye Jian alone. Now that the squad leader is back, Ye Jian isn’t. She even called the deputy squad leader outside to talk. Their expressions are very serious. Did something happen to Ye Jian again?\"","After a day of training, the female soldiers who had cleaned themselves up at the fastest speed were sitting on the small stools and talking about their training today. Everyone’s training was not bad. After summarizing a few sentences, it ended.","In the midst of it, the squad leader called the deputy squad leader away with a serious expression. After the training ended, they naturally started chatting softly. Ye Jian had always been the center of their conversation.","Through the crack in the door, they could see the expressions of the squad leader and the deputy squad leader. The few of them sat together and started discussing softly.","A female soldier whispered, \"She’s probably being punished. She improved a little during the day, but she still has a few problems. The same problem happened several times when she opened her parachute. The squad leader’s expression was so cold then.\"","Guo Cui sighed. \"Alas, how could her expression not be cold? According to the progress of our training, we’ll need to start on the eight courses of skydiving skills in two months. If she continues like this, she won’t be able to keep up with us. She can’t leave either. The squad leader is under a lot of pressure. If something really happens, how is she going to answer to the higher-ups?\"","\"What’s there to explain? It’s not too late to explain now. The earlier we tell the instructors that Ye Jian isn’t suitable to stay in our airborne military unit, the better.\" Lu Hui snorted. \"As long as she leaves early, there won’t be any consequences. Everyone will be happy then, so why not?\""]},{"number":5150,"title":"Chapter 5150: Kneel Down In Apology","paragraphs":["Guo Cui glared at Lu Hui angrily. \"You keep hoping that Ye Jian will leave the military unit. If she doesn’t leave, will you repeat it countless times?\"","\"I will! If she can catch up to us, then I won’t have to say it!\"","\"Ha, not only will she catch up to you, but she’ll also surpass you. At that time, I wanna see the angry look on your face!\"","\"Hahaha, Guo Cui, Guo Cui, you have so much confidence in a person with poor ability. Sure, if that day really comes, I’ll kneel down to her to apologize!\" Lu Hui raised her eyebrows, and her voice rose a few decibels. She smiled and said, \"All of you, come and be witnesses. I, Lu Hui, will keep my word.\"","\"If Ye Jian really surpasses me one day, I will definitely kneel down to her. I will say I was wrong ten times out loud. Listen, listen. I’ll tell Ye Jian when she comes back later. I’ll let her know too!\"","The female soldiers couldn’t help but laugh. Guo Cui was also amused by her. \"Okay, I’ll remember it! I’ll wait for that day!","\"Sisters, do you think such a day will come? Come, come, come. Fang Xin, you sleep under Ye Jian. You’re the closest to her every day. I’ll give you a chance to speak first!\"","Fang Xin smiled but didn’t say anything. She just shook her head. Ye Jian surpassing Lu Hui? How was that possible?","The other female soldiers shook their heads as well, indicating that it was impossible.","Lu Hui, who came from the Aerial 18th Division, had parachuted many times. She was the female soldier in the class who had done it the most number of times. Even the squad leader and deputy squad leader that the company promoted hadn’t parachuted as many times as Lu Hui. No matter how they thought about it, it was impossible for Ye Jian to surpass Lu Hui.","The moment the deputy squad leader came in, she saw the smiles on the faces of the female soldiers sitting on the small stools. She couldn’t help but laugh too. \"What’s so funny? You’re all laughing until your faces are red.\"","Lu Hui filled her in on it. The deputy squad leader then sat down and pointed a finger at her forehead. \"You’re too arrogant.","\"Ye Jian surpassing you? As long as she can persevere, it’s really possible.\"","\"What? Deputy Squad Leader, are you trying to scare me?\" Lu Hui didn’t believe her.","The deputy squad leader said, \"I’m not trying to scare you. Just now, the squad leader asked me to go out. She told me that from tonight onward, Ye Jian will be training four hours more than us every day. Instructor Luo and the other three will work together to train Ye Jian.\"","\"What?!\" All the female soldiers were shocked, including the female soldiers in the squad leader’s dormitory.","Instructor Luo and the rest were going to train Ye Jian for an additional four hours. Could Ye Jian persevere?","The deputy squad leader said in a low voice, \"Her foundation is too weak, and she has many problems. Captain Lei observed her for a while today and wasn’t satisfied with Ye Jian’s progress. That’s why he made this decision.","\"Whether she can persevere or not will depend on her. This is her last chance. Whether she stays or leaves depends on her.\"","After the deputy squad leader finished speaking, the female soldiers looked at each other.","She was so bad that she had caught Captain Lei’s attention. He even arranged for four instructors to train Ye Jian alone. This was the last chance for Ye Jian to stay. They thought that it would be difficult for her to stay.","Lu Hui said, \"In my opinion, Ye Jian will be leaving our military unit soon. Even instructor Luo has stepped in. It’s obvious that Captain Lei can’t tolerate Ye Jian’s incompetence anymore. If not, he wouldn’t have arranged for instructor Luo and the rest to train Ye Jian.\"","That was right. Lu Hui’s analysis made sense. Captain Lei probably had a bad impression of Ye Jian too."]},{"number":5151,"title":"Chapter 5151: Pay","paragraphs":["After getting the approval of her comrades, Lu Hui turned her head and said to Guo Cui, \"Guo Cui, I think you’re thinking too much. There’s nothing strange about Ye Jian. People with poor skills are just like that. You’ll get used to it.","\"Even Captain Lei has his eyes on Ye Jian. I’m just waiting for her to leave.\"","Guo Cui glanced at Lu Hui before slowly retracting her gaze.","The deputy squad leader said, \"Guo Cui, focus on your training in the future. You don’t have to pay too much attention to Ye Jian. I confronted her in the afternoon. There’s nothing going on with her. You’re just thinking too much.\"","Was she really thinking too much? Guo Cui pursed her lips.","There was nothing strange about Ye Jian? Was she really thinking too much?","Really?","Why did she feel that something was wrong?","Lu Hui was right. Even Captain Lei had his eyes on Ye Jian. He even specially arranged for instructor Luo and the rest to keep an eye on Ye Jian’s training. It was obvious that Captain Lei was not satisfied with Ye Jian.","They were about to proceed to their eight main subjects in parachuting. Yet, Ye Jian kept making mistakes in her training. Could she really continue the rest of the training?","With Ye Jian’s current progress, it was a problem if she could start on the eight main subjects in parachuting.","The eight main subjects in parachuting represented the first step of the 15 female soldiers entering the training to be special reconnaissance soldiers. It was also a symbolic step. From then on, they would no longer be ordinary female soldiers. They would be one of the special reconnaissance soldiers of the special forces.","Whether Ye Jian could stay or not depended on whether Instructor Luo and the rest acknowledged her. She had four more hours of training every day, and Instructor Luo and the rest were supervising her personally. Tsk, tsk, tsk. Her hard days were coming.","\"I hope she can make it through. If she can, she’ll pass.\"","\"That’s right. I’m just afraid that she won’t be able to endure it. She has four hours more training than us. Can her body handle it?\"","\"Hey, Lu Hui, do you really want her to leave?\"","Lu Hui, who was lying on the bed, didn’t reply immediately this time. Instead, the female soldier who asked her the question thought that she didn’t hear her because she was asleep. Lu Hui opened her mouth slowly and said, \"If she can survive Instructor Luo’s training and Instructor Luo and the rest agree to let her pass, she can stay. If the instructors have made their decision, what else can I say?\"","The female soldiers lowered their heads. This fellow had a sharp tongue but a soft heart.","\"Then I hope she stays. She has a good temper. Nothing will happen.\"","\"It’s not up to us. She has to work hard.\"","\"Go to sleep. Go to sleep. We still have training tomorrow.\"","\"Ye Jian is still training, but we’re preparing to sleep. Poor thing...\"","\"She’s pitiful, but we’re pitiful too. Let’s sleep.\" Lu Hui picked up the blanket and covered her head. She hid under the blanket. She didn’t sleep. She just stared blankly. After a long time, she sighed softly and seemed to say something in a low voice. Then, she turned over and closed her eyes to sleep.","Outside, Ye Jian had already started her eight main subjects in parachuting.","She wasn’t just an ordinary soldier. She was here to be a special reconnaissance soldier.","If she wanted to catch up with the female soldiers who had at least two years of foundation, she needed to train harder. Not to mention that she had four more hours of training than the female soldiers every day.","One part of the training was the foundation while the other part was to strengthen her. Half a year later, she would surpass all the female soldiers. She would definitely surpass them!","Ye Jian, who was sweating profusely, endured the fatigue in her body and persevered with her strong will until the intensive training ended.","The female soldiers wouldn’t have the chance to see Ye Jian leave."]},{"number":5152,"title":"Chapter 5152: Scolded","paragraphs":["Four days later, the female soldiers’ night landing training went on as planned. Captain Lei disregarded Ye Jian’s ’request’ because Ye Jian’s foundation was not up to standard. Under the pitying gazes of the female soldiers, Ye Jian was ’forced’ by the gloomy-faced Captain Lei to leave. She didn’t even have the right to board the plane.","\"You haven’t even passed the most basic foundations of the company, and you still want to board the plane for night landing training? Do you think the military unit belongs to you? Is the plane yours too? Don’t you know what you’re capable of?\"","Captain Lei reprimanded Ye Jian in front of all the female soldiers. Ye Jian lowered her head to prevent herself from laughing. The female soldiers who didn’t know anything blushed for Ye Jian.","Seeing that Ye Jian was lowering her head every time she was reprimanded, the female soldiers hated her for not fighting back.","She was already being trained so severely. Why hadn’t she improved?","That wasn’t right. She had made progress, but it was too slow. It was so slow that sometimes, people couldn’t help but get angry. Now that they saw Captain Lei like this, none of the female soldiers dared to speak up for Ye Jian.","They weren’t afraid of being implicated, but they didn’t think Ye Jian was worth it.","The squad leader looked at Ye Jian, who couldn’t raise her head after being reprimanded. She heaved a long sigh in her heart. There were very few soldiers like Ye Jian. She was even given personal training, but the results were the same. Today, she was reprimanded by Captain Lei in front of all the female soldiers and male soldiers. Captain Lei probably had the thought of giving up on her.","She came to the military unit but had to withdraw in the end. What would her original military unit think of her?","Once she returned to her original military unit, Ye Jian could only choose to retire.","Captain Lei reprimanded her for a while before waving his hand, indicating for Ye Jian to leave. The female soldiers saw Ye Jian hugging her parachute and leaving the sports ground with a gloomy expression.","Tonight, there was a gentle breeze and no clouds. The female soldiers who had passed all three checkpoints sat quietly in the resting area to relax and wait for their shift to set off. During the waiting process, most of their gazes landed on the male soldiers. Tonight, they would complete the night landing with the male soldiers. Next, they would undergo continuous night parachute training to train their ability to fight at night.","The transport planes carrying the male soldiers set off one by one. The rumbling sound didn’t give the female soldiers any psychological pressure. Instead, it brought them excitement. The night landing that they had been looking forward to for a long time was about to start. At this moment, all the female soldiers’ moods were on the rise. They had night landing training in their original military unit, but they were still unable to suppress their excitement tonight. All of them were in high spirits and full of confidence.","As for Ye Jian, the female soldiers didn’t mention her again. Even Lu Hui didn’t mention Ye Jian this time and didn’t mock her.","In the distance, Small Head carefully inspected Ye Jian’s parachute. Then, he patted the heavy parachute bag forcefully. Small Head smiled and said, \"You’re using a new model tonight. Remember the possible aerial danger. Remember the exact solution.\"","The female soldiers parachuted down from a transport plane. Ye Jian, who had parachuted for five consecutive nights, started to learn how to parachute down from the next four types of aircraft.","Five types of aircraft, nine types of terrain, two parachutes, and other parachuting skills were all obstacles that Ye Jian needed to overcome in the next four months.","The air force troops had six levels of training, and Ye Jian had reached the fourth level, parachuting training.","She had already completed the 800-meter parachute jump from a small transport plane. Tonight, she would undergo 1,000-meter actual jump training from a large transport plane. After completing five consecutive jumps, she would obtain a golden parachute emblem. Every paratrooper who had completed the training would have it."]},{"number":5153,"title":"Chapter 5153: Multiple Checkpoints","paragraphs":["After the fourth level of parachute training was over, they would enter the fifth level—actual combat training. It was followed by the last level, which was also the last level to become a top airborne soldier. They had to acquire combat capabilities and combat skills, and they had to undergo training in different areas such as night, water, jungle, desert, grassland, plateau, island, bridge, and more. These were are all levels that Ye Jian had to pass.","Ye Jian, who only had half a year, wished that she could have more time in a day. Completing the fifth level of actual combat training required at least a year, and she only had two months.","However, all that was not difficult for Ye Jian. As a special forces soldier, she had already completed all kinds of regional training. Hence, Ye Jian only needed to complete the airborne soldier skills training that she had never participated in before.","Two months was enough for Ye Jian.","The small transport plane carrying the female soldiers had already left the ground and sailed into the night sky. The female soldiers sitting in the cabin hugged their parachutes. Their high spirits had stabilized. The moment they boarded the plane from the cabin door, this group of outstanding female airborne soldiers had already adjusted their condition to their peak. Their expressions were calm, and they remained quiet.","The signal light lit up. The female soldiers were the first to jump out of the door. Their slender but fearless figures bravely looked at the starry night sky.","The stars were resplendent, and the moon was clear. The female soldiers jumped out of the door one after another. Their parachutes opened with a bang. At this moment, they were the brightest stars in the night sky.","The transport plane carrying the special reconnaissance soldiers were flying in another direction. Tonight, Ye Jian needed to complete the 1,000-meter high jump training. The area she would land was a place filled with gravel and lacking trees.","What surprised Ye Jian was that this night landing was at the place where she and Principal Chen trained together. However, the night landing location was different.","Ye Jian, who jumped from 1,000 meters in the air, felt pain on her face. The air pressure squeezed her chest so hard that she felt like she was going to vomit blood at any moment. The pressure only disappeared when her two parachutes were opened.","Ye Jian landed on the ground and untied her parachutes. She stood at the place she came to a few years ago and looked at the scenery she had seen before. Her eyes gradually became moist.","’Uncle Chen, I’m back, but you’re not by my side anymore.’","The wind blew past her ears gently like the warm hands of an elder. Ye Jian raised her hand and wiped the tears from the corners of her eyes. She quickly walked toward the gathering point.","She didn’t have much time to feel sad. Uncle Chen didn’t want her to delay her training because of her sadness. Her hard work was the best tribute to Uncle Chen.","Captain Lei, who jumped first, saw Ye Jian’s figure appear in the night. There was a faint smile on his resolute face. The harsh training didn’t suppress the figure that was running over. Instead, it made her braver and faster.","The 1,000-meter night landing was completed. The next round of training could begin.","The female soldiers who completed the night landing returned with smiles on their faces. They were almost at the entrance of the dormitory. The deputy squad leader signaled the female soldiers to be careful so that they wouldn’t wake Ye Jian up.","The female soldiers, who were familiar with their dormitory, didn’t need to turn on the lights to move normally. They didn’t know if it was because Captain Lei had reprimanded Ye Jian in front of them, but everyone deliberately lightened their footsteps. Lu Hui, who always liked to talk, kept her mouth shut as well."]},{"number":5154,"title":"Chapter 5154: Missing","paragraphs":["Fang Xin walked to the bed and glanced up. Then, the female soldiers heard her exclaim softly. They tiptoed and touched the upper berth. A surprised voice floated over from the darkness. \"There’s no one on Ye Jian’s bed. She hasn’t returned to the dormitory.\"","\"What?! There’s no one on the bed?\" A female soldier took over the conversation in shock and took a few steps forward.","The deputy squad leader immediately turned on the lights. The dark room was lit up. Everyone’s gaze landed on Ye Jian’s bed. The blanket that was folded into a cube was placed neatly. It was obvious that Ye Jian hadn’t returned to the dormitory.","\"Why isn’t she back yet? Was she pulled away by the instructors for training?\" The female soldier standing with Fang Xing frowned and said, \"It’s already two in the morning. She should be back by now.\"","Lu Hui, who ran to the balcony to take a look, said in a low voice, \"There’s no change of clothes for her on the balcony. She hasn’t returned to the dormitory.","\"Her toothbrush and towel are dry. She didn’t come back to wash up.\" Guo Cui, who was checking Ye Jian’s personal belongings, said, \"She hasn’t returned to the dormitory. Deputy, we have to go out and look for her.\"","The deputy squad leader pulled open the door of the cabinet where Ye Jian’s clothes were placed and closed it. \"You guys wash up first. I’ll go and look for the squad leader. If we really decide to go out to look for her, I’ll come back and tell you.\"","The squad leader got anxious when she knew that Ye Jian hadn’t returned.","\"Captain Lei scolded her in front of so many soldiers. Did she do something reckless?\"","\"Pfft, don’t talk nonsense. Hasn’t she been scolded enough? She’s already used to it. How can she take things too hard?\"","\"Where is she? It’s already past two in the morning, but she hasn’t returned to the dormitory. Where did she go?\"","\"I suspect that she might’ve hidden somewhere to cry. Did she accidentally cry herself to sleep?\"","\"You sure have a vivid imagination. Let’s see what the deputy squad leader says when she comes back.\"","Lu Hui listened to her comrades’ conversation and nudged Guo Cui with her elbow. She pouted at the empty bed where Ye Jian was sleeping. \"What do you think?\"","\"It shouldn’t be to that extent. Although Ye Jian has a dull personality and doesn’t like to talk, she’s good at resisting pressure. If not, she wouldn’t have been targeted by you.\" Guo Cui analyzed calmly, and Lu Hui rolled her eyes at her. How could she say that?","However, it made sense.","\"So is it just like what Tang Liyin said, she fell asleep from crying?\" Lu Hui didn’t believe it herself. \"How is that possible? Something must have happened, or she should still be training. Come, let’s go to the sports ground to take a look.\"","After she finished speaking, Lu Hui lifted her feet and made to move. Guo Cui pulled her back. \"Why are you in such a hurry? Let’s wait for the deputy squad leader to come back.\"","Lu Hui stopped in her tracks. She was frowning so much that she was about to tie a knot. \"What if she’s upset and thinking too much? If we don’t look for her now and something really happens, everyone will be done for.\"","At the mention of this, Guo Cui and the other six female soldiers’ hearts pounded furiously.","When the squad leader knew that Ye Jian didn’t come back, she thought that Ye Jian went to cry because she was scolded.","\"Go to the training ground and look for her. Don’t alert the male soldiers.\" The squad leader made a prompt decision. They would look for her first!","\"Okay! Let’s split up and look for her!\" The deputy squad leader nodded. After returning to the dormitory, she didn’t dare to bring all the female soldiers with her. She only asked Guo Cui, Lu Hui, and Fang Xing to follow her out to look for Ye Jian.","At this moment, Ye Jian was still on her way back. She would only reach the airport in about three minutes.","She followed the male soldiers out of the airport. In order to find her, the female soldiers searched for her in the dark for almost half an hour. There was no one on the sports ground, no one in the entertainment room, and no one near the cafeteria. They couldn’t think of anywhere else she might appear. When they went to look for the squad leader, they were a little flustered.","After another ten minutes, just as the squad leader decided to tell Captain Lei, Ye Jian appeared at the brightly lit dormitory door."]},{"number":5155,"title":"Chapter 5155: Dispel Suspicion","paragraphs":["The female soldiers who were waiting for their comrade to come back were stunned when they saw Ye Jian. Then, they stood up in unison. Tang Liyin was the first to rush up. \"Where did you go? Why didn’t you come back to the dormitory when it was already so late at night? You scared everyone!\" The other three female soldiers rushed over as well. Ye Jian took a step back silently and glanced at them. Then, she slowly lowered her head, as if she didn’t want to say anything.","She came back later than them, which caused this trouble.","\"The squad leader and deputy squad leader have gone out to look for you. You...\" Another female soldier with the surname ’Li’ frowned and opened her mouth unhappily. She swallowed her words halfway. \"Alright, it’s fine as long as you’re back. Hurry up and wash up and sleep.","\"Liyin, let’s go and find the squad leader first.\"","Ye Jian retreated to the side and waited quietly for Tang Liyin and Li Xiushui to go out. The two of them passed by Ye Jian and stopped in their tracks. Li Xiushui, who was slightly shorter than all the female soldiers, said in a low voice, \"If you’re not returning to the dormitory in the future, can you leave a note?\"","\"Forget it, stop talking. Let’s hurry up and look for the squad leader.\" The other two female soldiers persuaded Li Xiushui. Another female soldier reached out and pulled Ye Jian into the dormitory. \"We’ll ask her. The two of you, hurry up and look for the squad leader.\"","The squad leader and deputy squad leader had already found Captain Lei. Before they opened their mouths, Captain Lei had already guessed why they were looking for him. \"She was dragged out by me for a 20-kilometer run and did 500 squats. She should’ve returned to the dormitory by now.\"","So, she had gone to receive her punishment!","On Ye Jian’s side, no matter how the two female soldiers asked her, she remained silent. She picked up the toiletries and went to the bathroom to wash up. Fortunately, she had always refused to interact with others. Although the female soldiers were angry, they didn’t flare up at Ye Jian.","Lu Hui, Guo Cui, and Fang Xing came back. When they found out that Ye Jian had returned and was now washing up in the bathroom. As for where she went, they didn’t manage to find out. The three of them had pale faces.","She didn’t return to the dormitory, making them all worried. She didn’t even give an explanation when she came back. Wasn’t this infuriating?","After washing up, Ye Jian came back with her toiletries. Several cold gazes were fixed on her like nails. She stood at the door for a while and said in a soft voice, \"I’m sorry.\"","It was her fault for making them worry.","Lu Hui glared at her and said coldly, \"That’s unnecessary. Please be more careful in the future, okay?\"","\"It’s good that you’re back. Sleep. You still have training tomorrow.\" Guo Cui felt sorry for Ye Jian when she saw that Ye Jian didn’t even dare to enter the dormitory. She walked over and took the toiletries from Ye Jian’s hand. She sighed and said, \"Don’t be like this in the future. Our comrades were very worried about you. The captain scolded you for your own good. He wants you to stay. Don’t worry. Come in and sleep.\"","Ye Jian nodded lightly. She allowed Guo Cui to pull her into the dormitory. Lu Hui snorted and didn’t say anything else.","The deputy squad leader who came back saw that there was no light in the half-closed dormitory door. Knowing that Ye Jian was back, she said ’good night’ to the squad leader and pushed the door open lightly. Ye Jian was punished by Captain Lei and only came back now. Alas, she wasn’t in the mood to criticize Ye Jian anymore.","\"There’s nothing special about Ye Jian. Don’t keep an eye on her in the future.\" The next day, the squad leader reminded the female soldiers that Ye Jian wouldn’t be watched by the squad deputy leader and the others anymore. Ye Jian’s tough training went smoothly until the end of the six-month-deadline. Ye Jian came out of the forest with the male soldiers at night, ending her half-year-long mission to be in disguise."]},{"number":5156,"title":"Chapter 5156: Stabilize Your Image","paragraphs":["The jungle in September was so humid that even the air that they breathed in was watery. When they came out of the forest, they felt as if they had walked through water and were entirely soaked. With every step they took, their military boots would overflow with water. In the words of the male soldiers, if they stayed here for a few more days, mushrooms would grow on their bodies.","After completing the heavy-armored airdrop, the parachute infiltration attack, and ’Emergency Rescue, Decapitation Strike’, the special reconnaissance soldiers came out of the forest and quickly found a place to sit and rest.","The airborne soldiers in charge of communication contacted the headquarters of the exercise and reported the direction. All the special forces soldiers had eight hours to travel and rest.","At this moment, Captain Lei led the soldiers to find a flat area with a wide field of vision to rest. The morning breeze that was wrapped in humidity blew slightly, and the sticky feeling on their bodies became stronger.","A male soldier had just taken off his military boots when the comrade sitting beside him quickly moved at least five meters away from him. He shouted, \"Wang Xin, you broke the rules! Hurry up and put away your biochemical weapons!\"","They had gone through a week of jungle exercises with no place for them to bathe. Before they rested at night, they’d find a place near a water source. Everyone would wash up briefly. The moment Wang Xin took off his boots, the smell floated in the wind. It could be said to be a biochemical weapon.","Normally, everyone would smile and take off their shoes as they should. They would share their blessings and difficulties together. This time, Captain Lei coughed heavily and reminded the male soldiers, \"Comrades, pay attention. Stabilize your image, do you understand?\"","There was still a female soldier around. If he didn’t remind the rough men, they wouldn’t have noticed.","After being reminded, many male soldiers, who were unbuckling their belts, hurriedly fastened them again. It was fine if they suffocated themselves, but they didn’t want Ye Jian to faint.","Ye Jian, who was used to interacting with male soldiers, pursed her lips and smiled when she saw this.","What cute comrades.","Due to her extraordinary sense of smell, Ye Jian didn’t tell them not to mind her. In Captain Xia’s words, \"Bear with it and don’t destroy the ecological environment!\"","Eight hours of free time was enough for them to return to the gathering point. Half a year of training was equivalent to one year of training for female soldiers. Ye Jian sat on a moss-covered rock and hugged her rifle. She carried a parachute on her back. She smiled, her face was covered in camouflage paint.","Captain Lei, who was reminding the soldiers, turned his head and saw the female soldier who had been persevering for half a year. She had suffered so much, but she never gave up. She was resting with her eyes closed. She looked exceptionally gentle with a faint smile on her face. One couldn’t tell that she was someone who was ruthless to herself.","The female soldier’s appearance and heart were opposites. She had already captured the admiration of a bunch of male soldiers. Small Head, Guan Cheng, Ding Xiaoping, and Jiang Huo were the four instructors in charge of Ye Jian’s training. Now, they couldn’t allow themselves to be friends with Ye Jian.","Especially after seeing Ye Jian’s amazing gun skills, Captain Lei couldn’t bear to look at her submissive appearance!","Although he couldn’t bear to look at her directly, he had to admit that Ye Jian had the charisma to make people follow her to the death. She was born to be a soldier!","She used half a year to complete the six stages of training. Combined with her training in the army, she could go to the sky in minutes and torture the male soldiers."]},{"number":5157,"title":"Chapter 5157: Stressed","paragraphs":["Captain Lei looked at her for a long time. Ye Jian opened her eyes and met his eyes. She hurriedly straightened her back and sat upright. Captain Lei smiled and walked toward Ye Jian.","\"Don’t be nervous, don’t be nervous.\" Captain Lei smiled as he walked over. When he saw Ye Jian sitting upright, his gaze couldn’t help but deepen. \"Come, let’s sit and talk.\"","Ye Jian respected Captain Lei very much. He would always put his life and death aside. Every time he faced danger, he would say, \"Step back, I’ll do it.\" He used his body to pave a path for the soldiers. Ye Jian admired his spirit.","After Captain Lei sat down, Ye Jian sat down again.","\"Congratulations. You’ve endured humiliation for half a year. Congratulations on finally getting out of your misery.\" Captain Lei sat down and said in a clear voice. Many special reconnaissance soldiers around him had already looked at Ye Jian. They should congratulate her. They would go over and congratulate her after Captain Lei finished speaking.","The female soldiers didn’t notice that Ye Jian had been hiding her strength for half a year. Her disguise was quite good.","Previously, they had been suspicious of her, but the captain took care of it immediately.","Ye Jian, who had always been ostracized by the female soldiers, would be returning to the team this time. The female soldiers were probably waiting to watch a good show.","Thanks to Small Head and the other instructors, all the special reconnaissance soldiers in the company knew that Ye Jian, who was hiding her strength, was ostracized by the female soldiers. They even went to take a look secretly. Then, they came back in shock.","Ye Jian, who was training with the female soldiers, would probably be beaten up if she was with the male soldiers! It wasn’t easy to pretend to be so stupid.","Now that Ye Jian would be unveiling her true self, they had to go and see the shocked expressions of the female soldiers.","However, what they saw now was Ye Jian’s shocked expression. Her eyes widened slightly. \"I’m about to graduate? I’m not taking the exam anymore? Has it been half a year?\"","Half a year had passed so quickly? Why did she feel that it was too fast? She didn’t feel anything at all.","Her shocked expression made Captain Lei find it even more funny. \"Haha, a female soldier like you really has some personality. Why? Do you think that you haven’t been giving enough time to train hard? It’s already been six and a half months. It’s half a month longer than expected.\"","Ye Jian’s eyes widened. She didn’t feel anything after training for six and a half months!","\"I really didn’t notice the time passing. I even felt that there wasn’t enough time,\" Ye Jian said in a low voice. Her tone was still filled with disbelief.","Captain Lei felt pressured by her reaction.","What should he do?","As the captain, he felt that time was passing very slowly. He was afraid that she wouldn’t be able to take it. Sometimes, he wondered if Ye Jian would be able to persevere if she trained like this every day. He didn’t expect that Ye Jian, the person involved, would complain that time was going by too fast!","Was such difficult and tiring training nothing in her eyes?","\"Do you know how much you trained in the last four and a half months? Out of the 24 hours in a day, your average training time is 17.6 hours. Your one day of training is equivalent to two days of training for female soldiers. They even have one day of rest in a week while you didn’t rest for four and a half months. It was so much that even as the captain, I was afraid that you would leave. How could you not feel anything?","\"Ye Jian, Ye Jian, do the male soldiers in your old military unit know that you’re so powerful?\"","Ye Jian felt that she had gone overboard. She thought for a moment and pursed her lips. Smiling, she said, \"I went crazy during training. That’s why I feel that time passes exceptionally fast.\""]},{"number":5158,"title":"Chapter 5158: A Powerful Soldier","paragraphs":["Actually, that wasn’t the case. Sometimes, she felt that time passed exceptionally slowly. Most of the time, it was when she missed Captain Xia. However, it didn’t happen as often this time. The mission was heavy, and she was focused on returning to the team as soon as possible. She didn’t have much time for romance.","In the blink of an eye, she hadn’t seen Captain Xia for six and a half months.","They said their goodbyes at the end of spring, and now, it was autumn.","\"Commander Kong has been waiting for this day too. He hopes that you can dampen the morale of the female soldiers in the next few days. Then, you can suppress them in all aspects and bring out all the potential of the female soldiers.","\"Although our country already has a female airborne team, it’s still lacking. Compared to the Western countries, our air force’s special forces are still lacking. We have to continue expanding the special forces. This new force is our second female airborne team. The higher-ups have high hopes.\"","In the early 1990s, the first female airborne unit of the country was established. In 1995, this female airborne unit appeared in front of more than 20 military officers stationed in China and underwent military training. Captain Lei, who had been in the military for nearly ten years, was fortunate enough to witness it. Even though many years had passed, the memory was still fresh.","Ye Jian didn’t understand, so Captain Lei started talking about the past. \"Several types of skydivers were able to control the parachutes to land accurately at the center point, without deviation of half a centimeter. In the live-fire shooting, they used automatic rifles, semi-automatic rifles, submachine guns, heavy machine guns, and light machine guns to hit balloons in the air within 200 meters, and all hit the target with the first shot.","\"They shot at 40 targets of seven types at different distances, and every bullet hit the target. Not a single bullet was deflected. It was truly the most spirited military training performance I have ever seen, and I’ll never have the chance to see it again.","\"Also, they’re the first female soldiers in the history of our military to complete the double experiment of parachuting new paratroopers from our country’s newly developed large transport plane. They’re heroines!\"","This was the first time Ye Jian knew about this. When she heard all that, her eyes lit up. As soon as Captain Lei finished speaking, she exclaimed, \"If there’s a chance, I really want to see them.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, Captain Lei smiled mysteriously and leaned over. \"You want to see them? That’s quite easy. If you join our air force, I’ll immediately report your wants to Commander Kong. Believe me, you’ll definitely be able to see them in less than half a month.\"","He was luring Ye Jian into joining the air force.","Fortunately, Ye Jian’s mind was stable. She was a loyal person. In the face of temptation and resistance, she smiled. \"Forget it. I’m just fascinated.\"","\"Why stay fascinated? You have the chance to actually see them!\"","\"Fascination keeps things more mysterious. I prefer mystery.\" She shook her head firmly.","Captain Lei looked at her for a while and retracted his gaze silently. \"What a stubborn person. No matter what you say, it won’t make sense to me.\" He then thought to himself, ’Commander, I’m sorry. I’ve tried to lure Ye Jian into the airborne military unit many times in the past half a year, but I failed. This time, I failed again.’","He paused for a moment before continuing, \"What kind of magic does the military unit you’re going to have to make you so loyal? Our company is really not bad. I’m not boasting, but special reconnaissance soldiers are really sharp soldiers of the military unit. Why can’t we attract you?\"","That was strange. Why was a military unit that she had never been to so attractive to her?","Ye Jian hugged her gun and thought for a moment. She smiled and said, \"I like the army because my parents are from the army.\"","The reason was 100% correct. Captain Lei couldn’t refute it. He could only apologize to Commander Kong in his heart again."]},{"number":5159,"title":"Chapter 5159: The Return Of A King","paragraphs":["Commander Kong didn’t have the time to ask Captain Lei about this matter recently. He had been busy.","The exercise in the depths of the forest had ended. The victor between the red and blue teams had been decided. The chiefs were quite satisfied with the entire process of this exercise, especially the chief of the red team. Other than giving some opinions and criticizing them, he would occasionally smile every day, which meant that the chief of the red team was in a good mood.","As for the chief of the blue team, he was definitely in a bad mood. However, he still had the demeanor of a general. Facing the victor, the chief of the blue team pointed at a certain combat area that was also the center of the blue team. \"Old Kong, you used special soldiers here and caused our command center to be destroyed. Tell me, which regiment sent the soldiers to destroy my base?\"","Commander Kong smiled. Two wrinkles appeared at the corner of his eyes. \"They’re all soldiers from my division. Why? Are you trying to look for the reason for your loss?\"","Although Captain Lei and the rest were special reconnaissance soldiers, they weren’t as independent as the soldiers from the Xueyu unit. All special forces soldiers belonged to large military regions and conducted exercises with the entire division, which would not arouse anyone’s suspicion.","Captain Lei and the rest were sharp knives in the military area. They were a sharp knife that the outside world didn’t know about. Even the chief of the blue team didn’t know about them.","The chief of the blue team wasn’t easy to fool. The center of the blue team was guarded by soldiers and the entire airspace was monitored. In the end, it was still taken down by a group of soldiers from the red team, and they were wiped out. Was there anything fishy?","\"Old Kong, Old Kong, you’re just dishonest. You like to mess around with yourself and fish in troubled waters. There’s nothing fishy about it. Do you think I’m a three-year-old?\"","Commander Kong didn’t take the chief’s words to heart at all. He was secretly happy in his heart but looked heartbroken. \"Old Fan, we’ve had four exercises, right? It wasn’t easy for me to win once. I can understand why you’re embarrassed.","\"But you can’t think that I have special soldiers just because you lost once, right? Fine, even if they are special soldiers, they’re still my division’s soldiers. I can’t possibly go to another division and mobilize soldiers to sneak attack you, right?\"","This exercise was between two divisions. The location of the exercise covered the foothills of the three provinces. The foothills were characteristic of the mountain climate and the small forest climate.","In August, the forest at the foot of the mountain was completely dyed in colors. The scenery was as beautiful as a paradise. It was just entering Autumn. The pine trees were dark and the maple leaves were light yellow. There were fruits and branches everywhere. The smell was fragrant. When the soldiers were hungry, they could occasionally pick a few wild fruits to eat.","Commander Fan from the blue team saw that he couldn’t get anything out of him and knew that Old Kong, who had lost to him, had a clam-shell mouth. He decided not to probe further. When he returned, he would investigate properly!","In the past few years, they had conducted exercises four times, and Old Kong lost three times in a row. On the fourth time, he suddenly made a beautiful comeback and even made the blue team unable to find out who their sneak attack was. Commander Fan really felt embarrassed. He had to investigate!","He wanted to see what kind of soldiers Old Kong had hidden!","But they wouldn’t be able to find anything. If Commander Kong didn’t even have the ability to hide the strength of his soldiers, he should give up his position.","After the exercise ended, the two divisions returned to their teams. Commander Fan even specially went to the red team’s camp to take a walk. Where were the soldiers? He couldn’t find them!","He waved his hand. He wouldn’t look for them anymore!","As for Ye Jian, she boarded the plane and returned to the team under Commander Kong’s command."]},{"number":5160,"title":"Chapter 5160: Really Leaving","paragraphs":["The foothills of this exercise were located at the junction of East and Central China. Part of the location was in the southwest. If they flew back to the military unit in a straight line, they would have to pass through several provinces, not to mention that they needed to add fuel halfway. Also, the large transport planes chose to fly at night. They took off at six in the afternoon and arrived at the military unit at dawn the next day.","The exercise lasted for seven days. Coupled with the time on the road, it actually took nine days. This meant that Ye Jian had left the female soldier class for nine days.","She didn’t appear among them for nine days. The female soldiers were much calmer now than in the first three days of her disappearance. They didn’t see Ye Jian for nine days, and it seemed like she had really left.","The squad leader and deputy squad leader also thought that Ye Jian had left the airborne military unit and returned to her original army unit.","Nine days ago, Captain Lei came personally to take Ye Jian away with a dark expression. He only said, \"I’ll take her away first.\" He didn’t explain anything else before taking Ye Jian away.","All the female soldiers thought that Ye Jian would return to the dormitory at around 1:00 am as usual. However, the next morning, the whistle blew and they realized that Ye Jian didn’t come back. The mattress was square, and the bed was flat without any creases.","Everyone knew that Ye Jian was personally taken away by Captain Lei last night. Hence, the female soldiers didn’t think too much about it. They reported it to the squad leader, who only said, \"I understand.\"","She thought that Ye Jian would return to the team in the day, but Ye Jian didn’t! Ye Jian didn’t even come back at night!","The squad leader hurriedly went to look for Captain Lei. The soldier on duty told the squad leader that Captain Lei had something on and would only be back in about ten days.","She went to look for Instructor Luo but couldn’t find him.","No one knew where Ye Jian went. A living person seemed to have disappeared after being taken away. No traces of her were found.","After such an uneasy night, Ye Jian still didn’t come back the next day. The female soldiers were all nervous. They didn’t see her for a day or two. Where did she go?","The squad leader started to panic too.","As the squad leader, she didn’t know where her soldier had gone. How could she not panic?","It was not until the officer sent someone over that she knew that Captain Lei had brought Ye Jian out of the military unit. As for the exact reason, it was inconvenient to reveal it. The officer told the female soldiers not to be anxious and that Ye Jian was fine.","It turned out that Ye Jian was brought out by Captain Lei. The squad leader finally calmed down. After telling the female soldiers, they all started guessing.","\"That night, when Captain Lei came over, his expression was so dark that I didn’t dare to look at him. It should be a bad sign that he took Ye Jian away.","\"Captain Lei always has a dark look on his face. However, every time he looks at Ye Jian, his expression gets darker and his voice gets colder. One look and you can tell that Captain Lei has a bad impression of Ye Jian too.\"","\"Do you think... Captain Lei sent Ye Jian back to her old military unit directly and didn’t allow her to stay?\"","\"Sigh, that’s possible! Since he personally sent her back to her old military unit, he probably needs some time.\"","\"In the blink of an eye, more than half a year has passed. Alas.\"","\"Time flies. It’s been half a year.\"","For three consecutive days, Ye Jian didn’t return to the military unit. The female soldiers seemed to think that Ye Jian had been sent back to her old military unit by Captain Lei. Even the company leaders thought so.","In private, the female soldiers didn’t discuss it anymore. They were just much quieter than usual.","When they returned to the dormitory in the afternoon and at night, they would look at the empty upper berth from time to time. They would purse their lips slightly, their eyes going dark.","The atmosphere in the dormitory wasn’t good either. It was a little low. Even Lu Hui wasn’t as talkative as usual.","They had been together for half a year. Although she hoped that Ye Jian would leave the team as soon as possible, she didn’t feel good when Ye Jian really left. It was good, though. Ye Jian wouldn’t drag them down during the training anymore.","But there was one less person in the team, and she wasn’t used to it."]},{"number":5161,"title":"Chapter 5161: Dispute","paragraphs":["On the fifth and sixth days, they gradually got used to it. On the seventh and eighth days, they accepted that Ye Jian had returned to her old military unit. The matter was settled. Ye Jian, whose comprehensive ability was weak, had really left.","On the night of the ninth day, Lu Hui came back from training and looked at the empty upper berth. She smiled and asked Fang Xin, \"Doesn’t it feel good to sleep alone in one bunk? And from now on, you don’t have to worry about anyone dragging you down, right?\"","Fang Xin, who didn’t answer immediately, thought for a while before nodding lightly. She didn’t talk much, and her quiet personality was quite likable.","\"When Captain Lei comes back, we’ll clean up the upper berth.\" Lu Hui patted the empty upper berth and dragged her voice. \"We’ve finally sent her away. In the future, we don’t have to worry about whether she lives or dies. We don’t have to worry about her dragging us down anymore.\"","Fang Xin didn’t reply, but her expression was a little unnatural. She wasn’t used to joining in this topic, so she could only remain silent.","\"In the future, all of us don’t have to worry about getting together with Ye Jian. There are 14 of us, so that makes seven pairs. We don’t have to take turns partnering with her anymore.\" The person who spoke was Tang Liyin. She remembered that she had partnered with Ye Jian a few times before and still had a lingering fear. \"I used to be really afraid of partnering with her. Now, I’m relaxed. I don’t have to worry anymore.\"","Just as Li Xiushui was about to speak, Guo Cui’s cold voice came. \"She has already left. It’s time to shut up. If the squad leader hears this, the few of you will be punished.","\"Don’t mention Ye Jian’s name in the future. Besides her lack of ability in training, she didn’t do anything wrong to you.\"","The cold voice made the atmosphere in the dormitory drop abruptly. Lu Hui, who had a straight face, wanted to say something, but Tang Liyin quickly caught her and said, \"Let’s not talk about it anymore. She’s not in our class anymore. Why should we still talk about it?\" She hinted at Li Xiushui.","Li Xiushui understood what she meant and quickly walked to Guo Cui’s side. She held her arm and said, \"Let’s wash up together. We’ve been training hard for the entire day, so let’s rest early. There might be an emergency gathering tonight.\"","Emergency gatherings were common. Sometimes, they would gather more than three times a night. These days, they would gather four times.","Lu Hui couldn’t swallow her words anymore. She snorted at Guo Cui, who was preparing to wash up. \"What do you think I’ll say? Do you think I’ll talk bad about Ye Jian?","\"Do you remember the bet I made previously? If Ye Jian ever surpasses me, I’ll kneel to her to apologize! Now that she’s gone, it means that I’ve won.\"","Guo Cui stopped in her tracks when she reached the door. Li Xiushui, who was behind her, pushed her away. \"Alright, alright. Lu Hui is just like that. She has an unforgiving personality. Why are you arguing with her?","\"Besides, your relationship with her is better than your relationship with Ye Jian’s. Now that Ye Jian has left, you and Lu Hui are comrades in the same class. Why ruin your relationship for someone who has already left?","\"Just let her say a few more words. It’s not a big deal to give in to her sometimes, right? Go, go, go. Take a shower and calm down.\"","In September, the temperature in the southwest was very low at night. When one spoke, the air would be filled with mist. A cold wind blew in the corridor. Guo Cui, who was feeling suffocated, calmed down upon getting blown by the cold wind.","\"I’ll go back and say something.\" Holding her toiletries, Guo Cui said in a low voice. She turned around and walked toward the dormitory again. Li Xiushui was afraid that she would go over and quarrel with Lu Hui, so she hurriedly pulled her back. \"Don’t, don’t. Let’s talk later.\"","\"I’m not rash. Don’t worry.\" Guo Cui dodged and took a few steps back to the dormitory. Lu Hui, who was about to wash up, turned her head and snorted coldly. \"Why? Do you still want to lecture me?\""]},{"number":5162,"title":"Chapter 5162: Her Return","paragraphs":["Guo Cui stood at the door and didn’t enter. She lowered her voice and sighed. \"I don’t have any intention of lecturing you. I just feel that since Ye Jian has left and we’re comrades, let’s not be calculative about the past.\"","When she softened her tone, Lu Hui’s expression became better. Hearing that, she pursed her lips and replied, \"Okay, I understand what you mean. I just want to be proud of myself. I haven’t even when you rained on my parade, so I was angered.\"","\"You’re really...\" Guo Cui was both angry and amused. She didn’t know what to say to Lu Hui. \"She’s just an airborne soldier who started from scratch. How can she compare to you, who’s been doing this for two years? How dare you be so proud? Aren’t you ashamed?\"","\"What’s there to be ashamed about? She could never beat me in the first place.\" Lu Hui, who had her chin high, had a magnanimous expression on her face. Ashamed? Not at all.","Li Xiushui, Tang Liyin, and the quiet Fang Xing heaved a sigh of relief. They were really afraid that the two of them would quarrel. Fortunately, they were fine.","\"Why aren’t you washing up? The hot water is only available for ten minutes. Are you planning to take a cold shower?\" The deputy squad leader, who came back, saw the female soldiers standing with their toiletries in their hands. They were all smiling. She didn’t know what happened, but she smiled too. \"You’re in a good mood. It looks like you’re not afraid of the emergency gathering tonight.\"","The matter was over. They all smiled and quickly washed up.","They only had ten minutes of hot water supply. They had to hurry.","There was no overnight feud between comrades. If there was really a ’feud’, it was still fine as they could come out and fight. They could go through the 400-meter obstacles together or even have a good fight in the sandpit.","The night was getting darker. The stars in the sky seemed to be shining brightly. A large transport plane streaked across the vast night sky like a small bird. It did not look as huge as when it was on the ground.","Ye Jian, who was sitting in the transport plane, hugged her equipment the entire time. As long as she was still around, her equipment would be around. If she died, her equipment would be destroyed too.","At two in the morning, the transport plane landed at a military airport in a certain province for a refuel. The airborne soldiers of the reconnaissance company got off the plane for about half an hour. Ye Jian took a deep breath of the cold air and felt much more awake.","She would arrive at the military unit at 7:30 am. She could still catch up with the morning training. She hoped that the female soldiers wouldn’t be too surprised by her return.","The military airport was brightly lit. All kinds of planes lined up neatly like sentinels. Ye Jian’s gaze landed on the edge of the airport. All the planes were covered with special protective cloth. They were China’s fighter jets.","It was time to board the plane again. When they walked out of the transport plane again, the sun outside shone brightly. The sky was blue, and cold wind blew on their faces.","Taking a deep breath, Ye Jian caught up with the main team and gathered in formation. She returned all the equipment and left in an orderly manner.","\"One, two, one, two, one...\" After passing through the sports ground, the familiar sound of commands came. The smile in Ye Jian’s eyes deepened.","She had to return to the female soldier class for training too.","A rapid running sound was heard. Soon, it stopped beside Ye Jian. Ye Jian stepped out and walked over to Small Head, who was smiling despite panting. \"The captain forgot to tell you that you need to go to his office later. He has something important to tell you.\"","What important matter was it?","In his office, Ye Jian lifted the red cloth on the item he was carrying and saw her epaulet and badges neatly placed in a box."]},{"number":5163,"title":"Chapter 5163: Remember The Mission","paragraphs":["The color of gold and dark green was so solemn that Ye Jian held her breath.","She slowly raised her gaze and looked at Captain Lei’s face. Ye Jian asked, \"Captain, you’re...\"","\"They’re going back to their rightful owner. I don’t have to keep them anymore.\" Captain Lei laughed. Suddenly, his expression turned exceptionally serious. \"Ye Jian!\"","\"Here!\" Ye Jian straightened her back and looked solemn.","Chapter Lei picked up the epaulet that belonged to Ye Jian. Due to a special reason, it was temporarily placed in his hand. He said in a low voice, \"I hope that you can continue working hard and achieve glory. Here, in our airborne military unit, we’ll add a heavy stroke on your name. We’ll let the female soldiers know that the female soldier they ostracized previously isn’t an ordinary female soldier. She’s a special female soldier who can crush them in half a year.","\"You’re a qualified special reconnaissance soldier. On behalf of all the soldiers of the company, I welcome you!\"","He took off the corporal’s epaulet on Ye Jian’s shoulder and changed it into the lieutenant’s epaulet. Then, he helped Ye Jian tidy her clothes. Captain Lei then took a step back and raised his hand to salute.","Ye Jian raised her hand. Her face was beautiful, and her gaze was sharp as she returned the salute.","Then, Captain Lei took out a small box. When he opened it, there was a small parachute emblem inside. \"This is your glory. I hope you can take good care of it. When you leave the military unit in the future, remember that this piece of land has traces of your hard work!\"","The parachute emblem was the symbol of a paratrooper’s identity. Ye Jian took a step forward and took the parachute emblem that condensed her blood and sweat. Her clear and sharp eyes were filled with determination. \"Remember your mission, and don’t forget your original intention!\"","Advance forward and strive to be number one!","\"Okay, I believe that you’ll remember your mission! Go over first. I’ll come over later.\" Captain Lei smiled. He no longer doubted Ye Jian’s ability. He had seen it with his own eyes. Why should he doubt her?","Next, the ones who would really doubt their lives were the female soldiers who once rejected Ye Jian.","He believed that he would be amused to see the expressions of the female soldiers later.","After leaving, Ye Jian walked out of Captain Lei’s office. She didn’t go to the sports ground immediately. Instead, she went to the dormitory. She needed to put down the small box with the parachute emblem.","There was a sentinel standing guard in front of the dormitory building. When he saw Ye Jian, the sentinel immediately saluted. The current Ye Jian was not a corporal but a lieutenant. She could receive the salute of a sentinel.","At this moment, the female soldiers were completing their training for the morning. Most soldiers were trained according to the basic requirements of a qualified airborne soldier. The intensity of the female soldiers’ training was no different from that of male soldiers. They had to squat, do frog jumps, hit sandbags, push bricks in the horse stance, and so on. The male soldiers did the same every day.","\"Ha! Ha! Ha!\"","The female soldiers raised their legs and punched the sandbags hanging on the iron rods. The sandbags weighed exactly 150 catties. The male soldiers could kick the sandbags away with a side kick. The female soldiers were weaker. Even though they could kick the sandbags away too, the impact wasn’t as big as the male soldiers.","A hundred punches and a hundred kicks were the basic training that they had to complete in the morning. Ye Jian walked over and quickly found the place where the female soldiers were training.","\"Ye Jian from Class Two reporting!\"","Her clear and bright voice had a strong penetrating power. It suppressed the sounds of laughter so that every female soldier who was kicking the sandbag could hear her.","The unfamiliar yet familiar voice caused the female soldiers to freeze. A name appeared in the minds of every female soldier who heard the voice.","Ye Jian?"]},{"number":5164,"title":"Chapter 5164: Shocked","paragraphs":["The familiar yet unfamiliar voice couldn’t match the name that appeared in their minds. As a result, the female soldiers looked a little blank.","Was it really Ye Jian’s voice?","Ye Jian herself?","How was that possible?","Didn’t she leave?","How could they still hear her voice?","That wasn’t right!","When the voice said ’Ye Jian from Class Two’, that meant it was Ye Jian!","The female soldiers who were kicking the sandbags in the innermost area couldn’t turn their heads and look at the outermost area immediately. The female soldiers who were closest to the outermost area, such as Lu Hui, Guo Cui, and the other leading soldiers, heard the familiar yet unfamiliar voice. When they heard ’Ye Jian from Class Two reporting,’ they turned their heads and looked at the person who came.","\"Ye Jian!\" Lu Hui’s kicking action was stopped in mid-air. She stepped on the ground with one foot and hooked her left foot in the air as she cried out in surprise, \"Why are you back?!\"","She was so shocked that her lower body was unstable. She, who was on one leg, lost her balance and fell toward the sandbag with her exclamation.","\"Ouch!\" She reacted quickly and hugged the sandbag that she had kicked a few times. Only then did she manage to stabilize herself.","She wasn’t the only one who was shocked. Her call of ’Ye Jian’ and ’why are you back’ shocked the female soldiers at the innermost area.","The voice they heard just now was really Ye Jian’s. She was really back!","The female soldiers who saw Ye Jian at the same time as Lu Hui all had shocked expressions on their faces. Because every kick was done in unison, almost everyone was like Lu Hui and almost fell. They had to hug the sandbags so that they wouldn’t fall.","That was right, this person looked like Ye Jian. But... why did it feel like she wasn’t Ye Jian?","Guo Cui staggered a step and stabilized herself. When she saw who it was, she was pleasantly surprised at first. Then, she became bewildered and asked in disbelief, \"Ye Jian, is it... really you?\"","It was the same face. It was so familiar, but it made her feel unfamiliar. It was as if she had never known Ye Jian.","Was it Ye Jian?","They looked alike. No, they looked exactly the same.","However, the female soldiers didn’t feel any sense of familiarity from her. The only sense of familiarity was that they couldn’t find anything different with her face.","The face was familiar, but the expression on her face was unfamiliar to them. What was even stranger was her temperament. Her outstanding military might was extremely oppressive... The Ye Jian they were familiar with didn’t have such a terrifying military might that made people not dare to look at her directly.","After asking once, Guo Cui became even more careful and added, \"You’re Ye Jian, right? I’m Guo Cui. Do you know me?\"","She suspected that the familiar face in front of her was not the Ye Jian she knew. It was too different. They had completely different auras. Even though their faces were identical, she couldn’t believe that the person in front of her was the Ye Jian she knew.","Guo Cui didn’t believe it, and Lu Hui, who was shocked, couldn’t believe it either. She walked over in two steps. She wanted to rush in front of Ye Jian and take a good look, but Fang Xin reminded her in a low voice, \"Look at her military rank.\"","Look at her military ranks?","Lu Hui, who was focused on looking at the face, looked over. Oh my god! A lieutenant!","However, she had been rushing over and couldn’t stop herself in time. Lu Hui decided to spin on the spot. She stood in front of Guo Cui, blocking her vision. She immediately said, \"I’m sorry, I got the wrong person.\""]},{"number":5165,"title":"Chapter 5165: Panic","paragraphs":["The lieutenant military rank on this soldier’s chest told Lu Hui that she had recognized the wrong person!","Lu Hui, who was exclaiming in her heart about the danger, immediately adjusted her standing posture. She was as straight as a gun and had a serious expression on her face. However, her gaze was still a little distant.","Did she get the wrong person?","Did she really get the wrong person?","Wasn’t it Ye Jian?","But their faces were the same. Ye Jian’s cousin? Sister? Could they look 100% similar?","Guo Cui, whose vision was blocked, coughed softly. \"Why are you standing in front? Hurry up and stand back.\" Mistook the wrong person? That’s impossible.","Could they be twins? Was it Ye Jian’s cousin or sister?","The squad leader walked out from the innermost area. The moment she saw Ye Jian, she was as shocked as Lu Hui and the other female soldiers.","Just now, she was sure that she did not hear wrongly who came to report.","Ye Jian took in all the female soldiers’ facial expressions and actions. She looked straight ahead calmly. From this moment onward, she was the real Ye Jian. She remembered all the rules of the military unit and would never allow herself to make mistakes.","When Guo Cui asked her if it was Ye Jian, she heard it. However, she couldn’t answer until she saw the squad leader.","When the squad leader appeared, Ye Jian raised her hand naturally and saluted the squad leader who was walking over. \"Class Two’s Ye Jian, reporting to the squad leader!\"","Lu Hui grabbed Guo Cui’s arm with both hands. She was so shocked that her pupils constricted. \"She, she, she, she... She’s Ye Jian! It’s Ye Jian!\" she stuttered. She didn’t even know what she wanted to say.","\"Stand properly. Don’t move.\" Guo Cui’s fingers were trembling slightly. Ye Jian was back. It was really Ye Jian. Ye Jian was like a stranger to her now.","Wasn’t she right! She had said that there was something wrong with Ye Jian. However, no one believed her. No, no. They believed her for one night. The next day, they didn’t believe her anymore.","She knew that her intuition was right. There was something wrong with the Ye Jian in the past. Perhaps the Ye Jian in the past wasn’t the real Ye Jian at all. The current Ye Jian was the real Ye Jian.","\"It can’t be. But it’s really Ye Jian. Why does she look like a different person?\"","\"Ye Jian hasn’t changed, right?\"","\"How did she not change? Look at her attire and her temperament. Is she the Ye Jian we know? She doesn’t look like her at all.\"","\"Did she get triggered by something? Did she turn over a new leaf?\"","Was it Ye Jian? Of course, it was Ye Jian. Since she said that Class Two’s Ye Jian was reporting, it had to be Ye Jian herself. Yes, Ye Jian, who dragged the entire class down, was back. Ye Jian, whom they hadn’t seen for nine days, had come back as if she had become a different person.","Her return made them nervous and uneasy. It was like a level ten wind. None of them could calm down.","The squad leader stood in front of Ye Jian, whose military rank, position, and qualifications were higher than hers. Even her military service was longer than hers. The pressure the squad leader felt was only increasing.","\"Ye... Cough, cough...\" The squad leader seemed to have something stuck in her throat. Her voice was a little muffled. She cleared her throat and continued, \"Ye Jian, right? Where... have you been these few days?\"","Even the squad leader was a little cautious.","It couldn’t be helped. Ye Jian’s military rank, position, qualifications, and military service duration were all higher than hers. As the squad leader, she didn’t have the confidence to question Ye Jian.","If the squad leader wasn’t confident enough, what about the other female soldiers?","They were even more so!"]},{"number":5166,"title":"Chapter 5166: Who Is She","paragraphs":["There were 15 female soldiers in the female soldier class. The person with the highest military rank was the squad leader. She was a second lieutenant. The rest of the female soldiers were all high-ranking soldiers. Now that Ye Jian suddenly appeared as a lieutenant, her position, qualifications, and military service duration were all higher than the squad leader. The female soldiers were shocked and didn’t dare to believe it. Their confidence naturally dropped.","Would a soldier dare to point at a lieutenant’s nose and scold her?","Unless she was courting death, she would never dare to do it.","Even the company squad leader was so cautious about asking Ye Jian questions. She was afraid that she would get into trouble if she opened her mouth. As for the rest, they naturally couldn’t go over and ask Ye JIan.","Also, the squad leader was asking Ye Jian where she had been for the past few days.","It was really Ye Jian. Why did it feel like a dream?","After disappearing for a few days, she had changed so drastically. It was as if she had transformed into a new person entirely. She was so mysterious that they still couldn’t believe that the Ye Jian in front of them was really the Ye Jian they knew.","\"I went out for exercises with Captain Lei. I only returned to the team this morning.\" Ye Jian didn’t hide where she went from the squad leader. The squad leader knew about the exercises.","However, when she knew that Ye Jian had gone missing for nine days because she had gone for exercises, the squad leader was still stunned. She was stunned because Ye Jian had the right to go for the exercises. \"E-Exercises?\"","The squad leader wanted to ask Ye Jian how she was qualified for the exercises. When she saw Ye Jian’s military rank, however, the squad leader subconsciously shut her mouth to prevent herself from getting struck by lightning.","Exercises?","Ye Jian said that she... participated in the exercises?","Was it the same two-division exercises she was thinking of?","The female soldiers, who were already bewildered, widened their eyes. Ye Jian... Ye Jian had participated in the exercises?","Her?","Could she go?","Instinctively, they started suspecting Ye Jian again. However, they quickly restrained their habitual doubts. Ye Jian was not the same as before. If she said that she had gone to participate in the exercises, then she was definitely qualified.","For a moment, the female soldiers’ hearts were in a mess. They were so anxious that their hearts were beating wildly. They even felt a chill on their backs.","Ye Jian noticed that the squad leader was looking at her epaulet. She then swallowed the words she wanted to say. Ye Jian smiled and guessed what the squad leader wanted to ask. \"Why don’t they continue training first while I explain to you, squad leader?\"","As she smiled, she looked elegant. The confidence in her eyes made her look even more picturesque. It was a beauty that even the best artist in the world couldn’t paint. The squad leader, who was a woman, was mesmerized by Ye Jian’s smile.","In the past, Ye Jian was beautiful as well. But after looking at her for a long time, one would feel that she was nothing much. No matter how beautiful she was, she wouldn’t make people’s gaze linger on her for a long time.","Now, Ye Jian had made the squad leader understand what kind of person was worthy of the word ’beauty’.","Not only was Ye Jian beautiful, but she also had the fierce and inviolable might of a soldier. Ye Jian was stunning, but she didn’t dare to be presumptuous.","The squad leader clenched her fists tightly and pulled her thoughts back. She turned around and said in a low voice to the female soldiers who still couldn’t believe that Ye Jian was the Ye Jian they knew, \"Continue training!\"","\"Yes!\"","Their voices were neat and imposing.","\"Deputy squad leader!\"","\"Yes!\"","The deputy squad leader ran out quickly from the innermost area. She stood at attention and stopped, waiting for the squad leader’s order.","\"Due to the distraction just now, all of you, train for another 30 minutes!\"","\"Yes!\"","The deputy squad leader only glanced at Ye Jian when she ran over. When she received the squad leader’s order, she saluted and retreated. She moved her body slightly and saluted the squad leader before saluting Ye Jian.","Ye Jian raised her hand in return. The deputy squad leader retracted her arm and left.","\"Everyone, 30 minutes extra for sandbag training!\"","\"Yes!\""]},{"number":5167,"title":"Chapter 5167: Like A Great Enemy","paragraphs":["The deputy squad leader shouted coldly, and the female soldiers in the class raised their heads to reply. No one complained that the training time was longer.","Guo Cui secretly pulled Lu Hui, who was the only one who was stunned and didn’t say anything. \"Are you still in a daze? Continue training.\" She pulled Lu Hui back to her senses.","Looking at the two figures leaving, Lu Hui twisted her stiff neck. \"It’s really her. It’s really Ye Jian. Why does she look like a different person? Also, how did she become a lieutenant? How did her qualifications and military service duration become the highest?\"","No matter how hard she racked her brains, she couldn’t figure it out.","Lu Hui couldn’t figure it out, and neither could Guo Cui. However, they knew that things were different now!","\"From now on, Lu Hui, be more careful with your words. Ye Jian...\" Guo Cui pursed her lips with a serious expression. She lowered her eyes slightly and reminded Lu Hui in a low voice, \"I said that there was something going on with Ye Jian from the start. Now, you’ve seen it for yourself. As a lieutenant of the army, she joined the air force. You said too much in the past, which has formed a habit. If you don’t stop yourself, you’ll definitely be at a disadvantage.","\"Also, don’t forget what you said in front of Ye Jian. If you don’t go back on your word, maybe Ye Jian will have a new perspective on you.\"","Guo Cui’s expression and voice were especially serious. There was even a hint of nervousness as if she were facing a great enemy. Lu Hui’s heart dropped.","Lu Hui calmed herself down and shook her head slowly. \"No. If Ye Jian really came with a motive and everything she did was to disguise herself, it can only be said that her disguise was too good. She deceived all of us.","\"I ostracized her, but I only picked on her during training. Other than that, I just ignored her and didn’t do anything overboard. Incompetent people will be ostracized wherever they go. This is a phenomenon that exists in society and even in various countries.","\"As a lieutenant, I believe that Ye Jian wouldn’t be so narrow-minded as to take revenge on an ordinary soldier like me. Of course, if she deliberately targets and ostracizes me during training, she must have the ability to do that first!","\"Don’t forget that she’s just a female soldier from the military who joined the air force for half a year. I believe that I won’t be surpassed or defeated by her.\"","Lu Hui, who came from the Aerial 18th Division, had the bloodthirstiness of the Aerial 18th Division. The soldiers from the ace airborne military unit were not cowards. If others wanted to pick on them, they should first show their true ability!","Her words made Guo Cui nod slightly. That was right. Lu Hui usually only ostracized Ye Jian during training. Her words were harsh, but they were only limited to when they were training.","Moreover, she didn’t just chastise Ye Jian. Once she pointed out Ye Jian’s mistakes, she would personally demonstrate and let Ye Jian go through it again. She wouldn’t rest until Ye Jian passed.","The entire female soldier class despised Ye Jian, but there had never been a personal attack.","Thinking about it, Guo Cui felt more at ease.","The female soldiers continued their training. At the same time, Ye Jian just explained how she could participate in the exercises and didn’t say anything else. Even when the squad leader brought Ye Jian back for training, she didn’t understand why Ye Jian came to the air force from the military unit.","Lu Hui had been paying attention to Ye Jian’s movements. When she saw Ye Jian coming back, her gaze flickered and she stared at Ye Jian even more intently. She wanted to know what other changes Ye Jian had undergone since she became a different person.","For instance, was she still lacking in basic training?","In the past, Ye Jian couldn’t even kick a sandbag. Her posture was stiff, and her strength was weak. The 150-kilogram sandbag didn’t move at all.","Unexpectedly, with just one look from Ye Jian at this moment, Lu Hui was almost scared to death."]},{"number":5168,"title":"Chapter 5168: Does Her Military Rank Match Her Strength","paragraphs":["When Lu Hui saw that Ye Jian had returned and that she was still going to continue training with them, she wanted to take a good look.","It was easy to change one’s appearance. If one was determined, it was easy to change one’s appearance.","However, one could not rely on acting when it came to displaying one’s personal ability!","Since Ye Jian had changed her appearance, Lu Hui naturally wanted to take a good look at her.","Lu Hui was a member of the female soldier class. In the past, she was the same as all the female soldiers. Every time they trained, she would reject Ye Jian. In all their hearts, Ye Jian was a female soldier who couldn’t even pass the company’s basic training. Her comprehensive ability was so weak that it was unbearable to look at her.","Hence, every time it was Ye Jian’s turn during training, the female soldiers would keep an eye on her. Once they realized that she made a mistake, they would point it out immediately and show no mercy.","In order to disguise herself, Ye Jian showed weakness during all the basic training. Even though she appeared to be like a different person with her return this time, the female soldiers’ impression of Ye Jian didn’t change immediately.","After portraying a weak soldier for half a year, Ye Jian’s ’incompetent’ image had long been ingrained in the hearts of the female soldiers. How could they change it in a short period of time?","At this moment, the female soldiers saw that Ye Jian wouldn’t be taking a rest and would immediately go back into training. The female soldiers had already noticed Ye Jian when she walked over with the squad leader.","\"Is she planning to train with us?\"","\"Duh. Isn’t she already here?\"","\"Then is she still a member of our air force? She’s clearly a lieutenant of the army. Why did she come to our air force?\"","\"Who knows? Stop talking. She seemed to have glanced at us.\"","\"Don’t scare me. We’re still far away. How can she see us?\"","That being said, they didn’t discuss it secretly anymore. As the deputy squad leader gave the order, all the female soldiers changed from kicking sandbags with their right legs to kicking the sandbags with their left legs. Their bodies, which were originally facing inward, were now facing outward. This way, they didn’t need to turn their heads. They could directly size up Ye Jian from the corner of their eyes.","Would she really train with them?","The female soldiers, who were at their peak of surprise, saw Ye Jian getting closer and closer. The darkness in their eyes got stronger.","Was there any other change in her temperament besides the fact that she had changed?","She had changed on the outside, but what about the inside?","Had anything changed?","Poor foundation, poor receptiveness... These were all inherent. They represented one’s capabilities. Had her capabilities changed?","She could change her appearance and put on airs, but on the inside... They would still be able to tell what she was capable of.","As Ye Jian got closer and closer to the sandbag training area, the female soldiers who were paying attention to Ye Jian from the corner of their eyes couldn’t help but blink. She was here! Ye Jian, who had changed in nine days, really planned to train with them!","Ye Jian’s lieutenant rank, qualifications, and military service duration were much higher than theirs. They couldn’t wait to know how capable Ye Jian was. Had she been hiding her identity and personal strength from the rest of them?","Most of the female soldiers were still suspicious, but no one stood up to question Ye Jian’s identity. The military unit’s military ranks were strictly controlled. No soldier dared to fake their military ranks.","The female soldiers didn’t suspect that Ye Jian’s military rank was fake. They just wondered if Ye Jian’s ability was compatible with her military rank."]},{"number":5169,"title":"Chapter 5169: Whetstone","paragraphs":["Ye Jian didn’t give herself any time to rest. The male soldiers who came back from the exercise had already started their training. She naturally couldn’t be exempted. She would train the way the female soldiers trained.","Whether it was the airborne soldiers or the army infantries, they would have basic training such as kicking sandbags. They had to complete it every day and not fall behind. Ye Jian would just train in the same way as she did in the past.","She knew that almost all the female soldiers were looking at her from the corner of their eyes. Their gazes were filled with curiosity. They were filled with curiosity and the desire to inquire about her. They wanted to know what she had become.","Had her identity changed? Before, she was still so weak. She was so weak that they could stand up and point out her mistakes at any time.","Ye Jian could understand their feelings. She was indeed weak and useless in the past.","Commander Kong was really accurate. It was a good thing that female soldiers were arrogant. However, if their arrogance became too much, it would hinder their potential. Hence, they needed someone to whittle down their arrogance, drive, and conceit.","And she was the knife that Commander Kong specially mentioned. In order to improve her personal combat ability, she was willing to become the knife in Commander Kong’s hands to whittle them down.","She walked in front of an empty sandbag and tilted her body slightly. She clenched her fists into a combat stance. The aura around her changed in an instant. Her silhouette was sharp.","The female soldiers who were paying attention to her tensed up. Lu Hui was so frightened that she almost fell to the ground.","She was different!","She was really different!","In the past, Ye Jian didn’t have such a sharp aura during training. In the past, Ye Jian was an unqualified soldier. One look and you could tell that she was a soldier who would drag her class down.","Now, even before she kicked, her aura was enough to let people know that she was good! Extraordinary even!","The squad leader, who was looking at her, had a complicated look in her eyes. Ye Jian’s posture... was no longer the same as before. Her posture was standard, and her aura was fierce. It made her, the squad leader, shudder inexplicably.","The deputy squad leader shouted the command. Ye Jian, who was ready, shouted along with the other female soldiers. Her gaze was sharp as she raised her left leg and slammed it towards the sandbag that weighed 150 catties.","The sandbag that was hit by her left leg was raised high. The angle and height of the sandbag was the highest among all the female soldiers. It went so high up that all the female soldiers could see the sandbag that Ye Jian kicked. They could even see the dent on the sandbag.","Lu Hui saw the raised sandbag and saw the dent on it. Then, she looked at Ye Jian, whose back view was sharp. Lu Hui’s pupils constricted.","\"One...\"","They stood still.","\"Two!\"","Then, they kicked and shouted.","\"Three!\"","They retracted their legs.","When the deputy squad leader shouted ’three’, Ye Jian retracted her left leg and stood still. Her body wasn’t shaking.","Her posture was straight, and her aura was imposing. Her actions were fierce, and her gaze was sharp... This was the real Ye Jian, an ace female soldier who had experienced countless life and death battles!","Just one kick was enough to shock the female soldiers.","Was this Ye Jian... the real Ye Jian?","Could a person really change so much?","She changed her outer appearance and even her inner ability?"]},{"number":5170,"title":"Chapter 5170: Crushing","paragraphs":["The female soldiers were shocked. Facing Ye Jian’s sudden change, they were so shocked that they blinked and looked over.","The back view of the person who kicked the sandbag until it looked like it would fly out at any moment was really Ye Jian. They weren’t seeing things.","How was that possible?!","How was that possible?!","In the past, Ye Jian wouldn’t be able to keep up with the commands when she kicked the sandbag. She would fall. If not, she would sway even more than the sandbag.","Right now, Ye Jian was the only one who could make the sandbag swing!","Could it be that the Ye Jian they saw in the past wasn’t the real Ye Jian? Was the Ye Jian they saw now the real Ye Jian?","\"One...\"","They stood still.","\"Two!\"","Then, they kicked and shouted.","\"Three!\"","They retracted their legs.","Ye Jian followed the deputy squad leader’s commands and raised her left leg again and again. Every action was so precise and fierce. She seemed to be training tirelessly.","The frightened female soldiers retracted their gazes and kicked the sandbags seriously.","They didn’t dare to look anymore. They couldn’t even believe what they were seeing.","\"How is that possible? How is that possible? How can she become so powerful all of a sudden?\" Lu Hui, who was kicking the sandbag, muttered in a low voice. Her heart was in a mess. She couldn’t figure it out.","After kicking the sandbag for half an hour, the squad leader whistled. The female soldiers who hadn’t rested for even a minute heard the whistle and reacted quickly. They started the 500-meter sprint.","A 500-meter sprint wasn’t enough. They needed to sprint a thousand meters.","Every time they completed the sandbag training, they wouldn’t rest for a second, just like the male soldiers. When the whistle sounded, they ran forward. They competed to see who could reach the next training gathering point first.","The next training was the one where Ye Jian got scolded the most in the past half a year. She received the most disdain and was ostracized the most. Every time, no one was willing to be her partner.","Although it was called a training, it was actually a comprehensive basic training. It was similar to the 400-meter steeplechase, but it consumed more stamina than the 400-meter steeplechase.","The airborne soldiers used aircraft and parachutes to infiltrate the enemy’s rear, assault, and attack important targets. They were an assault force that had the ability to move quickly in the air and surpass geographical obstacles. They were also a unit that had the ability to fight everywhere.","Hence, the training of the airborne soldiers focused on speed, ferocity, and speed. The following training was special training for speed, ferocity, and speed.","\"Hurry! Follow me! Follow me! Didn’t you eat? Don’t you have any energy? Are you taking a walk?\"","\"Are the two of you admiring the flowers as you walk? Should I place a table and two chairs for the two of you? Then, you can make a pot of tea and sit down to admire the flowers.\"","\"Hurry up! Hurry!\"","The voices of the squad leader and deputy squad leaders came from time to time. The female soldiers gritted their teeth and sweated as they ran toward the next training gathering point 1,000 meters away.","The southwest area was vast and sparsely populated. Even the military unit’s training ground was very big. The target training was here, the physical training was over there, and the tactical training was in another place. They trained in the east, west, and south. Every run was a long run. It was also training.","Lu Hui and the other female soldiers, who usually hated Ye Jian the most, rubbed their fists as they ran. They wanted to surpass Ye Jian in the basic training."]},{"number":5171,"title":"Chapter 5171: This Is Ability","paragraphs":["\"We’ll form a team later. We’ll split into two groups of six. We’ll take the lead first and let her see our true capabilities,\" Lu Hui, who was running, said in a low voice. The five female soldiers beside her leaned close to her and listened to her. \"I really want to know how powerful Lieutenant Ye is now. It’s impossible for me to admit that she’s powerful just because she’s good at kicking a sandbag.\"","Lu Hui had been bold in her words and thoughts. She was also one of the hot-tempered people on the team. She had a sharp tongue.","What she said was what the female soldiers were thinking. Hearing that, they quickly nodded to show that there was no problem.","\"We make three pairs. There are still four pairs left. We need to let them form a team as soon as possible. When the time comes, she’ll be alone. Let’s see how she passes.\"","\"Everything else is fine, but the main thing is that shooting from both sides requires two people to work together to pass. We have 14 people working together while she’s alone. That’s not appropriate, is it?\"","\"What’s wrong with that?\" Lu Hui shook her head. \"In the past, we treated her like this. Now, our attitudes are the same. We can’t immediately flatter her just because she’s a lieutenant now, right?\"","\"We can accept her, sure. But first, she has to show us that she is qualified. If she lacks the ability, even if she’s a lieutenant, I’ll still treat her the same as before.","\"Come, let’s run first and kill the prestige of her return!\"","\"Sure!\"","\"That’s a good idea!\"","\"Run!\"","Lu Hui was open and forthright. She would never change her attitude because of the other party’s identity. Lu Hui was a female soldier who had a clear distinction between love and hate.","The other female soldiers pursed their lips and smiled.","That was right. They couldn’t immediately change their attitude and flatter Ye Jian just because she was a lieutenant now.","They were special reconnaissance soldiers in the military unit. What mattered was their capabilities!","So what if she was a lieutenant?","What prestige could a lieutenant with no ability have?","They could respect her to her face, but what about behind her back?","\"400 meters left. Hurry!\"","\"Push out your chest, raise your head, and speed up!\"","The squad leader’s voice was like a demonic voice in their ears. She urged the female soldiers to speed up and run. Lu Hui, who wanted to kill Ye Jian’s prestige now that she had returned, rushed forward in one go.","She wanted to be the first. The other female soldiers wanted to be the first too. Ye Jian, who had always strived for first place, was no exception.","In the past, every time she ran, she would be the last. When she arrived at her destination, everyone else would’ve already partnered up. There were 15 people, so they could only make seven pairs. She was the only one left. Every time this happened, the squad leader would choose someone to complete the training with her.","Every time this happened, Ye Jian would feel apologetic because she had to drag them down.","Now, she felt that she could fight for first place. She would be able to complete the next training even without a partner.","She accelerated again and again. In an instant, several female soldiers were left behind by her. Her speed was too fast. It was like a strong wind that blew past them. The female soldiers that she surpassed didn’t even see who the figure was.","\"So fast!\"","\"Way too fast!\"","They looked at the phantom and muttered subconsciously.","Guo Cui felt a strong wind blowing past her. She looked up and saw a shadow flashing past her eyes. The astonishing speed made her stop in her tracks. A name flashed past her mind.","Who was running so fast?","Ye Jian...","She thought about Ye Jian.","That was because she knew very well the strength of all the female soldiers in the class. No one could be so fast that she was like a phantom.","There was only Ye Jian!"]},{"number":5172,"title":"Chapter 5172: Phantom","paragraphs":["Her figure, which was almost like a shadow, surpassed many people in a row. Then, she passed by Lu Hui. In the end, she surpassed the female soldiers at an astonishing speed. She was only behind the squad leader.","Lu Hui felt a strong wind brushing past her. Before she could react, she saw a shadow suddenly flash past her from the corner of her eye. She, who was fighting for the first place, felt as if a huge tub of ice water had been poured on her. She was caught off guard.","Who was running so fast?","Who surpassed her?","Her expression changed. She clenched her fists tightly and sped up.","She still had a chance to win. She still had a chance to win!","’Come on, Lu Hui!","’You can definitely do it!’","Lu Hui, who was cheering for herself, stared at the two figures in front of her. One was the squad leader, and the other... was Ye Jian.","Just now, the person who ran past her at such a fast speed was none other than Ye Jian.","The figure that surpassed her was getting farther and farther away from her. She was too fast. She was so fast that Lu Hui couldn’t catch up even if she used all her strength.","Ye Jian surpassed her and the squad leader, who ran the fastest in the class. In the end, she surpassed all the female soldiers and became the one running at the front.","At that moment, Lu Hui’s eyes were filled with panic.","Someone who was always inferior to her and whom she looked down on and ostracized had suddenly surpassed her.","It was a very, very unpleasant feeling.","It felt like the stinging pain of getting bitten by a thousand ants.","Lu Hui couldn’t accept it for a moment. The other female soldiers were the same.","The squad leader looked at the figure that surpassed her in the blink of an eye. The complexity in her eyes got stronger. Ye Jian! It seemed that the current Ye Jian was the real Ye Jian.","She said many things, but it was as good as nothing. As the squad leader, she still didn’t understand why Ye Jian came to the airforce and why she spent the first half a year putting on an act.","That wasn’t the real her... Now, the squad leader understood what Ye Jian meant.","Half a year ago, the strength that Ye Jian displayed wasn’t her real strength. She had to hide it for some reason.","The running figure was too dazzling. Even the sunlight seemed to be chasing after her footsteps. Wherever she passed, she shone brightly like the morning sun.","This Ye Jian was the real Ye Jian.","The squad leader chased after her, her eyes shining brightly. She was looking for a challenge. She wanted to compete with Ye Jian. She wanted to know how powerful Ye Jian was.","The squad leader didn’t back down. Instead, she became braver.","She was the squad leader. If she didn’t have any tolerance and was jealous of a soldier stronger than her, she didn’t deserve to be a qualified soldier.","No, Ye Jian wasn’t a soldier. She was a lieutenant.","A lieutenant who had a higher position than her and who had served the military longer than her.","They were getting closer and closer to the next training gathering point. Ye Jian, who was running, was so light that she seemed to be riding the wind. She arrived at the gathering point effortlessly.","Standing still, she turned around and faced the dozens of figures running over. Under the sunlight, the running figures were sweating profusely. With unyielding stubbornness, they stepped on the sunlight and bathed in the cold wind of the southwest in September until they reached the finish line.","Ye Jian, who was the first to reach the gathering point, looked at the running figures. The running figures also looked at the figure waiting for them at the finish line."]},{"number":5173,"title":"Chapter 5173: A Little Bad","paragraphs":["Everyone’s expression changed drastically as they widened their eyes and looked at the figure waiting for them.","Ye Jian! The shadow that surpassed them quickly just now was none other than Ye Jian, who had returned. She was the first to reach the finish line at a speed that crushed everyone in the class. Her speed was as shocking as the wind.","They couldn’t believe it. They couldn’t believe that Ye Jian, who had always lagged behind and was last, had surpassed everyone.","She even surpassed the squad leader who ran the fastest on the team. Their goal all this while had been to surpass the squad leader!","The military unit was a place where everyone strived to be the top soldier. No matter how high their military rank was, they would always be challenged. As long as there was nothing wrong with the challenge, the superiors would agree.","Hence, it was normal for the female soldiers to want to surpass their squad leader.","In the end, the squad leader was not surpassed by them. Instead, she was surpassed by Ye Jian, whom they looked down on in the past!","Were they disheartened?","A little.","Were they jealous?","A little.","Surprised?","They were still in shock. They didn’t know if Ye Jian would give them more ’shocks.’","The squad leader was the second to reach the gathering point. She looked at Ye Jian and panted as she smiled. \"Not bad. Your running speed is quite amazing. Were you always number one in your old military unit?\"","\"No, they ran faster than me,\" Ye Jian replied with a smile. She subconsciously treated the Xueyu unit as her old military unit.","The speed of the veterans in the brigade was like a leopard. She could only beat them occasionally.","The squad leader was shocked. \"With your speed, you’re not number one?\" Which military unit was this Lieutenant Ye from? They were so impressive!","She wanted to ask, but she didn’t.","Ye Jian probably wouldn’t answer.","\"Yeah, I can only run past them occasionally.\" Ye Jian would answer questions that didn’t reveal secrets. \"Compared to them, I’m still lacking.\"","Ye Jian truly thought so.","The comrades of the Xueyu unit knew how to fly a few planes. As for her, she had only sat on a few planes, but she didn’t know how to fly them.","They knew how to drive tanks and armored vehicles too. They could familiarize themselves with all kinds of high-end weapons. Any problem could be solved in minutes. It wasn’t a problem for them. Ye Jian always felt that she was inferior to her comrades from the Xueyu unit.","After entering the airborne military unit and becoming a special reconnaissance soldier, she felt that she would be able to close the distance between them.","\"Do you go through a lot of basic training? Is that why you’re all so powerful? The basic training of the airborne soldiers and the infantries should be similar, right?\" The squad leader pursed her lips and asked. She stared at Ye Jian without blinking.","Ye Jian glanced at the squad leader. She understood what was going on. She smiled and nodded. \"Yes, the basic training is not much different. We have sandbag kicking and running.\"","Hearing this, the squad leader heaved a sigh of relief. Even she didn’t know why she felt relaxed when she heard this.","That would explain why Ye Jian had a good foundation. It was the same training. As long as she wasn’t horrible, her foundation wouldn’t be bad.","The squad leader, who was slightly relaxed, thought about it. Some words almost slipped out of her mouth, but they were slowly swallowed back. If she said something now, would Lieutenant Ye think that she was deliberately looking for trouble?"]},{"number":5174,"title":"Chapter 5174: I Can Do It Alone","paragraphs":["Looking at the squad leader who wanted to say something but hesitated, Ye Jian smiled politely and said, \"Squad leader, although I’m a lieutenant, I’m a lieutenant in the army, not a lieutenant in the air force. You’re still my squad leader. If you have anything to say, just say it.\"","The squad leader felt a little embarrassed. \"It’s nothing much. I just want to remind you that although the basic training of the two armies is similar, our airborne troops insist on multi-purpose training, and our technical training is very different from that of the infantries. You should know it after half a year of training, so I won’t say more. Your basic training is good, but your technical training... still... needs to be improved.\"","This was a tactful reminder to Ye Jian that she was transferred from the army. Her foundation was good, but her technical training had to be improved.","Ye Jian smiled and nodded. \"Thank you for your reminder, squad leader. I understand.\"","She thanked her politely, but that just made the squad leader feel even more uncomfortable.","The squad leader nodded vaguely and didn’t dare to look at Ye Jian anymore. The real Ye Jian had a sharp aura that made the squad leader tense. Even if Ye Jian was smiling at her, she couldn’t relax.","Just in time, the 13 female soldiers arrived one after another. They glanced at Ye Jian from the corner of their eyes and had different thoughts.","Ye Jian was really fast. She even beat the squad leader.","They gathered in formation and started the next round of training.","Lu Hui and the other three had already partnered up. Guo Cui wanted to partner up with Ye Jian, but in the end, she partnered up with Fang Xin. Li Xiushui and Tang Liyin formed a team. The other female soldiers also formed their own teams. The squad leader and deputy squad leader formed a team as usual.","The squad leader looked at Ye Jian, who was still alone. She pursed her lips slightly and glanced at the female soldiers who had formed teams in advance. These girls were still the same as before. They didn’t change because of Ye Jian.","\"Ye Jian, you go last. I’ll partner with you,\" said the squad leader. The squad leader and the deputy squad leader usually took turns to partner up with Ye Jian in the past, and it was the same now.","However, something about today was different. In the past, Ye Jian would reply weakly, \"Alright.\" Now, Ye Jian stood tall and straight. She said calmly and confidently, \"Squad leader, I want to try doing it alone.\"","One could still hear the sound of breathing on the training ground, but suddenly, it fell silent. Even the air seemed to have frozen. Nothing happened for a long time.","Fourteen gazes gathered on Ye Jian. All the female soldiers looked at Ye Jian with dark eyes.","She actually wanted to complete it alone? Really? Was she trying to be brave?","\"The chest targets on both sides need two people to complete it together. If you don’t reach the standard, you’ll be punished to run five kilometers. Think carefully.\"","Lu Hui took a look and lowered her eyes slightly.","In the past, when Ye Jian and the squad leader were partners, she implicated the squad leader and they had to run five kilometers together.","So, what difference did it make whether she did it alone or with another soldier?","\"I’ve thought about it.\" Ye Jian smiled. \"In the past, you and I were punished to run five kilometers together. If I can’t reach the standard, there’s no difference between doing it alone and with another person.\"","The female soldiers couldn’t help but purse their lips and smile. Lu Hui glanced at Ye Jian in surprise. Ye Jian had changed. She actually knew her limits.","As soon as Lu Hui had the thought, Ye Jian said it out loud.","The squad leader wanted to laugh too, but she endured it.","She stared at Ye Jian for a while. After confirming that Ye Jian didn’t have any intention of changing her mind, she nodded and agreed.","Seeing the squad leader agree, the female soldiers exchanged glances with each other."]},{"number":5175,"title":"Chapter 5175: I Got The Smile Of A Child","paragraphs":["She was so confident. She didn’t seem to be putting on a brave front.","Could it be that she could really complete a shooting task that required two people?","The female soldiers looked at the chest targets on both sides of the bend silently. They felt that it was impossible. There were a total of 40 chest targets. Could Ye Jian do it?","The female soldiers were suspicious.","In the past, Ye Jian missed five out of ten chest targets. She didn’t even get seven points. Could she really do it?","The female soldiers, who were questioning it, started the next round of training.","They didn’t raise their doubts in front of Ye Jian. Ye Jian had changed, after all. Before they figured it out, it was better to say less. It wasn’t like in the past. If Ye Jian had said that in the past, she would’ve been mocked.","This round of training was very difficult, and the distance was quite far. After one round of training, it was 1,000 meters. Then, it was another 1,000 meters from the finish line to the gathering point. It was equivalent to a round trip of 2,000 meters. The entire process required a combination of speed and a huge consumption of physical strength.","In the past, Ye Jian was scolded the most here!","The squad leader and deputy squad leader started first. The two of them crossed the bent wire net at the fastest speed and jumped ten saddle horses in a row. After jumping into the deep hole that was two meters high and climbing up, they immediately crawled through the low wire net. They then got up and ran to shoot the chest targets on both sides. After shooting, they immediately climbed up the rope and landed on the five-meter high platform. They then shot the chest targets on both sides again before carrying the parachutes on their backs to return to the gathering point.","When the two of them ran back, their hair was already drenched in sweat, and large drops of sweat flowed down their cheeks. Their faces were flushed red, and they were drenched in sweat.","Ye Jian looked at the time. Not bad. As expected of the top soldiers, their movements were coherent and tacit. There was no delay at all. They used 12 minutes and 16 seconds. Their results were not bad.","It was the second team’s turn. The two figures ran quickly and started their warm-up before training.","That was right. The first round was both a warm-up and a competition. The 15 of them would pass one round before continuing their training together. They wouldn’t wait for the female soldiers in front to run back before starting. Instead, when the first team of female soldiers was passing through the low wire net, the next team would start immediately. Every one of them would complete ten rounds before the training ended.","After training here, the female soldiers only had 15 minutes of rest. Next was the technical training of the airborne soldiers, such as dizziness resistance training.","The squad leader panted heavily as she counted the time. The deputy squad leader wrote down the time of each team and the rankings in the end. Whoever was at the bottom would have to run five kilometers.","Ye Jian had to run a lot. For half a year, she was punished to run five kilometers every day.","Lu Hui, who was rotating her wrist, whispered to her partner, \"We have to achieve a good result. We can’t embarrass ourselves in front of the army.\"","\"Of course. In the past, we were always in the top three. This time, let’s see if we can be ranked first.\" The competitive female soldier was full of ambition. She really wanted to win the squad leader and deputy squad leader.","They had been second place for too long. It was annoying.","They all wanted to win. There were no differences and their goals were the same. That made things easier.","They looked at each other and got ready to start.","After they were done, the two of them ran back and looked at the time. They were instantly amused. 12 minutes and three seconds. They were currently ranked first!","They had really surpassed the squad leader and deputy squad leader.","\"Not bad. You’ve improved! Keep it up.\" The squad leader was very happy too. As the squad leader, she was naturally very happy that the soldiers had improved.","Lu Hui smiled and shook her head. \"I’ll definitely keep it up. My goal is to catch up with Captain Lei and his team.\""]},{"number":5176,"title":"Chapter 5176: Use One’s Abilities To Make Things Difficult","paragraphs":["Lu Hui’s smile wasn’t provocative. It was more like she was challenging Ye Jian directly. This was the most common occurrence in the military unit. If someone didn’t respect another, they would issue a challenge to test their capabilities.","If the person who issued the challenge lost, they would not cause any more trouble in the future.","This was probably what Lu Hui had in mind.","Was she very powerful?","Hahaha...","She had already surpassed the squad leader and deputy squad leader. Could Ye Jian complete all the subjects alone? It was fine if it was just one subject, but how could Ye Jian take on a two-person task alone?","It would be strange if she could complete it!","The squad leader saw Lu Hui’s smile. When the next team of female soldiers started, she walked to Ye Jian’s side and confirmed again, \"Do you really plan to complete it alone? Won’t you consider me? Maybe the deputy squad leader?\"","In the past, Ye Jian had always come last, and all the female soldiers were used to it. However, the current Ye Jian was different from the past. She was a lieutenant of a company. If she lost too quickly, the soldiers would look down on her.","They already looked down on her. If she lost again, they would really look down on her from the bottom of their hearts. They wouldn’t take a lieutenant like her seriously.","The squad leader reminded her out of kindness. Ye Jian, who was still smiling, shook her head. \"No need. I want to try doing it alone. It doesn’t matter if I succeed or not. I just want to try.\"","It didn’t matter if she succeeded or not. The main thing was to try... If she embarrassed herself later, everyone would look down on her. The squad leader felt that she herself couldn’t do it. She didn’t have a strong mentality like Ye Jian.","The squad leader heaved a sigh of relief and nodded. \"Okay, try it, then. If you really lose, so be it. Everyone knows how hard it is anyway. It doesn’t matter if you lose. Just bear with it.\"","She looked up at Lu Hui who was standing in front of her. The squad leader lowered her voice and said helplessly, \"Lu Hui is just like that. She doesn’t have any evil intentions. She’s not a bad person. She just has a sharp mouth.\"","She was worried that Ye Jian would cause trouble for Lu Hui in the future. It was easy for a lieutenant to make things difficult for a mere soldier.","Moreover, Ye Jian joined the unit secretly. They didn’t know, but Captain Lei must have known. If anything happened, Captain Lei would definitely stand on Ye Jian’s side.","The squad leader liked Lu Hui, so she had to protect her.","Ye Jian knew that the squad leader was putting in a lot of effort. Ye Jian had never thought of making things difficult for Lu Hui.","She wouldn’t make things difficult for each soldier individually. Ye Jian would only make things difficult for everyone collectively. Yes, she would use her capabilities to make things difficult for them.","That was Commander Kong’s order.","It was the duty of soldiers to obey orders. She had no other choice. She had to obey!","She was now the whittling knife in Commander Kong’s hands. Not only did she have to blunt the pride of the female soldiers, but she also had to stab them at some point to teach them a lesson.","\"Rest assured, squad leader. I’m not that narrow-minded. I know that Lu Hui is not a bad person. She just has a sharp tongue. I also know that she has the guts. She’s a good talent. If not, she wouldn’t have been chosen to enter the special reconnaissance company of the airborne forces.\"","The squad leader immediately felt at ease upon hearing that. She smiled. \"Usually, we see that you’re quite tolerant. If not...\"","The squad leader shut up awkwardly.","There was no need to mention the past. It was all in the past. It was over. Wouldn’t she be making herself uncomfortable if she mentioned it again?","She wouldn’t talk about it anymore. As long as Ye Jian was still in their unit, they were not allowed to talk about the past."]},{"number":5177,"title":"Chapter 5177: Shocked","paragraphs":["Ye Jian knew what the squad leader wanted to say. She raised her eyebrows slightly and smiled without saying anything.","Actually, she was not a petty person. But if anyone offended her, she would remember them. If she didn’t return the favor at that time... she would do it at a later time.","Of course, it was just personal grudges.","As for Lu Hui, she had indeed refuted her many times in the past. Lu Hui made it hard for Ye Jian to even get a word in. Sometimes, Ye Jian wanted to ask if all the ladies from metropolises had a clever and sharp mouth.","Lu Hui had a sharp tongue but was not a bad person. Lu Hui only said harsh words to her during training.","Because of this, Ye Jian never thought of making things difficult for Lu Hui when she came back.","It was the same for other female soldiers.","It was normal to be ostracized and reprimanded in the military unit.","With Ye Jian’s reassurance, the squad leader was in a good mood. However, her mood quickly turned gloomy. Two teams had bad results. The squad leader looked at the timer, and her expression was so dark that all the female soldiers kept quiet.","Anything below 12 minutes and 30 seconds was ideal. Anything between 12 minutes and 30 seconds to 13 minutes was good. Anything above 13 minutes 30 seconds meant the soldiers were lacking. Two teams had taken more than 13 minutes and 50 seconds. It would be strange if the squad leader’s expression wasn’t dark.","\"The six of you will train here for two hours tonight! You can rest when you pass!\" The squad leader’s voice was cold. It was colder than the wind on the mountain.","The six female soldiers replied in unison. Their faces were tense as they felt ashamed of their results.","The 14 female soldiers in the first seven teams had completed the training. There were three teams with outstanding results, two teams with good results, and two teams with unqualified results. Only Ye Jian hadn’t completed it.","The deputy squad leader also asked Ye Jian if she really wanted to do it alone. Ye Jian told her with certainty again that she really wanted to try doing it alone.","What else could the deputy squad leader say if Ye Jian insisted on it?","\"Ye Jian!\"","\"Here!\"","The deputy squad leader shouted. Ye Jian ran forward and stood at attention, waiting for the order without any fear.","She was too calm. The confidence she exuded as she ran enveloped her entire body like the sun. Everywhere she went, there was light. The female soldiers’ gazes had already landed on her unknowingly. They slowly clenched their fists.","This Ye Jian was as dazzling as the morning sun. It had only been less than two hours, but their initial impression of her had already faded a little. In a daze, they felt that she was bright and calm.","\"Is she really going to do it alone?\"","\"I don’t know if it’ll work. Looking at her, I feel that it’s possible.\"","\"Do you feel that Ye Jian... is quite powerful? I feel that she’s really capable now.\"","\"She hasn’t even started. How do you know how powerful she is? Is it because of her military rank?\"","\"Are you picking a fight with me? I said the word ’feel.’\"","\"Shh, don’t talk. It’s starting!\"","\"The time... starts now!\" The order was given. The deputy squad leader pressed the stopwatch and started counting the time. Ye Jian, who was carrying a gun on her back, rushed out with agility and speed.","Her speed was too fierce and fast. She was like a cheetah that had discovered its prey. Before she even started, she exuded an explosive force that shocked everyone. The entire venue was silent.","\"Hiss...\"","Someone sucked in a breath of cold air. It was so shocking that the female soldiers trembled and felt their limbs going numb.","\"So fast...\"","Another female soldier muttered unconsciously."]},{"number":5178,"title":"Chapter 5178: Shocked","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was really fast. In the blink of an eye, she rushed out in front of them. In another blink of an eye, she was already 30 meters away.","In a flash, the figure in the sky-blue camouflage training clothes arched her back and rushed through the wire net one after another.","She was too fast. She wasn’t worried that she would be hooked by the sharp wire. She was so fast that they were worried that the next second, the figure that was rushing over would have problems with the wire.","However, it didn’t happen.","She had completed the wire netting. It was as easy as covering the ground without any obstacles.","The squad leader looked at the stopwatch. There were waves in her eyes. \"It took 17 seconds.\"","Only... Only 17 seconds!","The deputy squad leader thought that she heard wrong. She looked up at the squad leader. \"17 seconds?\"","\"Yes, 17 seconds.\" The squad leader nodded. She didn’t see wrong. It was indeed 17 seconds.","When the female soldier closest to her heard that, she covered her mouth with her hand to stop herself from screaming. 17 seconds!","She, she, she... Ye Jian only used 17 seconds! She was twice as fast as the squad leader and more than twice as fast as the other female soldiers!","She covered her mouth and turned to her comrades beside her. Just as she was about to speak, she realized that her comrades were doing the same thing as her. They were covering their mouths to prevent themselves from screaming.","When their gazes met, they could clearly see the shock in each other’s eyes.","She passed through the wire net in 17 seconds. She was more than twice as fast as them!","The two of them heard the time reported by the vice-captain. The other female soldiers didn’t hear it, but they saw it!","They saw how fast Ye Jian was and how standard her posture was. If they didn’t know that the figure was Ye Jian, they would have thought that it was one of Captain Lei’s soldiers.","Only the soldiers under Captain Lei could be so powerful.","But that was Ye Jian!","In the past, Ye Jian took more than 40 seconds to cross the wire netting!","Lu Hui, whose eyes were wide open, pressed her chest and panted heavily. She had to steady herself. She couldn’t panic now. If she panicked, she would definitely lose. She needed to steady herself.","Deep breaths, deep breaths! She couldn’t panic yet! The results were not out yet!","She might not win, but she might not lose either. She had to wait for the final result to come out.","Lu Hui kept taking deep breaths to calm herself down. The other female soldiers continued to be shocked.","On the other hand, Guo Cui’s expression was the calmest.","She always felt that Ye Jian was strange. Now, she didn’t feel that Ye Jian was strange at all. She should be like this!","Guo Cui was the calmest among all the female soldiers.","Ye Jian had already completed four out of ten saddle horses. She held the saddle with her right hand and held the rifle horizontally in her left hand. She passed through the air one by one. It was too fast. She was so fast that her feet didn’t seem to touch the ground from one saddle horse to the next. It gave people the illusion that she was floating over.","After the ten saddle horses were completed, the squad leader reported her time again. The deputy squad leader, who was taking notes, realized that her hands were trembling. Ye Jian was... two times faster than her and the squad leader!","The deputy squad leader raised her head and realized that Ye Jian was no longer on the sports ground. Ye Jian had already jumped into the deep pit that was two meters high.","The moment she jumped into the pit, she stabilized her footsteps and grabbed the climbing rope tightly with both hands. She pulled it forcefully and stepped on the edge with both feet. In an instant, she came out of the deep pit that was two meters high."]},{"number":5179,"title":"Chapter 5179: A Cheating Life","paragraphs":["At this moment, gasps sounded one after another.","Lu Hui felt that her heart was beating very fast and heavy. Even breathing was a little difficult. She was afraid that she was lacking oxygen.","She thought that if she defeated the squad leader today, she would become the first today. From the looks of it, everything was still unknown!","Even though Ye Jian didn’t have a partner, Lu Hui knew that she had lost. She really lost!","If Ye Jian had a partner, Lu Hui might still win.","After Ye Jian passed through the wire netting, Lu Hui knew that she had lost. She had lost in the ten saddle horses too. There were still a few subjects left... Only in shooting could she be sure of defeating Ye Jian.","Two people were in charge of shooting 20 chest targets. Lu Hui hit all 20 chest targets. She scored five ten-ring scores, and the rest were above eight rings.","Shooting was her forte in all her basic training. Lu Hui was confident in this.","At least she could win one subject. At least she wouldn’t lose completely.","Lu Hui secretly encouraged herself and comforted herself. Who knew that... she was destined to end in a crushing defeat?","As a sniper, Ye Jian had never lost in shooting.","\"Now, I finally know why she didn’t choose a partner,\" the deputy squad leader said in a low voice. Then, she continued to tremble as she jotted down the time. \"Having a partner is just a burden to her. It’ll slow her down.\"","The squad leader nodded lightly. That was right. Having a partner would really slow Ye Jian down.","\"There’s still the shooting subject with 40 targets. Let’s see how many she can shoot.\" The squad leader took a deep breath and let it out. Her mind was in a mess, and her heart was churning. She couldn’t look at Ye Jian calmly.","The female soldiers had once said that Ye Jian’s personal ability was weak and she was slow to learn. Now, their faces were burning with pain.","Why did they think that Ye Jian couldn’t do it in the past?","Why did they never suspect anything?","They were blind!","Ye Jian, who was crawling through the low wire net at a high speed, didn’t care what the female soldiers were thinking. She was immersed in training. She moved her legs forward and held the gun in her left hand. She quickly passed through the wire and took a breather. Then, she placed one hand on the ground and leaned forward. She ran again.","There were chest targets on both sides in front. Two people were supposed to be in charge of shooting together. Now, Ye Jian was alone. How many points would she get?","In the past, Ye Jian...","No, one couldn’t mention the Ye Jian of the past anymore. The Ye Jian of the past was fake. She had just been pretending!","Bang!","A gunshot was fired. The bullet hit the chest target, but the female soldiers felt as if it had hit their chests instead.","After continuous shots, the chest targets fell. Three of the three chest targets fell. One on the right and two on the left.","\"Am I seeing things? Am I seeing things? Am I seeing things...\"","\"Are... Are her chest targets broken?\"","\"Ye Jian... Gosh, Ye Jian... She, she...\"","All kinds of incredulous discussions could no longer be hidden. The scene in front of them made it impossible for them to suppress the shock in their hearts, let alone remain silent.","Ye Jian completed the chest targets that two people were supposed to complete alone.","She completed it alone...","What was even scarier was that she... scored ten points for all.","Because only by hitting the ten-ring chest target would it fall down!","Three shots, and three chest targets fell. Ten points for all!","Shocked?","They were so shocked that their eyes were about to pop out!"]},{"number":5180,"title":"Chapter 5180: Shocked","paragraphs":["How could they not be shocked?","All the female soldiers thought that it was impossible for Ye Jian to complete chest target shooting alone. Even though they saw how powerful she was just now, no one thought that she was this powerful!","No matter how powerful she was, how could she complete a task meant for two people alone?","However...","She really did it!","She really did it.","\"It fell again... Another ten points... Another ten points!\"","\"So fast!\"","\"How can she move left and right and still shoot accurately?\"","\"Ten points again!\"","\"The ninth target has fallen. It’s still ten points.\"","Voices were heard one after another. Everyone was so shocked that they were tongue-tied. They didn’t dare to believe that what they saw was true. But it was true!","Guo Cui clenched her fists tightly; Li Xiushui grabbed Tang Liyin’s arm tightly; the squad leader stared at the figure in front of them; the deputy squad leader’s breathing slowed down, and her gaze was straight.","What about the other female soldiers?","They maintained their stunned expression. Even when Captain Lei came over with several male soldiers, they didn’t notice anything.","The sound of a gun was heard. Captain Lei even said to the male soldiers, \"There are a few female soldiers in the female soldier class who have good shooting skills. Practice with them when you’re free. You’ll definitely complete missions with them in the future.","\"Don’t mention being shy to me. They’re not shy, so why are you shy?!\"","The ears of the male soldiers turned red. They were indeed shy. They needed some time to get used to it.","As they approached the training ground, Small Head asked in confusion, \"Why is there only one person shooting? Where’s the other person?\"","After he finished speaking, his expression changed.","Captain Lei ran over with a straight face. There were supposed to be two people shooting. There was only one person now. Where was the other female soldier? Did something happen because she was accidentally shot by blank cartridges?","It was rare for soldiers to be accidentally injured by their comrades’ blank cartridges during training, but such things did happen. That was why Captain Lei was worried.","After running for a few meters, the gunshots were still dense. There was indeed only one person shooting.","Captain Lei’s eyes lit up. He ran even faster and asked his soldiers to catch up. \"Ye Jian is shooting. Hurry up and catch up!\"","Small Head reacted the fastest and sped forward.","Damn it!","Ye Jian was shooting!","If he didn’t run faster, he would miss the show!","Although the other male soldiers didn’t know why the two were so excited about seeing Ye Jian shoot, they quickly caught up.","When they saw Ye Jian shooting, they regretted not running faster just now!","Bang, bang, bang, bang... Gunshots were fired continuously. Lu Hui, who was quite confident in her shooting, was so agitated that she seemed to have forgotten to breathe. Her cheeks were flushed red. It was a blush of shame.","Her eyes widened as she continued to look at the figure shooting continuously in front of her. When she saw the chest targets on both sides fall, Lu Hui panted heavily. Her heart was in turmoil.","In Ye Jian’s eyes, she must be a clown!","All the female soldiers were clowns in her heart.","Lu Hui, who was blushing, thought silently. She glanced at her side and was not surprised to find that her comrades’ faces were as red as hers. They were all ashamed.","It was all because they had once ostracized Ye Jian. In front of Ye Jian, they told her that with her ability, she wasn’t suitable to stay in the air force. It was better to go back to where she came from so that she wouldn’t lose her life.","Now, when they thought about the past, they were too embarrassed to face anyone."]},{"number":5181,"title":"Chapter 5181: Massive Shock","paragraphs":["Lu Hui heaved a sigh. Just now, she still had the audacity to challenge Ye Jian. She really wanted to slap herself! Where did she get the courage to challenge Ye Jian?","Fortunately, she didn’t tell her comrades that she was confident in beating Ye Jian just now. She didn’t say that her shooting skills could beat Ye Jian either. Fortunately, she endured it, so she saved herself from feeling so ashamed.","It was truly fortunate.","The consecutive gunshots were very concentrated. One person was in charge of two chest targets. The more times Ye Jian pulled the trigger, the more concentrated the gunshots became.","The female soldiers looked at the chest targets that fell one after another. The continuous shock made them lack oxygen. Another chest target fell. Another ten points!","Ye Jian’s shooting was precise and extremely fast... She completed the shooting subject alone, and her shooting speed was twice as fast as theirs!","What did it mean to be twice as fast as them?","It meant Ye Jian could do what they needed to do together by herself! And she was even more outstanding than them!","\"Ten points. 17 targets fell. Ten points for each target. How... How did she do it? How did she do it?\"","It was unbelievable. An unconscious murmur was heard, and the voice wasn’t low. It came from the middle of the team. All the female soldiers, including the squad leader, heard it.","It was Guo Cui’s voice. In the past, only she felt that Ye Jian was a little strange and suspected that she had other motives.","Her feeling was right. In the past, Ye Jian was so stupid that all her comrades thought that Ye Jian was hopeless. That was why Guo Cui felt that something was wrong with Ye Jian!","If she was really so stupid, how could she stay in the military unit?","She should’ve returned to her hometown!","Ye Jian wasn’t stupid. She just had another motive.","The 18th chest target fell... Then the 19th... Then the 20th. Ye Jian completed the first segment with 20 chest targets. She scored ten points for all!","The female soldiers were so shocked that their eyes were wide open. It was as if their souls had been sucked out. Their minds were blank. They had been drained of all their confidence.","How did she do it?","How did Ye Jian do it?","Their only thought was, ’How did Ye Jian do it?’","Applause sounded from their side. Several deep and strong male voices were heard. \"Good! Good! Brilliant!\"","\"Impressive, Ye Jian!\"","\"This is the strength that can crush everyone!\"","\"Ye Jian is even more impressive than you. You didn’t achieve such impressive results alone!\"","Ye Jian had already put away her gun and was running. There was a five-meter high platform in front of her. She needed to climb up the rope. After landing on the high platform, she would shoot from both sides again.","Captain Lei walked in front of the squad leader of the female soldier class. He took the record from the squad leader who was still in shock. He didn’t look at the results of the other female soldiers. He locked onto Ye Jian’s results.","The squad leader’s log sheet had been taken away from her hands. She subconsciously wanted to retrieve it. Only then did she come back to her senses. When she saw who took the log sheet, she immediately restrained her expression. \"Captain.\"","\"Yes, let me take a look.\" Captain Lei, whose gaze had locked onto Ye Jian’s results, didn’t raise his head. He nodded slightly as an answer.","When Captain Lei glanced at Ye Jian’s results, he couldn’t hide the shock in his eyes.","She did better than all the male soldiers in all the subjects!","It looked like the military unit that Ye Jian was going to was not simple. It was probably the same as the Shadow Special Forces of the air force. They were a group of people who were so powerful that others suspected that they were not humans."]},{"number":5182,"title":"Chapter 5182: Too Exciting","paragraphs":["After looking at the results, Captain Lei raised his head and looked at Ye Jian, who had climbed up the high platform agilely. The corners of her lips curled up slightly. Then, she started shooting from both sides. The difficulty was slightly higher than the previous shooting subject.","The chest targets were lined up on both sides of the front section. The shooting distance was the same.","The chest targets in this section were uneven. The distance also varied between far and short. The difficulty was greater than the previous segment.","Captain Lei knew that Ye Jian’s shooting skills were very high.","But to what extent? He didn’t know.","Shooting quickly was also a test of one’s shooting skills. Could Ye Jian get ten points for all like before? He was looking forward to seeing it.","Ye Jian carried her rifle on her back and pulled the climbing rope that allowed her to land smoothly from the five-meter high platform. She turned around swiftly and faced the female soldiers. She pulled the climbing rope tightly and kicked her feet. Her body then disappeared from everyone’s sight. A few seconds later, a slender figure appeared again.","\"She’s here, she’s here!\"","\"Don’t shake my arm. I know she’s here!\" Tang Liyin, who had never moved, looked straight ahead and struggled to free her arm from Li Xiushui’s grip. Li Xiushui was shaking her so much that she couldn’t look carefully.","Guo Cui couldn’t help but tiptoe. She leaned forward slightly and suddenly looked to the side. Lu Hui, who was behind her just now, had already stood beside her.","\"Lu Hui, she’s better than us.\" Afraid that she would miss the excitement, Guo Cui focused her gaze straight ahead. She said in a low voice, \"We all lost.\"","\"I know, but we still have a chance of winning. These are all basic training. The infantries have them too.\" Lu Hui didn’t want to destroy her own morale.","She admitted that Ye Jian was indeed impressive, but Lu Hui wasn’t bad either.","More importantly... Lu Hui couldn’t even bear to blink. She smiled slightly. \"Don’t forget that there’s still technical training. We’re all veterans, but she’s still a new recruit. Hence, we still have a chance of winning.\"","Even so, Lu Hui added, \"Although we still have a chance of winning, she’s indeed powerful. I’m afraid she can learn everything very quickly. She might surpass us one day.\"","Lu Hui still knew her limits.","It was important to know yourself. If you didn’t even know yourself, you were not far from death.","Lu Hui gathered her thoughts and looked at the figure sprinting in front of her with a serious expression. Then, she heard gunshots continuously. The gunshots hit everyone’s hearts, making their hearts pound. They grew panicked and worried. The emotions in their hearts were complicated.","Ye Jian, who was twice as fast as a human, was still focused on training. Even though she was very confident in her shooting skills, she wasn’t arrogant.","One by one, the targets fell to the ground. Ye Jian, who had a sharp gaze, was calm. There were not many fluctuations in her emotions. This was just ordinary training.","The only difference was that she was establishing her dominance.","That’s right, she was establishing her dominance.","Since she was a whittling knife, she naturally had to be extremely sharp. Otherwise, how could she become a knife?","Also, what was the use of keeping a knife that wasn’t sharp?","The 20 chest targets were all shot and fell. The shooting range seemed a little desolate, and the gunshots stopped. Everyone’s slow breathing slowly calmed down. It was too exciting and shocking.","The gun speed was twice as fast as that of a normal soldier. This was the first time they had ever seen it!"]},{"number":5183,"title":"Chapter 5183: Dazzling","paragraphs":["After completing her training, Ye Jian carried her rifle and adjusted her breathing. She ran around the shooting range and back. Before she came back, applause sounded.","Captain Lei clapped and shouted, \"Good! Good! Good!\"","His praise contained his admiration for Ye Jian.","The other male soldiers looked at the figure running over with shining eyes. A special reconnaissance soldier couldn’t help but secretly come up with an idea. \"Boss, we mustn’t let her go!\"","If she was so powerful, how stupid would they be to let her return to the army?","\"Mustn’t let her go? Do you have the final say?\" Captain Lei, who was still clapping hard, glanced at the fellow who had poked him in his sore point. \"Why don’t you give it a try, then?\"","The male soldier touched his nose and scratched the back of his head. After holding it in for a while, he said softly, \"I can give it a try. What if I succeed?\"","\"Sure!\" Captain Lei nodded. However, he couldn’t do it alone. He needed a few more people to do it.","So, he immediately said to the male soldiers beside him who were looking at Ye Jian with bright eyes, \"Just now, Liu Bin said that he wants to have a chat with Ye Jian to ask her to stay in our team. As the saying goes, we should stand united. You guys can take turns to try. You might be able to succeed.\"","\"Sure!\"","\"No problem!\"","\"I’ve been wanting to do this for a long time!\"","\"Captain, leave it to us!\"","A few male soldiers who were clapping so hard that their palms were burning were afraid that Captain Lei would go back on his word. They immediately nodded.","Captain Lei was purely trying to make a Hail Mary effort. He and Commander Kong had brought it up many times, but they had never succeeded. Would these young brats succeed?","That was impossible!","However, it was better to give it a try. What if they did succeed?","The male soldiers were secretly planning to take turns to talk to Ye Jian. Their emotions were a little high. The female soldiers were even more excited than the male soldiers. The male soldiers had already seen how powerful Ye Jian was during the week-long exercise. Seeing her again today was just icing on the cake that allowed them to see Ye Jian’s shooting skills, So, they could still control their emotions.","The female soldiers were different. Before today, Ye Jian was nothing in their hearts. They doubted her and didn’t think she had the right to stay in their military unit.","At this moment, they no longer thought that Ye Jian was really weak and incompetent. If she were weak and incompetent, then they wouldn’t even have the dignity to face the world.","In the past, Ye Jian was as small as a speck of dust in their eyes. Now, Ye Jian was like a towering mountain that made them raise their heads.","\"She’s amazing. She completed two people’s training alone. I don’t think I’ll be able to see another female soldier as powerful as Ye Jian in my life.\"","\"I feel that Ye Jian’s standard is on the same level as Captain Lei and the rest. We can’t compare to her at all.\"","\"In the past, she was really... Guo Cui was right. There was something wrong with Ye Jian in the past.\"","\"It’s too late to say anything now. I already have a strong sense of foreboding. Sisters, I’m afraid our good days are over.\"","This sentence didn’t come from other female soldiers. Instead, it came from Lu Hui’s mouth. It was serious and deep. It made all the female soldiers, including the squad leader and deputy squad leader, tremble.","Were their good days coming to an end...","The squad leader looked at Ye Jian’s results and exchanged glances with the deputy squad leader, who looked up after looking at Ye Jian’s results. They thought about Ye Jian’s schedule for the past half a year and pursed their lips.","Yes, their good days were probably coming to an end."]},{"number":5184,"title":"Chapter 5184: Conquer With Strength","paragraphs":["The ’good days’ that Lu Hui mentioned were definitely different from the ’good days’ that the squad leader and deputy squad leader thought of. However, the essence was still the same.","All in all, with Ye Jian’s performance today, all the female soldiers felt unprecedented pressure.","The female soldier they looked down on in the past had such a huge turn of events. The female soldier who was thought to be useless in the past was actually much stronger than them. As they looked at the figure that was getting closer and closer, the female soldiers felt their faces sting. They didn’t even know where to look. They didn’t dare to look at Ye Jian.","The squad leader, who had been adjusting her emotions, continued to feel emotional as Ye Jian approached. At first, she wanted to hide her loss of composure. However, when she saw Ye Jian’s clear black eyes that reflected the blue sky of the company, the squad leader suddenly felt that all their disguises were transparent to Ye Jian. No matter how they hid it, Ye Jian could still see through them.","The squad leader took a deep breath in front of Ye Jian and told Ye Jian her results. The applause behind them was like thunder.","She flew quickly through the wire netting. She jumped ten saddle horses consecutively and jumped into the two-meter-tall pit. After climbing up, she immediately crawled through the low wire net. She then got up and ran to shoot the chest targets on both sides. After shooting, she immediately climbed up the five-meter high platform and had a successful landing. She shot the chest targets on both sides and then carried the parachute on her back to return to the gathering point. Ye Jian used nine minutes and 47 seconds to complete it.","Previously, Lu Hui’s team was ranked first with 12 minutes and three seconds. Ye Jian was two minutes faster than them. She used the same time as Captain Lei and the rest. She took about ten minutes.","Captain Lei’s requirement for the female soldiers was 12 minutes.","Lu Hui, who had a time of 12 minutes and three seconds, dared to challenge Ye Jian with her gaze because she was already close to excellence and had confidence.","Now, Lu Hui had been humiliated.","Lu Hui and her comrades applauded Ye Jian, who had returned. This was a place where strength spoke for itself. Ye Jian, who had returned, deserved the applause.","The squad leader, who didn’t hide her loss of composure, could face Ye Jian more easily now. She said sincerely, \"Ye Jian, you’re really amazing. You’ve already exceeded the requirement Captain Lei gave us. You’ve given us pressure and motivation. You’ve given us hope too.","\"If male soldiers can do it, female soldiers can do it too. 12 minutes is the standard that Captain Lei set for us. Ten minutes is our goal.\"","The squad leader turned around and faced the female soldiers who were standing upright like steel guns. \"Female soldiers, ten minutes is our goal. Can you reach it?\"","\"Yes! Yes! Yes!\" the soldiers replied in a clear and energetic voice. If the male soldiers could do it, the female soldiers could do it too!","There was a real-life example in front of them. If Ye Jian could do it, they could too!","\"Very good. From today onward, all the training will be increased. Do you agree?\" The squad leader took the opportunity to ask again. Now was the time for morale to be high. She had to seize the opportunity.","\"We agree!\" The clear and orderly voice rang out. There were only 13 people answering, but they were not inferior to thousands of soldiers.","A female soldier wouldn’t admit defeat easily!","A knowing smile appeared in Captain Lei’s eyes when he saw this. All of this started because of Ye Jian. The hope that Commander Kong had was starting to take shape today."]},{"number":5185,"title":"Chapter 5185: Where Are Your Faces?","paragraphs":["As expected, humans needed some stimulation.","Just like Captain Lei and his soldiers, they were shocked by Ye Jian’s terrifying endurance and quickly increased their training.","Now, everyone had gotten used to it and found it more fulfilling. It could be said that Ye Jian played a huge role in the rapid attack on the ’enemy’ command center.","Captain Lei walked in front of the female soldiers who had high morale. He slowly glanced at the female soldiers. \"I won’t say much, but I still have to say what needs to be said.","\"Ye Jian, who came from the army, joined our air force. You didn’t guess wrongly when you thought that she entered through connections. She did join our air force through connections.\"","At this point, Captain Lei deliberately paused. His sharp gaze swept past the female soldiers who usually liked to target Ye Jian. Finally, his gaze landed on Lu Hui. He waved at her. \"Third soldier in the second row, come over here.\"","The third person in the second row, Lu Hui, took a deep breath and stepped out. She stood still and saluted.","Captain Lei asked her, \"I know that you looked down on Ye Jian in the past and always thought that she got in through connections. Now, let me tell you, Ye Jian did get in through connections. Tell me, is she worthy of staying in the air force?\"","Facing Captain Lei’s accusation, Lu Hui would be lying if she said that she wasn’t anxious. However, no matter how anxious she was, she had to answer the question truthfully.","\"Reporting to the captain, in the past, I didn’t know Ye Jian’s strength, so I always thought that she wasn’t worthy. That’s because our special reconnaissance soldiers from the special forces are the combat power of the air force. We’re vanguards in the training competition and training field. Based on Ye Jian’s performance at that time, she wasn’t worthy!\"","She was honest. No wonder no matter how much she targeted Ye Jian, Ye Jian didn’t have any objections to her. She only said that Lu Hui needed to dampen her spirit.","It made people think highly of her.","The sharpness in Captain Lei’s eyes didn’t diminish. He pursed his lips and said coldly, \"As special reconnaissance soldiers, you don’t even have basic acuity. I think you’re just so-so.\"","Lu Hui didn’t accept this criticism.","Hearing this, Lu Hui replied seriously, \"Captain, I can only accept half of your criticism.\"","\"Lu Hui!\" the squad leader shouted in a low voice. Lu Hui was too bold. She even dared to talk back to Captain Lei!","Captain Lei raised his hand. \"Squad leader, let her talk. I want to hear the reason.\"","\"My reason is very simple. First of all, Ye Jian purposely hid her strength and pretended to be weak to mislead us from the start. Captain Lei, you saw it for yourself just now. Ye Jian’s personal strength is far stronger than ours. If she wanted to hide, she could definitely do it.","\"Secondly, we suspected that there was something wrong with Ye Jian. However, you covered for her and eliminated our suspicion of Ye Jian. You and Ye Jian worked together. In addition, you purposely covered for Ye Jian. You didn’t want us to know how strong Ye Jian was. How could we discover that there was something wrong with Ye Jian?","\"So, Captain, we’re indeed not sharp enough, but we’ll never accept criticism that we’re just so-so!\"","Her voice was powerful and fearless. Her courage was commendable.","However, in Captain Lei’s eyes, the things she said were to cover up the fact that she was weak. She wanted to find a reason for her weakness.","Captain Lei glanced at Lu Hui coldly. He looked at all the female soldiers. \"What about the rest of you? Do you guys think the same? Answer me immediately!\""]},{"number":5186,"title":"Chapter 5186: No Why","paragraphs":["The female soldiers didn’t dare to waste any time. They sucked in their stomachs and straightened their backs as they replied loudly.","\"Yes!\"","\"No!\"","The answers were not uniform. Some people agreed with Lu Hui, and her explanation was their explanation. Some people disagreed.","\"If you answered no, step out,\" Captain Lei said loudly. His deep voice was like the muffled thunder that exploded above the snow mountain in winter. It made people shudder.","The male soldiers restrained their expressions and stood at the side. Their gazes were sharp and cold.","This group of female soldiers had some ability. Yes, they had the ability to successfully anger their captain.","When thunder exploded, the snow mountain would collapse. They were going to be unlucky.","Ye Jian had known Captain Lei for half a year. Normally, although Captain Lei was extremely serious toward male soldiers and was ’vicious’ to all the soldiers during training, he didn’t have such a cold expression like today.","Captain Lei was indeed furious today.","\"Ye Jian, come here,\" a male soldier said in a low voice. He was worried that Ye Jian would stand up for the female soldiers.","Ye Jian pursed her lips and shook her head. It was impossible for her to leave the female soldiers behind. However, she wouldn’t stand up and plead for mercy because of this. After half a year of observation, although the female soldiers’ comprehensive ability was not bad, they still had many small problems. For example, Lu Hui’s explanation just now shouldn’t have happened.","A mistake was a mistake. How could there be so many explanations?","On the battlefield, if they let their guard down just because they had defeated the enemy in the previous round, the enemy would end up winning a great victory while they were defeated miserably.","At that time, would a soldier say loudly, \"I don’t admit that we lost. They were defeated by us before and never won. This time, they won. It must be because they deliberately lost to us a few times to mislead us, and that’s why we lost!\"","It was the same. If you lost, you would be in the wrong. How could you blame the other party for hiding their strength?","Lu Hui’s explanation was not an explanation but an evasion.","It was a method to escape responsibility, and she didn’t even realize it.","What was even more shocking was that most of the female soldiers agreed with her explanation.","After they lost, they didn’t admit their mistake immediately. They didn’t even reflect on what happened. Instead, they chose to give excuses. If they weren’t wearing the military uniform and they were outside the military camp, then their explanation might’ve been able to garner some sympathy.","However, this was not the outside world. This was the military camp. There was no explanation for winning or losing. You could only summarize and reflect on your mistakes. Giving excuses would numb yourself. In the end, you would make mistakes again and again and lose completely.","Hence, Ye Jian, who knew the cause of the problem, wouldn’t stand up for them despite Captain Lei’s fury. Captain Lei needed the female soldiers to understand what they had done wrong. Ye Jian would face the problem with the female soldiers and go through the possible punishment with them.","The female soldiers who answered ’no’ stepped out. There weren’t many of them. There were only four of them.","Among them were Guo Cui and Fang Xin, as well as the squad leader and deputy squad leader.","Of the 14 female soldiers, only four answered ’no’, including the squad leader and deputy squad leader. At this moment, Captain Lei admired Commander Kong’s decision.","The strategy of a teacher was not about the immediate benefits but the long-term benefits and long-term development!","\"Why did you answer no?\" Captain Lei looked at Fang Xin. Captain Lei named Fang Xin first because he had all the female soldiers’ information, including their attitude toward Ye Jian.","Fang Xin was a quiet person. She had never directly gone against Ye Jian, but she had never helped Ye Jian either. She had always been on the neutral side. She was a female soldier who had her own opinions and wouldn’t go with the flow."]},{"number":5187,"title":"Chapter 5187: Admitting To Inferiority","paragraphs":["Captain Lei had a good impression of Fang Xin. Although he was neutral, he still had a sense of propriety.","Fang Xin, who was petite and resilient, had a serious expression on her face as she replied loudly, \"There’s no reason!\"","No reason?","The female soldiers who replied ’yes’ frowned slightly.","Captain Lei stared at her for a few seconds before looking at Guo Cui. \"What about you?\"","\"There’s no reason or explanation!\" Guo Cui replied loudly. Her gaze was firm, and she wasn’t worried about her answer.","They couldn’t tell that Ye Jian was hiding her strength, and that was their problem! As special reconnaissance soldiers, they didn’t even have the judgment and sharpness that they should have. What right did they have to come up with an excuse?","They didn’t have the right!","Hearing that, Lu Hui’s expression changed drastically. Right on the heels of that, layers of cold sweat appeared on her back. There was no reason or explanation!","That was right. She didn’t realize that it was her fault. Ye Jian didn’t let them know her true power, but what did it have to do with her?","She made a huge mistake. She had made plenty of huge mistakes!","Cold sweat broke out layer by layer. Lu Hui gritted her teeth, her facial expression turning cold. She raised her voice again. \"Report!\"","\"Speak.\"","\"Captain, your criticism was deserved. I was wrong! I accept your punishment.\" If she was wrong, she was wrong. She had to end her mistake and accept her punishment and criticism. She had to admit that she was inferior to Ye Jian in the face of failure!","At least for now, she was not as good as Ye Jian!","Captain Lei looked at the female soldier who made the most noise and had the most opinions. Then, he looked at Ye Jian, who was still calm despite everything. A smile flashed past Captain Lei’s dark eyes.","The powerful Ye Jian had a good taste in people. Previously, he thought that Lu Hui was narrow-minded, but Ye Jian said that she was willing to take responsibility for what she did. Ye Jian said that Lu Hui was a good candidate to be a top soldier and a vanguard.","From the looks of it, she did have the potential to be the top soldier. The prerequisite was that she needed to be polished.","Lu Hui’s words reminded the female soldiers that they had made a mistake. Their facial expressions were cold. They had made a mistake. They failed to make the discovery, so it was a failure all the same. There was no justifiable explanation.","\"Now, tell me, do you think that you didn’t notice Ye Jian’s disguise because her disguise was too perfect?\"","\"No!\"","\"What’s that?!\" Captain Lei raised his voice. The muffled thunder finally landed on the snow mountain. An avalanche came with a bang, the impact enough to destroy one’s mind.","None of the female soldiers continued to defend themselves in their hearts. They maintained the toughness that a soldier should have and replied loudly, \"There’s no explanation!\"","It was an orderly reply as if they had discussed it together.","They could give such a neat reply as they all agreed that they had made a mistake.","Captain Lei, who was already angry, didn’t calm down because of this. If they were male soldiers, he would’ve kicked them until they sobered up. He wouldn’t just be standing here and talking to them.","\"Then let me tell you what kind of connections Ye Jian has. Commander Kong begged Ye Jian to come! He begged the military and the commander-in-chief of the army. He used a Herculean effort to get Ye Jian, who didn’t plan to transfer to our unit, to come over!","\"She got in through this connection. Which one of you has the ability to make Commander Kong beg for your presence? Tell me, which one of you has this ability?\""]},{"number":5188,"title":"Chapter 5188: She Begged","paragraphs":["What?!","Ye Jian was requested to join the air force by Commander Kong?","Ye Jian didn’t want to come?","She was begged by the commander?","They were already shocked enough before this. Now, the shock was so huge that they almost fainted.","In an instant, everyone’s gaze landed on Ye Jian again. Standing under the bright and clear sunlight, her facial expression was calm. She was neither arrogant nor rash. She stood quietly. She stood with the pride of a pine tree.","She was someone whom Commander Kong had begged for, yet they picked on her and even wanted to kick her out of their unit. If Ye Jian had really been chased away by them, they wouldn’t have been able to bear the consequences.","\"You thought you were great just because you had discovered someone’s weakness. You’re no different from clowns. I feel embarrassed for you.","\"As the squad leader, you didn’t set a good example. You turned a blind eye and thought that everything would be fine as long as things didn’t go overboard. You’re a squad leader, not a blockhead. Do you need me to teach you the importance of your soldiers standing united? Do you need me to tell you how to be a good squad leader?\"","The squad leader, whose face was pale, stood still. Even though she had lost all her dignity from being scolded, she still stood upright. She could not lose her soldier’s integrity.","\"As the deputy squad leader who was also in the same dormitory, you understood that Ye Jian was being ostracized, but you chose to ignore it. Do you think that you’re good enough? Have you fulfilled your responsibility as the deputy squad leader?\"","The deputy squad leader held her breath and replied loudly, \"I didn’t fulfill my responsibility as the deputy squad leader. I accept any punishment!\"","\"Hold it! I’m not done yet!\" Captain Lei snorted. The female soldier who was standing tightened her calves and abdomen. She looked straight ahead, keeping her breathing steady.","They wouldn’t be surprised even if the angry Captain Lei raised his leg to kick them.","Captain Lei, who had always been an iron-blooded soldier, really wanted to kick each of them. However, he kept thinking, ’These are female soldiers.’ That was why he resisted the urge to raise his leg.","Captain Lei didn’t continue standing in one spot. He raised his legs and walked around the female soldiers. His rusty voice hit the female soldiers’ eardrums.","The male soldiers whispered to Ye Jian, \"If it were us, we would’ve been kicked long ago. He wouldn’t have just scolded us. Beating us up till we can’t get out of bed for the next three days would already be him showing mercy.\"","\"They might think that Captain Lei is easy to talk to, but it’s actually because they’re all female soldiers. If they really anger him, I think he’ll beat up the female soldiers too.\"","\"All of them are brainless. They’ll learn their lesson after being beaten up once or twice. They’ll know what to do in the future. You can’t be soft-hearted in the future. They’ll be useless if they don’t train.\"","Ye Jian listened to them one by one without expressing her opinion.","Captain Lei walked out from behind the female soldiers. Since he had already started, he might as well scold them until they learned their lesson.","\"You’re allowed to think that Ye Jian is weak, but what right do you have to decide whether she stays or goes? If you think you can decide whether she stays or goes today, will you think that you have the right to decide whether I, the captain, stays or goes tomorrow?","\"Arrogant, ignorant, selfish, and cold. Yet you think that you’re capable, knowledgeable, united, and friendly. Look at you now. Why don’t you ask yourselves if you have the right to stay in the air force and in our reconnaissance company?","\"Do you think you’re so great? Why don’t you think about how powerful you are in my eyes? Think about it carefully. Don’t think that you can stay here forever just because you’ve entered my place.","\"If I tell you to leave, will you be able to stay? You look down on Ye Jian? Where’s your dignity?\""]},{"number":5189,"title":"Chapter 5189: Deeply Shameful","paragraphs":["Captain Lei walked two rounds and scolded all the female soldiers. He even felt that he had shown mercy. As he stood, his murderous aura made the female soldiers, who were so embarrassed that their faces had turned red, feel like their hearts were about to break.","It was too scary. Captain Lei was really too scary when he was angry!","If he said that they had to leave, then they definitely had to.","\"It’s 11:07 am now. I’ll give you five minutes to pack your backpacks. You’ll run 30 kilometers! Return before 5:00 pm!\"","\"Yes!\"","The squad leader took the lead. She raised her voice and agreed loudly.","Captain Lei didn’t have any expression on his face when he heard the neat and powerful answers. This was his punishment for them. He was already showing them mercy by just giving them a scolding and a light punishment.","Then, he turned to Ye Jian and said in a warm voice, \"Ye Jian, you can train alone or join the male soldiers.\"","\"Captain, I’m a member of the female soldier class. I accept all punishments.\" Ye Jian didn’t accept his arrangement. She chose to complete the 30-kilometer armed run with the female soldiers.","Her choice made the female soldiers purse their lips secretly. They felt even more ashamed.","Ye Jian had always treated herself as a member of the female soldier class. What about them? They felt ashamed of their actions in the past.","Captain Lei didn’t even ask Ye Jian if she wanted to reconsider it. He agreed on the spot, \"Okay!\"","There were only five minutes left. Captain Lei shouted in a low voice, \"Dismissed.\" All the female soldiers ran off, rushing back to the dormitory to pack their backpacks.","Ye Jian’s running speed had always been good. In the blink of an eye, she surpassed the female soldiers.","Guo Cui caught up with Lu Hui, who was chasing after Ye Jian with all her might. She reminded her in a low voice, \"Don’t forget your bet.\"","The bet was that if Ye Jian ever surpassed Lu Hui, Lu Hui would kneel to Ye Jian and apologize. Lu Hui didn’t forget the bet. Panting, she said, \"Don’t worry, I remember it. As long as she really surpasses me, I’ll definitely kneel to apologize.\"","She would definitely not go back on her word!","Guo Cui nodded lightly. \"Let’s apologize to her together.\"","\"There’s no need for that. I’ll take responsibility for my own actions. The bet I made has nothing to do with you. At that time, you even persuaded me. I was the one who didn’t know my limits.\"","Lu Hui wasn’t resentful at all. Guo Cui was relieved.","She was afraid that Lu Hui would get stubborn because of her pride and end up digging a deeper hole for herself.","However, she seemed to have no grievances. She was willing to admit defeat and not lose her integrity.","Looking at the backs of the female soldiers, Captain Lei stood alone for a long time before sighing softly. He hoped that after today, he would be able to see the female soldiers’ transformation.","He hoped that they could carry the hope of Commander Kong and become a real female special forces unit in the military. He hoped that they could carry the responsibility that belonged to them.","The rise of a great country didn’t depend on one person. It depended on thousands of people.","The sun was still shining brightly. The wind blew past the snow mountains and past the rivers that had been flowing for years. It blew away the heat on the female soldiers with a faint coldness.","They were completing the 30-kilometer armed cross-country run. They were willing to accept the punishment. They even felt that this punishment was very light.","The figure in front of them was like a flag guiding them forward. She never stopped. Hence, they gritted their teeth and persevered until they reached the end.","The battle had begun.","For the first five kilometers, Ye Jian, the squad leader, and the deputy squad leader were together. The three of them talked about some things as they walked. Their focus was on the future training. From today onward, Ye Jian would strengthen the basic training of the female soldiers. The squad leader and the deputy squad leader would strengthen the female soldiers’ technical training."]},{"number":5190,"title":"Chapter 5190: Kneel And Apologize","paragraphs":["The squad leader and deputy squad leader were elated. The basic training of the army and the air force was the same. So, Ye Jian would strengthen the basic training of the female soldiers. This was the best arrangement.","Then, Ye Jian told the two of them that from tomorrow onward, the female soldiers would no longer train alone. Instead, they would train with the male soldiers. The female soldiers also needed to complete the training that the male soldiers needed to complete.","In other words, from tomorrow onward, all the female soldiers would officially enter the special reconnaissance training. Their good days would end completely.","After the first five kilometers, the three of them split up. Ye Jian took the lead.","The tenth kilometer was completed... Then, the 15th kilometer was completed. After reaching the midway point, it was time to rest. Ye Jian turned around and looked at the female soldiers who were walking slower and slower. She stopped in her tracks and picked up a rock that was slightly flat.","If she continued walking, the female soldiers would definitely grit their teeth and follow her closely. They wouldn’t let themselves lose again.","Looking at the time it took to complete the 15 kilometers, Ye Jian smiled slightly. Not bad. She looked up at the female soldiers who had stopped and were looking to sit down. They were very tired and had used up a lot of energy. However, they still sat upright and didn’t look tired. It could be seen that their stamina was very good.","Not bad. If they trained harder, they would see loads of improvement.","The female soldiers who sat down actually wanted to sit next to Ye Jian. However, when they thought about what they had done to her in the past, they felt too embarrassed to go over. In the end, Lu Hui was the first to walk toward Ye Jian. Guo Cui followed her.","Ye Jian looked at the two people walking over and smiled slightly, instantly blowing away the nervousness in Guo Cui’s heart.","She pursed her lips and smiled at Ye Jian. Then, she quickened her pace.","Lu Hui ran even faster. She had something serious to say to Lieutenant Ye!","\"Are you tired?\" Ye Jian didn’t get up as she asked the two people who were getting closer and closer to her. \"You only have five minutes to rest. I suggest that the two of you take this time to sit down and rest for a while.\"","There was only a five-minute break?","Didn’t they have ten minutes of break in the past?","The two people who received the news didn’t ask because that was in the past.","Lu Hui sat down and looked at Ye Jian seriously. \"Lieutenant Ye, do you still remember our bet? I said that if you surpassed me one day, I’d definitely kneel and admit my mistake.","\"I might be annoying, but I’ll never regret what I say, let alone break my promise. In the past, I targeted you and ostracized you, but I don’t regret it. It’s the same with the bet I made. I won’t break my promise. I’ll wait for you to surpass me.\"","Wait for Ye Jian to surpass her? Ye Jian smiled playfully. \"Aren’t you afraid that I’ve already surpassed you?\"","\"I’m not afraid. If you’ve already surpassed me, I’ll kneel and apologize to you now. But you’ve only surpassed me in basic training. We’re in the air force. There is a lot of technical training. I don’t believe that you’ve surpassed me completely.\"","Lu Hui was very confident in herself.","Ye Jian smiled, but she felt a little embarrassed. Lu Hui might really have to kneel to her and admit her mistake, then.","\"You don’t believe that I’ve surpassed you? That’s alright. You’ve been an airborne soldier for two and a half years, while I’ve only been here for half a year. It’s indeed difficult for me to surpass you. It looks like I have to work hard and surpass you as soon as possible.\"","\"You can work hard, and I will work hard too. A soldier will never admit defeat easily!\" Lu Hui had a serious expression on her face. The unwillingness to admit defeat in her eyes made Ye Jian purse her lips and smile.","Lu Hui had a sharp tongue, but it was undeniable that she was outstanding.","\"In that case, let’s work hard together.\" Ye Jian smiled.","Her smile was brighter than the sun, but it made Lu Hui shiver. Why did she feel that something was wrong?"]},{"number":5191,"title":"Chapter 5191: Catch A Big Fish","paragraphs":["Lu Hui felt that something was wrong. Guo Cui, who was beside her, looked at Ye Jian and then at Lu Hui. She couldn’t help but narrow her eyes. She also felt that something was wrong, but she couldn’t point her finger on it.","Lu Hui, who felt that something was wrong, tried her best to catch up to Ye Jian after the break. She looked at Ye Jian, who was walking at the front. Then, she frowned and thought hard. Her attention wasn’t on the armed cross-country. Unknowingly, she surpassed several comrades with better stamina than her.","Guo Cui’s endurance was better than Lu Hui’s. In the past, when the two of them were tired, they would help each other to the finish line. This time, Guo Cui had to chase after Lu Hui.","She called out to her a few times. Seeing that there was no response, Guo Cui gritted her teeth and ran after her.","It wasn’t easy for her to catch up to Lu Hui. When she reached, she saw Lu Hui frowning. It was obvious that she was thinking about something.","Guo Cui, who was breathing heavily, asked her, \"What’s wrong? You’ve been in a daze the entire time. What are you thinking about? Did you encounter a problem again?\"","\"Yes, I’ve encountered a problem.\" Lu Hui thought for a moment and looked at the figure in front of her. She frowned as she asked Guo Cui, \"When we were resting, I said that I’d definitely work hard to not let Lieutenant Ye surpass me. Lieutenant Ye said that she would work hard to surpass me too. What was Lieutenant Ye’s expression then?","\"If I remember correctly, she seemed quite confident at that time.\"","Guo Cui thought for a moment and nodded. \"Yes, she appeared very confident. What’s the matter? Is there a problem with her being confident? The current Lieutenant Ye must be confident. No, she has always been confident. What we’re seeing now is the real Lieutenant Ye.\"","\"No, what I mean is... don’t you think that Lieutenant Ye is too confident? So confident that... it’s like she has already surpassed me.\" As she spoke, Lu Hui’s expression became more and more serious. Even her pace slowed down. She was lost in her thoughts again.","Seeing this, Guo Cui didn’t disturb her. Lu Hui was known in the female soldier class to have an analytical brain. She was able to think of things that other people wouldn’t think of for a while.","She felt that something was wrong, which meant that something was indeed wrong. Lieutenant Ye was very confident when they were talking. There was an indescribable feeling in her faint smile. It was a little...","That was right!","Guo Cui’s eyes suddenly lit up. At that time, Lieutenant Ye seemed to be fishing for a big fish. And Lu Hui was the big fish she wanted to catch!","\"She was fishing for a big fish. Don’t you think that we’re all big fish that Lieutenant Ye is preparing to catch?\" Guo Cui asked. Lu Hui, who was still thinking, suddenly turned to look at her with widened eyes.","After a while, Lu Hui nodded vigorously. \"That’s right, that’s right. That’s the feeling! At that time, I felt that something was wrong!","\"You, you, you... Guo Cui, you, you... You said that Lieutenant Ye. No, no... Don’t tell me she has already surpassed me!\"","\"That’s impossible!\" Guo Cui replied firmly. She shook her head and said quickly, \"No matter how powerful Lieutenant Ye is, she has always been in the army. It has only been half a year since she was transferred to the air force. No matter how powerful she is... How can she surpass us in just half a year?","\"Don’t forget that Lieutenant Ye hasn’t put in much effort in the training for the past half a year.\"","What Guo Cui said made sense. After thinking for a while, Lu Hui nodded. \"That’s true. I’ve been an airborne soldier for two and a half years. Lieutenant Ye has only been in the air force for half a year... I’m just overthinking it.\"","Guo Cui, who had always been meticulous, felt that Lu Hui was thinking too much as well."]},{"number":5192,"title":"Chapter 5192: Swift And Decisive","paragraphs":["How could Lieutenant Ye, who had only been in the air force for more than half a year, surpass Lu Hui, who came from the Aerial 18th Division? Even Guo Cui, who discovered that Ye Jian was a little strange at the start, felt that Lu Hui was too agitated today. She was thinking too much.","It was impossible.","Lieutenant Ye usually didn’t do well during their training. How could she surpass them?","\"Forget it, let’s not think about it anymore! Let’s walk faster. My legs are stiff, and every step is tiring.\" Lu Hui’s footsteps got slower and slower. Her breathing got heavier as well. At this moment, she felt that all her stamina was exhausted.","She was so tired!","It was definitely not a problem for her to carry light equipment for 30 kilometers. It would not be a problem for her to carry double that. But running 30 kilometers armed overwhelmed her.","\"You’re much faster than usual. I thought you weren’t tired.\" Guo Cui, who was already tired, was panting so hard that she felt as though there was a rock in her throat. She was out of breath. She held Lu Hui’s arm, and the two of them supported each other as they walked forward.","The team didn’t pull too far away. Whoever didn’t have the strength to continue walking would receive help. They helped each other and tried their best to catch up with the figure in front of them. Their eyes were filled with admiration.","Lieutenant Ye, whom Commander Kong had begged to get into the airborne unit, was really extraordinary. They were all extremely tired, but she was still able to maintain her speed. She didn’t need any help and advanced steadily. After making the comparison, the other soldiers were very ashamed.","At around 4:40 pm, Ye Jian, who had completed the 30-kilometer cross-country run, appeared in front of the sentinels of the military unit. Right on the heels of that, the female soldiers who were so tired that they didn’t even have the energy to take another step gradually appeared in front of the sentinels as well. Ye Jian still stood tall while the rest staggered. One look and you could tell that the others were exhausted.","Captain Lei had instructed the sentinels to inform him if they saw the female soldiers returning to the team. Very soon, Captain Lei knew that the female soldiers had returned. He smiled as he said to Commander Kong, \"Commander, you have good foresight. Look, even their speed is much faster than before.\"","Commander Kong, who was in charge of the exercise, gave a report on it before returning to the southwest. He did not go directly back to the division headquarters but came directly to look for Captain Lei, mainly wanting to talk to Ye Jian.","After knowing that Ye Jian had already made a move today and stunned the female soldiers, Commander Kong laughed loudly and said, \"That’s how it should be. We must act when we should. We can’t be afraid of the wolves and the tigers. Dilly-dallying is not our style as soldiers. I like and admire Little Ye’s behavior.\"","In the end, Commander Kong was still quite proud of his foresight. He said to Captain Lei, \"I’ve always been an accurate judge of character. I knew Little Ye’s character the moment I saw her. You doubted my decision previously. Come, tell me, was my decision wrong?\"","The division commander needed to be coaxed, so Captain Lei hurriedly coaxed him. He gave him a thumbs-up first before coaxing him, \"You’re amazing. As expected of the division commander! Impressive! Admirable!\"","\"How would I have been able to turn you guys into the elite troops you are now if I wasn’t so powerful? I’m going to take a nap now. Tell me when Ye Jian gets back to the team.\"","Commander Kong, who didn’t have a good rest during the exercise, yawned and pulled out a chair. He sat down and placed his legs casually. Then, he leaned against the chair and fell asleep.","Captain Lei didn’t wake Commander Kong up until Ye Jian came back.","Ye Jian didn’t know that Commander Kong had arrived. She was waiting for all the female soldiers to arrive at the military unit. Eight of them had arrived, and there were still nine minutes before 5:00 pm.","At 4:50 pm, two people arrived. At 4:55 pm, two more people arrived. At 4:58 pm, the last two people arrived. Before 5:00 pm, all 15 female soldiers arrived and successfully completed the 30-kilometer armed cross-country run.","Up front, Commander Kong looked at the time. A faint smile appeared in his serious eyes."]},{"number":5193,"title":"Chapter 5193: Strength","paragraphs":["The female soldiers who had returned to the team gathered and panted heavily. Their bodies were already tired, but they were excited. Their faces were drenched in sweat and flushed red, but their eyes were as bright as stars.","Captain Lei had told them to return to the brigade before 5:00 pm, and they had really done it!","The last time, they went on a 20-kilometer armed cross-country run, and they returned later than the group that went on a 30-kilometer armed cross-country run. This time, they took a shorter time than before!","The squad leader was very happy too. She smiled and praised all the female soldiers before praising Ye Jian. She knew that if Ye Jian hadn’t walked in front, it would’ve been difficult for them to return on time.","Dozens of gazes landed on the first figure in the first row in front. The female soldiers no longer looked down on her like before. They didn’t dare to do it now! They didn’t know how capable she was before this.","The squad leader who praised Ye Jian felt a little guilty. Ye Jian’s qualifications, military rank, position, and ability were higher than hers. Ye Jian should be the squad leader.","Ye Jian didn’t know what the squad leader was thinking. She saw Commander Kong standing not far away with Captain Lei accompanying him.","The female soldiers, who were in a happy state, didn’t notice them. However, after the squad leader dismissed them, they glanced at the direction where Captain Lei was standing. He was smiling at Ye Jian. \"The captain probably has something to tell you. Pass me your backpack and I’ll bring it back to the dormitory.\"","\"Thank you, squad leader!\" Ye Jian didn’t stand on ceremony and passed the backpack over. Her voice was clear and clean. It was like a cold summer breeze brushing past the squad leader’s ears. There was no trace of fatigue in her voice.","The squad leader took the heavy backpack. The corners of her lips curled up even more. \"Why are you being so polite? You can go over first. I’m leaving.\"","Commander Kong was beside Captain Lei. The commander didn’t walk over. He just stood not far away and watched, so the squad leader thought that the commander was looking for Ye Jian. There was no need for her to follow Ye Jian. She needed to be smart.","It was not until the squad leader left that Commander Kong strode over. Ye Jian strode over too. How could she stand there and wait for the commander to come over? That would be impolite.","\"Little Ye, you did a good job this time! I admire you very much. Unfortunately, I missed your exciting performance in the morning. If there’s a chance next time, I must take a good look.\" Commander Kong, who admired Ye Jian very much, was full of words. Which commander didn’t like a soldier as sharp as a knife?","Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief when she heard Commander Kong’s approval. She didn’t come to the air force just for these female soldiers. She came here for herself too.","She wanted to learn more skills. She wanted to learn more and understand more. At the end of this, the biggest winner was actually herself. If Commander Kong was satisfied, she could continue staying. If Commander Kong was not satisfied, she would be letting him down. She wouldn’t be able to give herself an explanation if that were to happen.","Ye Jian looked much more relaxed now and smiled slightly. \"I’ve been in the air force for more than half a year. It’s time for me to show results. I’ll feel uneasy if I continue to waste any more resources.\"","Half a year ago, in order to disguise herself, she purposely made mistakes here and there. The female soldiers hated her, and she felt that she was very annoying as well.","Now, she could finally end all her pretense and learn properly. Just thinking about it made her feel good.","Thinking that she would be able to learn more in the future, Ye Jian couldn’t help but smile. Her smile was like the sunlight that flowed across the river—clear and energetic."]},{"number":5194,"title":"Chapter 5194: Soldier Life","paragraphs":["There was a hint of relief in Ye Jian’s black eyes that even she didn’t notice. Commander Kong, who caught it, sighed softly in his heart. He was deeply apologetic to Ye Jian for suffering grievances in the past half a year.","\"I’ve made you suffer grievances for the first half a year. Little Ye, I’m deeply sorry about this. I have to apologize to you. You’ve suffered, Little Ye!\"","After Commander Kong finished speaking, he saluted Ye Jian as a division commander.","She was ostracized, looked down on, and reprimanded when she was clearly a top soldier who was loved by her comrades. Because of his request, she came to the air force. However, she was neglected like never before. If she were a little weaker, she would’ve left long ago. She wouldn’t have stayed here to be bullied.","She had been persevering and wasn’t affected by the female soldiers. She gritted her teeth and fought bravely. Captain Lei would even lament her situation. As a female soldier, Ye Jian’s tenacity was stronger than their male soldiers. Her improvement was astonishing.","Ye Jian was a special forces soldier in the army and was about to become a special forces soldier in the air force. She also had special training from the maritime and land forces. This female soldier was the number one special forces soldier!","Ye Jian was shocked. She retracted the smile on her face and returned a solemn soldier’s salute. \"Commander, I don’t feel any grievances. On the contrary, I’m very grateful to you for giving me a chance to join the air force and satisfy my curiosity. Commander, I’m the one who should be thanking you.","\"Thank you for giving me this rare opportunity!\"","It was indeed a rare opportunity. Since she had decided to enter the air force, she should cherish the opportunity. She didn’t feel wronged.","Everything she experienced, even being looked down on, was something to show in her military career.","Her cheerfulness made Commander Kong value her even more. She was open-minded, neither arrogant nor rash, and could take on a huge responsibility. He didn’t know which special forces she would go to in the end, but they were really enviable.","They chatted for half an hour or so as they walked. Commander Kong asked Ye Jian if she had any suggestions regarding the training plan that Captain Lei came up with. After discussing for half an hour or so, Commander Kong, who still had something to deal with at the division headquarters, left in a car without having dinner.","After sending Commander Kong off, Captain Lei said to Ye Jian, \"We’ll start the training tonight. We’ll first let the male soldiers practice with them for half a month to find out the weaknesses of the female soldiers. Then, we’ll combine their weaknesses and form a training plan that focuses on strengthening them.","\"We have to extend the time appropriately, the training has to be increased accordingly, and the difficulty has to gradually increase as well. I’ll have to trouble you with the female soldiers. You can stimulate them to bring out their best potential.\"","Ye Jian cooperated with Captain Lei’s arrangements. She was in charge of stimulating the female soldiers to work hard. Captain Lei was in charge of strengthening the training. The squad leader would restrain all the female soldiers. They had to cooperate well, so that they could do well both individually and in a team. They were both ace female soldiers and ace soldiers. This was what Commander Kong hoped for.","When they gathered at night, the female soldiers saw the male soldiers running over in an orderly manner. In the end, they stopped opposite them and stood at attention like pillars. Then, they looked at Captain Lei, who was standing in the middle like a demon. They had a bad feeling.","The squad leader retreated to the empty seat beside Ye Jian. Captain Lei faced the female soldiers and said in a low voice, \"From tonight onward, the female soldiers and male soldiers will go through training together. The female soldiers will follow suit, and we’ll keep track of your daily training results.\""]},{"number":5195,"title":"Chapter 5195: Taste","paragraphs":["The wind at night was tainted with the chill of autumn. The cold wind in the southwest came earlier than other places. It was snowing in some places. Although it wasn’t snowing at the border between Tibet and Sichuan, the cold temperature at night was obvious.","The female soldiers, who were standing in the night and enjoying the cold night wind, straightened their backs and listened to Captain Lei’s announcement of the training plan with stern facial expressions. After the first training plan was announced, the female soldiers’ hearts sank. Then, the second training plan was announced. The female soldiers secretly clenched their fists.","When the third training plan was announced, the female soldiers calmed down and accepted the increasingly cruel training.","This was because they knew that from tonight onward, they would truly join the air force’s Special Reconnaissance Brigade. It wouldn’t be like in the past, where the squad leader would take the lead in their training. Tonight, things would change!","\"Everyone with bad results will have an extra hour of training at night. They’ll also wake up half an hour early in the morning and run in the morning. Do you understand?\"","\"Understood!\" In the smoky night, the female soldiers raised their chins slightly and replied to Captain Lei loudly. Their voices were full of energy and penetrating.","\"Do you really understand?\" Captain Lei asked in return. He seemed a little suspicious.","The female soldiers’ expressions turned cold. They replied in an even more imposing voice, \"We understand!\"","They wouldn’t allow themselves to be suspected. If they were suspected, they would be looked down on. Female soldiers were soldiers too. They wouldn’t be looked down on by male soldiers!","In return, Captain Lei sneered coldly. He still doubted whether the female soldiers really understood. Then, he looked at them with a hint of ’contempt’. The female soldiers felt suffocated, but they couldn’t fight with the male soldiers now.","\"Ye Jian, do you think they understand?\" Captain Lei smiled and asked Ye Jian. He ignored the other female soldiers.","The whittling knife called ’Ye Jian’ shouted, \"Yes! Bleeding and breaking bones is a small matter. We won’t cry because of it!\"","Captain Lei nodded in satisfaction this time. He asked the female soldiers, \"Do you understand?\"","Only then did the female soldiers understand what Captain Lei meant. They had misunderstood.","\"Understood! Bleeding and breaking bones is a small matter! We won’t cry because of it!\" This time, they really understood!","\"Your voice is loud and your aura is strong. I just don’t know if you can really do it.\" Captain Lei was still not satisfied. He turned around and faced the male team. His fierce and murderous voice was like an ancient sword that tore through the air with majestic danger. \"Male soldiers!\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Tonight, give them a taste of how good it feels to bleed and not cry!\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Take it, female soldiers who understand.\" After Captain Lei finished speaking, he retreated from the middle and stepped outside. He whistled. \"Begin!\"","More than 40 male soldiers shouted at the same time. They rushed toward the female soldiers like waves hitting the shore.","Although the female soldiers selected from the various air force units were all strong and had fought with male soldiers, it had always been one-on-one. They had never experienced one against three.","In addition, the male soldiers were aggressive. Even the air seemed to be stained with the smell of blood. All of them couldn’t help but take a step back. If Ye Jian hadn’t stopped them with her cold voice, they might have retreated.","\"Do you want to retreat without a fight? Go forward!\" The cold voice tore through the fear of the female soldiers, making them unable to retreat. They shouted loudly and clenched their fists. They rushed out earlier than the male soldiers and took the initiative to fight them."]},{"number":5196,"title":"Chapter 5196: Fight","paragraphs":["The two sides fought. The muffled sounds of hand-to-hand combat could be heard. One could even hear the sound of bones hitting something hard. It was easy to think that bones were being broken.","The male soldiers formed groups of three. They cooperated well and kept attacking the female soldiers. The female soldiers who were attacked fought with their fists, legs, and knees. They fought and retaliated.","Actually, they were already very tired. 30 kilometers of armed cross-country during the day had exhausted too much of their strength. Although they had a short rest, their legs were still sore. Every time they raised their legs and swept out, their calves would be so tense that they felt as though their muscles were about to break. Tired, sore, and painful were the current situation of the female soldiers.","On top of that, the female soldiers had a taste of being beaten up and bleeding.","Lu Hui was pressed down by a male soldier’s iron palms. She could feel the searing pain on her face.","She didn’t admit defeat, however. She was still trying her best to resist when someone suddenly kicked her calf. The pain didn’t let her catch her breath before the second kick came right on the heels of that. This time, it landed on her thigh. After two consecutive heavy blows, her tears flowed out uncontrollably.","Bleeding without crying was easy to say but difficult to do.","Captain Lei had asked the female soldiers if they understood. He asked if they were ready, if they understood how tough and cruel it would be.","Now, they understood that it hurt. It really hurt!","It was so painful that Lu Hui wondered if she was about to faint. She would never admit defeat, though. She squeezed her voice out of her chest. She realized that it was a very deep sound. Her slender body was like a snake that had turned over. She arched her back, raised her right arm, and hit the male soldier who was pressing her down.","So what if it was one against three? As long as she wasn’t killed, she could still continue fighting. It was either she died or they died. This was the cruelty of the battlefield. As soldiers, they had to understand it!","Guo Cui’s lower abdomen was kicked by a male soldier. It was probably the diaphragm of her abdomen. The pain came, and her vision turned black. When she was slightly distracted, a black shadow flew over. With a bang, the male soldier’s instep hit her face hard. The force was so great that she fell to the ground.","There was no time for her to scream in pain after she fell to the ground. A strong wind blew from the sky. Guo Cui was shocked and immediately rolled on the ground, narrowly avoiding the kick.","Her reaction was fast enough. The male soldiers who split up to attack couldn’t help but exclaim in a low voice. One of the male soldiers said coldly, \"Interesting. But even if you can dodge once, can you dodge a second time?\"","The second time, Guo Cui didn’t avoid it. Her calves, thighs, back, and even her butt were kicked by the male soldiers. At that moment, Guo Cui thought that she was really done for.","After confirming that Guo Cui was unable to resist, the three male soldiers retracted their legs and moved to their next target.","Unfortunately, they turned their attention to Ye Jian, who was fighting the most fiercely. She didn’t suffer at all. Instead, the male soldiers were the ones in pain.","Ye Jian was not afraid of the several people attacking her at once. She had experienced getting ganged up on in the Xueyu unit. What was there to be afraid of? If they were cruel, she would be crueler than them. Whoever made her feel pain, she would cause them more pain.","Ye Jian, who had learned how to take down the enemy in one move, turned to the male soldier who had been playing sneak attacks behind her. \"Brother, you kicked me three times just now. I have to collect double the interest.\"","The other female soldiers couldn’t handle it, but she still had time to chat."]},{"number":5197,"title":"Chapter 5197: Fight","paragraphs":["The male soldier who was being targeted didn’t want to talk to Ye Jian at all. He didn’t have the urge to talk to her at all. He only had the urge to fight her properly. He looked at his comrade who was knocked down and was clutching his stomach as he got up with trembling legs. The male soldier gritted his teeth and stopped launching secret attacks. He changed to attacking openly.","As a special reconnaissance soldier, he loved carrying out sneak attacks. If he were to attack openly, he might have to fight until his back was against the wall. That was also a battle to see if he could survive. Hence, once special reconnaissance soldiers attacked openly, every move was a killing move.","Ye Jian was brutal, and the male soldier was fierce. The two sides fought in the widest area in the entire combat circle. If they didn’t leave some space, they were really worried that they would injure themselves.","Guo Cui, who was in so much pain that not a single part of her body was fine, sat up with both hands. Then, she slowly stood up with the support of one hand. She couldn’t straighten her back immediately when she stood up. It hurt. She needed to take it slow.","The muscles in the area where she was in pain were pulled. It was so painful that Guo Cui gasped a few times. Her face was pale from the pain. The cold sweat from the pain wet the hair on her forehead. She was in a sorry state.","Guo Cui, who couldn’t even straighten her back, held her abdomen and raised her head to look around. What she saw made her heart ache. There weren’t many female soldiers who could withstand it anymore. She could recognize the female soldiers who were still propping up their bodies. There were the squad leader, the deputy squad leader, Lu Hui, Fang Xin, Wu Pingping, and Xiao Yalin. The other comrades were like her. They were all attacked by the male soldiers until they couldn’t retaliate.","No, where was Ye Jian? Where did she go?","Guo Cui, who couldn’t find Ye Jian immediately, panicked. Could it be that even she was defeated? She glanced around, and her pupils suddenly constricted. She saw the figure she was looking for.","One against three became one against five.","Five male soldiers were going against Lieutenant Ye. This was unfair! Too unfair!","Guo Cui gritted her teeth and looked for Captain Lei. She wanted to look for him and tell him that one against three was already unfair. Now, it was one against five. No matter how powerful Lieutenant Ye was, could she win?","The male soldiers weren’t ordinary male soldiers. They were all special forces soldiers from the air force. It was difficult to win against them in a one-on-one battle. Whether it was one against three or one against five, all the female soldiers could only be beaten up.","Guo Cui took a deep breath and tried her best to forget the pain. She found Captain Lei and staggered over. The stubbornness in her eyes was like a lamp. Her eyes looked so bright in the dark that it was a little scary.","Captain Lei keenly felt that someone was staring at him. He retracted his gaze that had been on Ye Jian. He turned his gaze slightly and locked onto the person staring at him.","Looking at her pace, she looked like an old lady. She must be in pain from the beating. Did she cry?","Had she had enough of the taste of bleeding and not crying? She didn’t want to endure it again?","If she didn’t want to experience this a second time, she would work hard.","Ye Jian used her arm to push away the arm of a male soldier who was clenching his fist. She moved her feet deftly and dodged the fist that was sneak attacking from the right. She took a few steps back. The back of her head seemed to have eyes. She clamped the strong leg that was placed horizontally on the side of her head and gripped the male soldier’s ankle. Then, she pulled it forward.","Ye Jian, who had a sharp gaze, gave the coldest smile. She pressed her right elbow hard and knocked it against the male soldier’s leg.","Ye Jian relaxed her hands. The male soldier behind her retracted his right leg that was trembling in pain. He touched the ground with his toes tentatively, but before he could fully exert his strength, his face changed in shock as he suddenly pulled back his right foot and flexed it tightly."]},{"number":5198,"title":"Chapter 5198: Learn From Her","paragraphs":["It was too damn painful! It was so painful that he couldn’t put his foot on the ground. He could only stand on one leg.","He could only withdraw. If he continued to fight, he wouldn’t be able to stand normally after this.","Captain Lei pointed at Ye Jian, who was still able to retaliate. He questioned the female soldier who told him that it was unfair, \"Did you see that? If you have the time to stand here and question me about how it’s unfair for it to be one against three or one against five, why don’t you go and see how Ye Jian, whom you looked down on in the past, is invincible?","\"She didn’t tell me it was unfair in a one-on-five situation. How can you, a loser who lost after fighting for less than 15 minutes and don’t even have the strength to fight back, be qualified to stand here and complain to me?","\"The right to speak and make decisions is in my hands. Do I need to explain to you what I have you do?\"","In the past, although Captain Lei was cold when he spoke to the female soldiers, he always knew his limits. He cared about the female soldiers’ dignity. They had to be allowed to adapt to the new environment.","New recruits would undergo three months of training, and veterans like them had been given half a year to adapt to their new surroundings. They had already been treated well enough. From now on, if a female soldier made a mistake, she would be treated equally as a male soldier!","If they couldn’t stand it, they could leave.","Guo Cui’s face turned pale as she bit her lower lip. The stubbornness in her eyes turned into a sharp gaze. She turned her head and slowly said with determination in her eyes, \"The decision is in your hands. I’ll definitely fight for the right to speak.\"","She was a stubborn person too. Not bad. She should continue to maintain it.","A hint of a smile flashed past the depths of Captain Lei’s eyes. With a straight face, he replied coldly, \"Talk to me after you get the right to speak.\"","As he spoke, his cold and hard eyes suddenly froze. Guo Cui saw this and hurriedly looked over.","She saw the male soldiers who were attacking from the back raising their legs and kicking Ye Jian continuously. Besides her head, every part of her body was the focus of their attacks.","Her heart was in her throat. Her hand, which had been holding her abdomen to suppress the pain, unknowingly loosened into a fist. ’Ye Jian, knock them all down! Bring them all down!’","Forgetting the pain all over her body, Guo Cui clenched her fists and cheered for Ye Jian in her heart.","Ye Jian chose to knock them down one by one. Her combat skills had always been good. In addition, she was agile and reacted quickly. Her speed of dodging was quite fast too. Although she was hit by male soldiers, it didn’t affect her movements. After 20 minutes, Ye Jian became the last female soldier who didn’t get knocked down. She even knocked down three male soldiers.","The sneak attacks from behind continued. A male soldier raised his leg and kicked Ye Jian’s head again. It was very likely that she would have a concussion.","Not only did the male soldier’s kick make Guo Cui’s heart jump to her throat, but even Captain Lei shook his hands slightly. Ye Jian was being attacked from all directions. The probability of her getting hit was very high.","A cold look flashed past Ye Jian’s eyes. She quickly moved to the left. Her hands, which were blocking the attack, suddenly moved to the right to counter-attack. The back of her head seemed to have eyes. She hugged the leg that was kicking her head... Guo Cui was so nervous that she stopped breathing. Ye Jian actually... restrained the male soldier’s right leg!","Just now, she really thought that Ye Jian wouldn’t be able to avoid it and would be kicked in the head by the male soldiers like her. Her brain ended up buzzing, and her vision turned black. In an instant, she lost the chance to retaliate and was beaten up by the male soldiers.","Ye Jian didn’t share the same fate. She avoided it and even restrained the male soldier’s leg. She, she... she could still attack!"]},{"number":5199,"title":"Chapter 5199: Impressive","paragraphs":["Guo Cui was very excited when she saw the light in Ye Jian’s eyes. She saw Ye Jian hugging the male soldier’s right leg tightly and quickly bending her body like a shrimp. Her reaction was really fast. Someone like Guo Cui wouldn’t have been able to avoid it at all!","Captain Lei widened his eyes. He was waiting to see how Ye Jian would retaliate!","Ye Jian, who was hunched like a shrimp, was actually very fast. Captain Lei, Guo Cui, and the rest could still see how she dodged and retaliated, but ordinary people wouldn’t have been able to make out her movements at all. Even if they recorded it, they would have to replay it three times slower to see Ye Jian’s retaliation.","It only took two seconds for her to bend her body like a shrimp and then suddenly stand upside down, with her head down and feet up. She hooked her legs back and used her calves as a weapon to clamp the male soldier’s neck and head. With a cold shout, Ye Jian made a very beautiful counter-attack, clamping the male soldier above the neck with her calves. She then knocked him to the ground, but she took the opportunity to stand still.","This move was quite impressive!","\"Oh my god, what kind of move is that? Why didn’t she fall along with him?\"","Captain Lei and Guo Cui weren’t the only ones staring at Ye Jian. There was also a group of male soldiers who were focused on her. Ye Jian knocked down their male comrade and somehow managed to stand still on her own. The male soldiers didn’t see how she did it.","No matter how they looked at it, they felt that Ye Jian should’ve fallen together.","\"Quick, let’s try!\"","This was the first time they saw such a move. The male soldiers decided to test it themselves. Ye Jian’s speed was too fast, and they didn’t even see her actions clearly. They could only try it themselves.","One male soldier stood up straight while the other male soldier did a handstand. First, he hugged his comrade’s legs with one hand. Then, he hugged them with both hands. He hooked his legs around his comrade’s neck and head and tried to squeeze down.","With a thud, the two of them fell together.","After one try, they knew that it was quite difficult.","The greater the difficulty, the more challenging it was. If they failed the first time, they would try again.","\"Come again! Let’s try with another person. Plum, come here. You’re weaker.\"","Li Zi, who was called out, said, \"I’m flexible.\" Then, he walked over and gave it a try.","The male soldier, whose nickname was ’Plum’, wiped his sweat and said in a low voice, \"It’s very difficult for ordinary people to complete such a difficult technical move. We have to seek guidance from Ye Jian.\"","Even Plum, the most flexible person in the company, couldn’t do it. They could only look for Ye Jian to ask her about it.","At this moment, they didn’t care if their comrades who were knocked down by Ye Jian were in pain anymore. All of them watched with relish. From time to time, they would click their tongues and sigh. They could see the pain on their comrades’ faces from a few meters away. It had to be painful. It was fine, though. They would be okay after a while.","As it turned out, all the male soldiers who were kicked, hit, and kicked by Ye Jian were in pain for three days. One week later, the pain completely disappeared.","Getting kicked and punched by her was even more painful than being hit by iron.","What did she eat? Why was she so strong?","After half an hour, the male soldier who was hit by Ye Jian’s elbow on his right leg said gloomily, \"Why are you so strong? You’re not like a lady at all. Were you born with super strength?\"","Ye Jian thought for a moment and smiled. \"No. In the past, when I was training, I’d put on iron boots that weighed five kilograms to run. If I ran slow, I’d have to tie five more kilograms worth of sandbags around my legs.\"","The male soldiers were stunned while the female soldiers were dumbfounded."]},{"number":5200,"title":"Chapter 5200: You Will Cry After The Satisfaction","paragraphs":["Wearing iron boots and tying sandbags around her legs... What kind of training was that? Why was the training of the army comrades getting more and more brutal? They actually didn’t know about this at all.","\"Why would you wear iron boots for training? To train your legs?\" The male soldier who was beaten badly remained standing on one leg as he asked humbly, \"How many training sessions?\"","Ye Jian lifted up her foot, which had gained a lot of strength since she \"escaped\" from the Demon King’s hands. She wiped away the fine sand that had gotten into her mouth and patiently explained, \"Two months of training with iron boots, and then after that, I tied sandbags around my legs. That greatly improved my leg strength.\"","The male soldier nodded. \"I see. So that’s how you’re able to throw male soldiers to the ground while standing upside down.\"","\"Yes, I can successfully counter-attack in one go. Check your bodies first. I’ll go and take a look at the female soldiers. They were beaten up badly by you tonight. Be careful. We’ll fight back sooner or later.\"","The male soldiers felt a little uncomfortable when they heard this. They muttered and explained, \"There’s no helping it. Even if the military orders are difficult, we have no choice but to obey the captain’s orders. How can we dare not obey?","\"We’ll wait to be beaten up by the female soldiers. It’ll be fun if we fight on equal ground. Tonight, only you and the few of us had a good fight. The rest performed below average. They were knocked down in less than ten minutes. They’re too weak. It’s boring even if we fight.\"","Ye Jian touched her forehead and sighed. \"It’s three against one. Of course, it’s boring. Things will definitely be fun if we have a one-on-one fight one day.\"","\"Haha, okay, we’ll wait for a one-on-one fight. Go check on them for us. We don’t want them to be traumatized by this or they won’t dare to compete with us again.\"","It was a proud and qualified answer.","Ye Jian raised her eyebrows and said with a faint smile, \"Just you wait.\" Amidst the laughter of the male soldiers, she quickened her pace and returned to the female soldier class.","\"You’re in trouble! Ye Jian told you to wait. The next time, you’ll definitely be the one getting beaten up. It’s good to boast for a moment, but you’ll cry after that.\"","\"Pfft, do you think you can escape? Don’t worry, comrade. Our captain will make good arrangements. You wait for Ye Jian too.\"","After the fight ended, the wind that blew past the training ground became less fierce. The female soldiers wiped the sand off their lips. All of them were injured, their faces distorted from the beating. Their bodies felt as if they had been run over by a car. Every part of them hurt.","Even so, the female soldiers didn’t let themselves make a sound due to the pain. Even if they had broken their teeth, they would just swallow them.","Seeing that Ye Jian had come over, the female soldiers’ faces finally showed a hint of clarity. They lost, but at least Ye Jian won. Even when it was five against one, Ye Jian didn’t suffer. The male soldiers were the ones who suffered.","At least one of them won and not all of them were wiped out.","Captain Lei, who was talking to the squad leader of the female class, only looked up when Ye Jian walked over.","Wearing iron boots was part of the training that the navy’s water ghosts went through, and Ye Jian had direct shooting experience at sea. Could it be that she had also participated in training with the navy comrades?","The female soldiers surrounded Ye Jian. Although they were beaten up until their bodies hurt, it didn’t stop them from being curious about Ye Jian. From one against three to one against four and one against five, Ye Jian never lost to the male soldiers even after half an hour. Putting aside the technical training of the airborne soldiers, the female soldiers were really convinced by Ye Jian in just one day."]}]);
